ce by 10.00% when equipped."},{"id":2413,"name":"aa Uhtag Y","type":11,"icon":733,"level":9,"price":3200000,"stack":1,"description":"A fragment of Ancient technology.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 9 Device Tech","effects":"Cripple Weapons (Activated)\nDecreases Weapons Damage by 37% for 270 seconds to enemy when activated.\n\nSee Cloaked (Equip)\nAllows a ships scanners to detect cloaked objects when equipped.\n\nScan Boost (Equip)\nAllows ship scanners to see 3420 units farther when equipped.\n\nImproved Beam Handling (Equip)\nIncreases Beam Accuracy by 3.30 Skill Level(s) when equipped.\n\nEnhance Missiles (Equip)\nIncreases Missile Damage by 30.0% when equipped."},{"id":2313,"name":"aa Uhtak An Ne","type":11,"icon":733,"level":8,"price":6200,"stack":1,"description":"A fragment of Ancient technology.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 8 Device Tech","effects":"Weaken Psionic (Activated)\n-30.0 Psionic Resist for 240 seconds to enemy when activated.\n\nWeaken Energy (Activated)\n-30.0 Energy Deflect for 240 seconds to enemy when activated.\n\nImproved Befriend (Equip)\nImproves Befriend Effectiveness by 3.53 Skill Level(s) when equipped."},{"id":5824,"name":"aa Yt An","type":11,"icon":733,"level":7,"price":401527,"stack":1,"description":"A fragment of Ancient technology.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 7 Device Tech","effects":"Weapon Energy Drain (Activated)\nIncrease Weapon Energy Cost by 30.00% for 210 seconds on enemy when activated.\n\nWeaken Plasma (Activated)\n-30.0 Plasma Deflect for 210 seconds to enemy when activated.\n\nImproved Psionic Shield (Equip)\nIncreases Psionic Shield Damage absorption by 94 to 2820, depending on ability used and increases duration of shield by 282 seconds when equipped.\n\nDeflect Energy (Equip)\n+30 Energy Deflect when equipped."},{"id":2314,"name":"aa Yt An Ne","type":11,"icon":733,"level":8,"pric