","effects":"Equipment Engineering (Equip)\nReduces equipment install time by 25% when equipped.\n\nIncrease Speed (Equip)\nIncreases ship top speed by 20 when equipped.\n\nDeflect Energy (Equip)\n+17 Energy Deflect when equipped.\n\nWarp Charge (Equip)\nDecreases warp engage/cooldown times by 12% when equipped."},{"id":3429,"name":"Acid Bath","type":13,"icon":1482,"level":3,"price":3333,"stack":20,"description":"Synthesized from: Sulfur, Chromium\nUsed for etching glasses and cleaning metal parts. Always add acid to water, never water to acid!","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5937,"name":"Acidic Blood","type":13,"icon":2401,"level":3,"price":984,"stack":60,"description":"Highly corrosive space blood, use extreme caution while handling.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3511,"name":"Adamantine","type":13,"icon":1486,"level":6,"price":8643,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Adamantine Ore","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":2948,"name":"Adamantine Ore","type":13,"icon":1483,"level":6,"price":216,"stack":300,"description":"Refines to: Adamantine","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3456,"name":"Adhesive","type":13,"icon":1482,"level":4,"price":2591,"stack":20,"description":"Refined from: Derfresser Phlegm and Glamour Goo.\nThis super sticky substance retains its gooey qualities under virtually any enviromental condition.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3640,"name":"Adorable Class 3 Shield","type":2,"icon":897,"level":2,"price":6312,"stack":1,"description":"Tada-O! Big! Strong! Wow!\nWhen equipped this item gives an increase to your Repair Equipment Skill.","manufacturer":"Tada-O","stats":"Skill required: Shield Tech\nRequirement: Level 2 Shield Tech\nShield capacity: 131\nShield recharge / sec: 2.6","effects":"Improved Repair Equipment (Equip)\nDecrease repair time by 5.00% when equipped."},{"id":1911,"name":"Advanced Drone Detector Array","type":11,"icon":650,"level":3,"price":13223,"s