 EMP (Activated)\nAn Irresistable -5.1 debuff to Chemical and EMP Resists for 252 seconds to enemy when activated."},{"id":1663,"name":"Advanced Structural Fastener","type":13,"icon":1481,"level":9,"price":495621,"stack":60,"description":"H5M1NH6BR3DS2C4ND1R6ST1G2","manufacturer":"Vrix","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":2320,"name":"Advanced Weapon Control System","type":11,"icon":2175,"level":8,"price":4185809,"stack":1,"description":"BlackSun Device\nExperimental Device. Use at own risk.\nAn advanced device that provides an extra level of weapon control, resulting in more damage. Also increases maximum reactor capacity.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 8 Device Tech","effects":"Beam Focus (Equip)\nIncreases Beam Damage by 3.0% when equipped.\n\nMissile Precision (Equip)\nIncreases Missile Damage by 3.0% when equipped\n\nProjectile Force (Equip)\nIncreases Projectile Damage by 3.0% when equipped.\n\nIncrease Reactor Capacity (Equip)\n+926 Reactor Capacity when equipped."},{"id":5139,"name":"Aegis of the Warder","type":11,"icon":1011,"level":7,"price":411587,"stack":1,"description":"This device is of unknown origin.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 7 Device Tech","effects":"Turbo Weapons (Activated)\nReduces Weapons Delay by 5% for 1980 seconds when activated.\n\nImproved Shield Inversion (Equip)\nImproves Shield Inversion duration by 6.00  seconds while equipped.\n\nImproved Psionic Shield (Equip)\nIncreases Psionic Shield Damage absorption by 7500 to 10500, depending on ability used and increases duration of shield by 270 seconds when equipped.\n\nImproved Hacking (Equip)\nImproves Hacking Success by 83% when equipped.\n\nIncrease Shield Capacity (Equip)\n+6285 Shield Capacity when equipped."},{"id":3599,"name":"Aesirium","type":13,"icon":1486,"level":9,"price":187816,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Aserium Ore.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3004,"name":"Aesirium Ore","type":13,"icon":1483,"level":9,"price":3756,"stack":300,"description":"Refines to: Aesirium","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5286,"name":"Aganjumite","type":13,"icon":2361,"level":1,"price":68,"stack":1,"description":"Raw material mined from the rocks of Aganju. It is said to have properties that amplify Psi abilities but so far this has not been prooven. \n\nRumor has it that there is a buyer on Somerled station but what it is used for is still a mystery.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3360,"name":"Agate","type":13,"icon":1468,"level":1,"price":17,"stack":60,"description":"TRADE GEM Refined from: Raw Agate\nAn opaque, banded, semi-precious stone that occurs in a wide variety of colors.  ","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3430,"name":"Aggregate","type":13,"icon":1489,"level":3,"price":3854,"stack":60,"description":"Aggregate is used in the creation of cement and is usually composed of rocks, sand, gravel or ore in varying quantities.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5106,"name":"Air Scrubbers","type":13,"icon":740,"level":1,"price":43,"stack":1,"description":"Special Equipment is required to remove carbon dioxide and toxic fumes and recirculate air in the confines of space and hostile planet environments.\n\nAir Scrubbers are needed at Loki Station and Arx Spartoi.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":2890,"name":"Alanite","type":13,"icon":191,"level":3,"price":11,"stack":300,"description":"Refines to: Liquid Alanium","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3431,"name":"Alexandrite","type":13,"icon":1468,"level":3,"price":716,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Raw Alexandrite\n\nA transparent form of Chrysoberl that reflects differently under artificial than it does under natural light. Speciality laser makers have employed this change to good effect.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5965,"name":"Alien Antenna","type":13,"icon":1369,"level":8,"price":2455,"stack":60,"description":"This antenna is part of an space creature's sensory apparatus, and is designed to pick up radio signals.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5974,"name":"Alien Appendage","type":13,"icon":1373,"level":9,"price":2894,"stack":1,"description":"This alien appendage is badly mangled and almost unrecognizable.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":6155,"name":"Alien Artifact","type":13,"icon":733,"level":2,"price":657,"stack":60,"description":"Medium Sized, emblazoned with indecipherable runes. Slight burn marks at narrow end of the device. Label reads:\"From modara Maelstrom. Usage unkown, possibly an explosive. Handle with care.\"","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5526,"name":"Alien Data Fragment 1","type":13,"icon":730,"level":1,"price":387,"stack":60,"description":"Computer: (Translated Alien Data.) The Heart of the Womb imbues it's energy upon the Reaper and it's spores when they come into contact wiyh it.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5543,"name":"Alien Data Fragment 2","type":13,"icon":730,"level":1,"price":354,"stack":60,"description":"Computer: (Translated Alien Data)\nReapers and their Energized Spores have been found to do immense damage to the Warposts. Keep these creatures from the posts or they will compromise the Shield Bubble.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5547,"name":"Alien Data Fragment 3","type":13,"icon":730,"level":1,"price":359,"stack":60,"description":"Computer: (Translated Alien Data)\nReapers can be found throughout the asteroid field in the center of Mazzaroth. Find them and destroy them.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5556,"name":"Alien DNA GeneMap Fragment","type":13,"icon":1371,"level":5,"price":0,"stack":1,"description":"This genetic material is incomplete but may be turned in for study anyway. The Sabine Genetic Repostitory must surely be interested in even a fragment of unknown DNA.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5954,"name":"Alien Exoskeleton","type":13,"icon":2223,"level":6,"price":1885,"stack":60,"description":"A hard, chitinous material used as protection by several space-born life forms.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5877,"name":"Alien Terninal Override v8.0","type":18,"icon":1013,"level":8,"price":2657,"stack":10,"description":"This odd item is obviously not Ten-gu technology, it appears that it may aid in manufacturing.\n\nMode:                    Manufacturing, Analyze\nBuild Value            0.8 levels\nCritical                    5%","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":868,"name":"Alluring Laser Class J","type":14,"icon":766,"level":4,"price":31387,"stack":1,"description":"When equipped, the tada-O Alluring Laser Class J gives increased Hacking Skill and increased Rally Skill.\nTada-O Corporation Alluring Laser Class J. Honorable client's want is now peaking for Alluring Laser Class J special item order only. Tada-O! Big! Strong! Wow! ","manufacturer":"Tada-O","stats":"Weapon damage: 15\nDamage type: Energy\nEnergy use: 20\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 4 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1300\nReload (sec): 2","effects":"Improved Hacking (Equip)\nImproves Hacking Success by 42% when equipped.\n\nImproved Rally (Equip)\nImproves Rally effectiveness by 1.40 Skill Level(s) when equipped."},{"id":3824,"name":"Alpha BBO","type":13,"icon":1932,"level":1,"price":348,"stack":300,"description":"This may be a simple crystal, you are uncertain.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5111,"name":"Alpha Centauri Fruit","type":13,"icon":1289,"level":3,"price":251,"stack":1,"description":"Juicy bits of sweet goodness that supply vitamin C and other important nutrients to the body. These are grown all over Alpha Centauri then packaged at EarthCorps Command, marked up, and shipped out under nitrogen.\n\nEarth Station trades in many fruit varieties.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","eff