lanets.\n\nThe Mines of 61 Cygni are in constant need of these precious items as the mine air grows quickly stale without them.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":2467,"name":"Atrophy Novem","type":11,"icon":1017,"level":9,"price":3303174,"stack":1,"description":"Sparta!  When the Call comes, be ready.\nWhen activated on a targeted enemy, this item causes a reduction to target's Beam Weapon skill.\nWhen equipped this item causes a small increase to your projectile weapon energy cost, but gives an increase to your projectile weapon range and a reduction to your projectile weapon delay time.","manufacturer":"Sparta","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 9 Device Tech","effects":"Worsen Beam Handling (Activated)\nReduces Beam Damage by 30.00% and Beam Accuracy by 12.00% for 216.00 seconds to enemy when activated.\n\nBoost Projectile Range (Equip)\nIncreases Projectile Range by 46% when equipped.\n\nTurbo Projectile (Equip)\nReduce Projectile Delay by 27.50% when equipped\n\nProjectile Friction (Equip)\nIncreases Projectile Energy Cost by 10.00% when equipped."},{"id":2375,"name":"Atrophy Octo","type":11,"icon":1017,"level":8,"price":1244997,"stack":1,"description":"Sparta! When the Call comes, be ready.\nWhen activated on a targeted enemy, this item causes a reduction to target's Beam Weapon skill.\nWhen equipped this item gives an increase to your projectile weapon range.","manufacturer":"Sparta","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 8 Device Tech","effects":"Worsen Beam Handling (Activated)\nReduces Beam Damage by 26.70% and Beam Accuracy by 10.70% for 192.00 seconds to enemy when activated.\n\nBoost Projectile Range (Equip)\nIncreases Projectile Range by 42% when equipped."},{"id":2002,"name":"Atrophy Quattuor","type":11,"icon":1011,"level":4,"price":33476,"stack":1,"description":"Sparta! When the Call comes, be ready.\nWhen activated on a targeted enemy, this item causes a reduction to target's Beam Weapon skill.","manufacturer":"Sparta","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 4 Device Tech","effects":"Worsen Beam Handling (Activated)\nReduces Beam Damage by 13.30% and Beam Accuracy by 5.30% for 96.00 seconds to enemy when activated."},{"id":2092,"name":"Atrophy Quinque","type":11,"icon":1014,"level":5,"price":71894,"stack":1,"description":"Sparta! When the Call comes, be ready.\nWhen activated on a targeted enemy, this item causes a reduction to target's Beam Weapon skill.\nWhen equipped this item causes a small increase to your projectile weapon delay times, but gives an increase to your projectile weapon range.","manufacturer":"Sparta","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 5 Device Tech","effects":"Worsen Beam Handling (Activated)\nReduces Beam Damage by 16.70% and Beam Accuracy by 6.70% for 120.00 seconds to enemy when activated.\n\nBoost Projectile Range (Equip)\nIncreases Projectile Range by 30% when equipped.\n\nSlow Projectiles (Equip)\nDecrease Projectile Firing Rate by 10.00% when equipped"},{"id":2182,"name":"Atrophy Senio","type":11,"icon":1014,"level":6,"price":168410,"stack":1,"description":"Sparta! When the Call comes, be ready.\nWhen activated on a targeted enemy, this item causes a reduciton to target's Beam Weapon skill.\nWhen equipped this item causes a small increase to your projectile weapon delay times, but gives an increase to your projectile weapon range.","manufacturer":"Sparta","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 6 Device Tech","effects":"Worsen Beam Handling (Activated)\nReduces Beam Damage by 20.00% and Beam Accuracy by 8.00% for 144.00 seconds to enemy when activated.\n\nBoost Projectile Range (Equip)\nIncreases Projectile Range by 34% when equipped.\n\nSlow Projectiles (Equip)\nDecrease Projectile Firing Rate by 10.00% when equipped"},{"id":2273,"name":"Atrophy Septem","type":11,"icon":1017,"level":7,"price":510474,"stack":1,"description":"Sparta! When the Call comes, be ready.\nWhen acti