 energy as well as its shields. When equipped, the Sparta Axe Quartus gives increased Prospect Skill and increased Shield Regeneration. Sparta. When the Call comes, be ready. ","manufacturer":"Sparta","stats":"Weapon damage: 182\nDamage type: EMP\nEnergy use: 96\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 7 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1400\nReload (sec): 7","effects":"Prospect Skill (Equip)\nIncreases Prospecting Effectiveness by 2.67 Skill Level(s) when equipped.\n\nRecharge Shields (Equip)\n+38.0% Shield Recharge when equipped."},{"id":5345,"name":"Axe Secondus","type":14,"icon":780,"level":5,"price":75056,"stack":1,"description":"The Sparta Axe Secondus will drain your target's energy as well as its shields. When equipped, the Sparta Axe Secondus gives increased Prospect Skill and increased Shield Regeneration. Sparta. When the Call comes, be ready. ","manufacturer":"","stats":"Weapon damage: 71\nDamage type: EMP\nEnergy use: 72\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 5 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1200\nReload (sec): 7","effects":"Prospect Skill (Equip)\nIncreases Prospecting Effectiveness by 2.00 Skill Level(s) when equipped.\n\nRecharge Shields (Equip)\n+30.0% Shield Recharge when equipped."},{"id":1064,"name":"Axe Tertius","type":14,"icon":780,"level":6,"price":162663,"stack":1,"description":"The Sparta Axe Tertius will drain your target's energy as well as its shields. When equipped, the Sparta Axe Teritus gives increased Prospect Skill and increased Shield Regeneration. Sparta. When the Call comes, be ready. ","manufacturer":"Sparta","stats":"Weapon damage: 114\nDamage type: EMP\nEnergy use: 83\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 6 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1300\nReload (sec): 7","effects":"Prospect Skill (Equip)\nIncreases Prospecting Effectiveness by 2.33 Skill Level(s) when equipped.\n\nRecharge Shields (Equip)\n+34.0% Shield Recharge when equipped."},{"id":3479,"name":"Azure Amalgam","type":13,"icon":189,"level":5,"price":1255,"stack":60,"description":"A compound that is made by combining Sapphire, Liquid Halon, and Radium.\n","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3633,"name":"Azure Scale","type":2,"icon":900,"level":2,"price":6084,"stack":1,"description":"The BlackSun Scale Series of shield generators are crafted specifically for members of Red Dragon Tongs. The Blue Scales were created specifically for the officers of the Lan Leung tong.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Shield Tech\nRequirement: Level 2 Shield Tech\nShield capacity: 176\nShield recharge / sec: 3.1","effects":""},{"id":3481,"name":"B-Silicon","type":13,"icon":1481,"level":5,"price":6900,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Purified Solar Silicon and Boron\nExcellent for solar applications.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3331,"name":"B1TTL2 R21CT4R - F4RM 8","type":7,"icon":703,"level":8,"price":1302798,"stack":1,"description":"This V'rix-made reactor is built as the perfect tool for their supporting troops in battle.","manufacturer":"Vrix","stats":"Skill required: Reactor Tech\nRequirement: Level 8 Reactor Tech\nReactor capacity: 4100\nReactor recharge / sec: 43.9","effects":"Turbo (Activated)\nIncreases ship top speed by 120% for 10 seconds when activated.\n\nEnhance Beam (Equip)\nIncreases Beam Damage by 22.0% when equipped.\n\nEnhance Projectiles (Equip)\nIncreases Projectile Damage by 22.0% when equipped."},{"id":3356,"name":"B1TTL2 R21CT4R - F4RM 9","type":7,"icon":2180,"level":9,"price":2987233,"stack":1,"description":"This V'rix-made reactor is built as the perfect tool for their supporting troops in battle.","manufacturer":"Vrix","stats":"Skill required: Reactor Tech\nRequirement: Level 9 Reactor Tech\nReactor capacity: 6149\nReactor recharge / sec: 59.9","effects":"Turbo (Activated)\nIncreases ship top speed by 120% for 10 seconds when activated.\n\nEnhance Beam (Equip)\nIncreases Beam Damage by 22.0% when equipped.\n\nEnhance Projectiles (Equip)\nIncreases Projectile Damage by 22.0% when equipped."},{"id":760,"name":"B5RN3NGP13N","type":10,"icon":709,"level":9,"price":452,"stack":1200,"description":"2MP4W2R3NGH2PH12ST5S  ","manufacturer":"Vrix","stats":"Ammunition: B5RN3NG\nWeapon damage: 1030\nDamage type: Explosive\nSkill required: Missile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 9 Missile Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 5900","effects":""},{"id":3316,"name":"B5RN3NGS5N","type":7,"icon":703,"level":8,"price":7622619,"stack":1,"description":"1D1PT2DH5M1NT2CHN4L4G6S2C3NDST1G2","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Reactor Tech\nRequirement: Level 8 Reactor Tech\nReactor capacity: 4100\nReactor recharge / sec: 43.9","effects":"Reactor Renewal (Equip)\n+4.6% Reactor Recharge when equipped.\n\nMissile Precision (Equip)\nIncreases Missile Damage by 3.0% when equipped\n\nScan Boost (Equip)\nAllows ship scanners to see 2360 units farther when equipped."},{"id":5921,"name":"Baby Jenquai Bone","type":13,"icon":1373,"level":1,"price":450,"stack":250,"description":"The Bone from a Baby Jenquai. This will come in handy for use with the \"Good Luck Charm.\"","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5914,"name":"Baby Moon Eater","type":13,"icon":2143,"level":9,"price":0,"stack":1,"description":"A Baby Moon Eater, smaller version of a Planet Eater. Momma should be close by, to this little child.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5975,"name":"Baby Space Slug","type":13,"icon":2326,"level":9,"price":2851,"stack":60,"description":"Space slugs often 'ride' other, larger life forms, allowing them to move between asteroid fields.\n","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":1180,"name":"Backyard Solar Kit","type":13,"icon":726,"level":1,"price":50124,"stack":20,"description":"This handy kit contains everything you need to learn how to build your own solar collector to power small objects. Sunlight is not included!  ","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5225,"name":"Bacteria","type":13,"icon":145,"level":1,"price":51,"stack":1,"description":"Harmless bacteria used in testing medicines.\n\nMedicines are synthesized on Kinshasa-Mbali.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":1319,"name":"Bailing Wire","type":13,"icon":1478,"level":3,"price":170,"stack":20,"description":"Wire for bailing...duh!","manufacturer":"Bogeril","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":2626,"name":"Bald Eagle","type":6,"icon":968,"level":8,"price":1160606,"stack":1,"description":"GETCO: Continuing our 500 year tradition of sustainable development. \nWhen equipped this item gives an increase to your maneuverability and increase your missle range.","manufacturer":"GETco","stats":"Skill required: Engine Tech\nRequirement: Level 8 Engine Tech\nEngine signature: 5300\nImpulse speed: 176\nWarp speed: 4000\nFree-warp energy / sec: 28.2","effects":"Increase Maneuverability (Equip)\nIncreases turn rate by 46% when equipped.\n\nBoost Missile Range (Equip)\nIncreases Missile Range by 28% when equipped."},{"id":3604,"name":"Balderium","type":13,"icon":187,"level":9,"price":146882,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Balderium Ore","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3007,"name":"Balderium Ore","type":13,"icon":1483,"level":9,"price":2938,"stack":300,"description":"Refines to: Balderium","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3889,"name":"Balm Injector","type":11,"icon":992,"level":1,"price":30413,"stack":1,"description":"The streamlined design of this device is designed to allow the rapid delivery of consummate balm.  Unfortunately, the instability of the propellent makes the device dangerous to store and impossible to keep on hand for more than a few hours.  Handle with Care!","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 1 Device Tech","effects":""},{"id":2632,"name":"Banded Hawk","type":6,"icon":961,"level":8,"price":1233563,"stack":1,"description":"GETCo: Continuing our 500 year tradition of sustainable development. When equipped this item causes an increase to engine damage, but gives an increase to your maneuverability.\n","manufacturer":"GETco","stats":"Skill required: Engine Tech\nRequirement: Level 8 Engine Tech\nEngine signature: 6000\nImpulse speed: 172\nWarp speed: 3750\nFree-warp energy / sec: 32.5","effects":"Increase Maneuverability (Activated)\nIncrease turn rate by 46% for 0 seconds when activated.\n\nEquipment Damage Magnification - Engine (Equip)\nDecreases a engine's effectiveness at sustaining damage by 20% when equipped."},{"id":5342,"name":"Bandy's Boosters","type":6,"icon":950,"level":2,"price":3925,"stack":1,"description":"This set of thrusters was a gift from Rashid Bandy for following the path of the Sharim traders.\n\nThey are a modified set of Mercurious IC20 engines, made specificaly for the Seeker ship design allowing them to cloak faster.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Engine Tech\nRequirement: Level 2 Engine Tech\nEngine signature: 500\nImpulse speed: 80\nWarp speed: 2500\nFree-warp energy / sec: 7.2","effects":"Improved Cloaking (Equip)\nReduces Cloaking Engage Time by 1.0 seconds (to a minimum of 3 seconds), makes the target harder to detect with See Cloaking, and increases Stealth Strike time when equipped."},{"id":5443,"name":"Banjo","type":13,"icon":1373,"level":1,"price":325,"stack":100,"description":"A Bogeril musical instrument, made of bone and wire. ","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3916,"name":"Barbed Fishing Hook","type":13,"icon":2403,"level":5,"price":53458,"stack":20,"description":"Huge spikes radiate from a central core of glop and cement. This heavy-duty barbed hook could only be used with exceptionally strong fishing line.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3537,"name":"Barine","type":13,"icon":1481,"level":7,"price":21439,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Raw Barite","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":2891,"name":"Barite","type":13,"icon":191,"level":3,"price":19,"stack":300,"description":"Refines to: Barium","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3432,"name":"Barium","type":13,"icon":1482,"level":3,"price":764,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Barite\nA silvery-white metal used in glassmaking, rubber making, and a veriety of other applications.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":2559,"name":"Barn Owl","type":6,"icon":956,"level":4,"price":29350,"stack":1,"description":"GETCo: Continuing our 500 year tradition of sustainable development.\nWhen equipped this item causes an increase to engine damage, but gives an increase to your maneuverability.","manufacturer":"GETco","stats":"Skill required: Engine Tech\nRequirement: Level 4 Engine Tech\nEngine signature: 3900\nImpulse speed: 112\nWarp speed: 2750\nFree-warp energy / sec: 14.5","effects":"Equipment Damage Magnification - Engine (Equip)\nDecreases a engine's effectiveness at sustaining damage by 20% when equipped.\n\nIncrease Maneuverability (Equip)\nIncreases turn rate by 33% when equipped."},{"id":2536,"name":"Baron Cimetiere's Afefe","type":6,"icon":2177,"level":3,"price":11110,"stack":1,"description":"BlackSun Afefe-class engines are commonly equipped by low-ranking Red Dragon Tong members.\n","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Engine Tech\nRequirement: Level 3 Engine Tech\nEngine signature: 2500\nImpulse speed: 100\nWarp speed: 2750\nFree-warp energy / sec: 9.1","effects":"Equipment Damage Control - Engine (Equip)\nIncreases your engine's effectiveness at sustaining damage by 45% when equipped."},{"id":3655,"name":"Baron Cimetiere's Ala","type":2,"icon":897,"level":3,"price":10124,"stack":1,"description":"Cesar Escoto y Montoya \"found\" the recipe for a similar engine inside one of the BlackSun's manufacturing plants.  Cimentiere then devoted his discovery to Baron Cimentiere reaping the rewards of exclusive distribution rights to his \"new\" shield.\n\nAny damage taken to this shield is reduced.\n\n\n","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Shield Tech\nRequirement: Level 3 Shield Tech\nShield capacity: 412\nShield recharge / sec: 7.2","effects":"Equipment Damage Control - Shields (Equip)\nIncreases your shield's effectiveness at sustaining damage by 45% when equipped."},{"id":2715,"name":"Baron Cimetiere's Ara","type":15,"icon":806,"level":4,"price":36461,"stack":1,"description":"Baron Cimetiere's Ara was recently found by Ana Cristobal at the bottom of a crate of Baron Cimetiere's Aruns.  Such packing mistakes are grounds for execution in Chavez society.\n\nBaron Cimetiere's Ara reduces damage to weapons and increases Missile Weapon skills.\n\nThis launcher uses Chavez Ara Missiles.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Ammunition: New Chavez Missiles\nEnergy use: 44\nSkill required: Missile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 4 Missile Weapon\nReload (sec): 6.4\nRounds per shot: 1","effects":"Improved Missile Handling (Equip)\nImproved Missile Accuracy by 1.40 Skill Level(s) when equipped.\n\nEquipment Damage Control - Weapons (Equip)\nIncreases your weapons' effectiveness at sustaining damage by 50% when equipped."},{"id":3227,"name":"Baron Cimetiere's Eje","type":7,"icon":875,"level":3,"price":15002,"stack":1,"description":"BlackSun Reactors.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Reactor Tech\nRequirement: Level 3 Reactor Tech\nReactor capacity: 531\nReactor recharge / sec: 9.9","effects":""},{"id":5587,"name":"Baron Cimetiere's Iku","type":14,"icon":786,"level":4,"price":29145,"stack":1,"description":"Baron Cimetiere's Iku was given to Diego Ramires as part of a payment to get Rafael Torres out of slavery. Once freed, Rafael stole Baron Cimetiere's Iku from his old master,disabled his ship, and then disabled Diego piece by piece.\n\nBaron Cimetiere's Iku decreases the damage done to weapons and increases Beam Weapon skills.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Weapon damage: 16\nDamage type: EMP\nEnergy use: 18\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 4 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1400\nReload (sec): 2","effects":"Equipment Damage Control - Weapons (Equip)\nIncreases your weapons' effectiveness at sustaining damage by 285% when equipped.\n\nImproved Beam Handling (Equip)\nImproves Beam Accuracy by 1.93 Skill Level(s) when equipped."},{"id":3083,"name":"Baron Cimetieres Arun","type":16,"icon":843,"level":4,"price":29685,"stack":1,"description":"Baron Cimetiere's Arun was recently found by Aimara Castillo y Lobo in a crate of Baron Cimetiere's Aras. The person responsible for such a heinous packing error is surely the same person responsible for placing one of Baron Cimentiere's Aras in a crate of Baron Cimentiere's Aruns. Baron Cimentiere's Arun reduces the amount of damage dealt to weapons and increases Projectile Weapon skill.\n\nThis projectile weapon uses Chavez Arun ammunition.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Ammunition: New Chavez Ammo\nEnergy use: 9\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 4 Projectile Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 3300\nReload (sec): 1.1\nRounds per shot: 1","effects":"Equipment Damage Control - Weapons (Equip)\nIncreases your weapons' effectiveness at sustaining damage by 57% when equipped.\n\nProjectile Weapon Skill (Equip)\nIncreases Projectile Accuracy by 1.90 Skill Level(s) when equipped."},{"id":3674,"name":"Baron La Criox's Ala","type":2,"icon":904,"level":4,"price":32155,"stack":1,"description":"Hector Ariola Marquez learned much from the Patakis of Baron La Croix, including how to make this shield disappear from a Terran convoy. \n\nBaron La Croix's Ala controls damage dealt to this shield and increases combat speed.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Shield Tech\nRequirement: Level 4 Shield Tech\nShield capacity: 1031\nShield recharge / sec: 14.6","effects":"Equipment Damage Control - Shields (Equip)\nIncreases your shield's effectiveness at sustaining damage by 52% when equipped.\n\nIncrease Speed (Equip)\nIncreases ship top speed by 64 when equipped."},{"id":2722,"name":"Baron La Croix's Ara","type":15,"icon":806,"level":5,"price":85076,"stack":1,"description":"Gabriel Mendoza y Ramos stole Baron La Croix's Ara from the Baron's disciples. Gabriel has since used it to lay waste to trade vessels thereby becoming a very rich and powerful member of Chavez society. Learning of a proposed death with upon him issued by the disciples, Gabriel now regularly deducts ten percent of his earnings to be given to Baron La Croix's followers.\n\nBaron La Croix's Ara reduces the amount of damage taken to weapons, increases Missile Weapon skill, and increases scanning range.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Ammunition: New Chavez Missiles\nEnergy use: 62\nSkill required: Missile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 5 Missile Weapon\nReload (sec): 8.3\nRounds per shot: 2","effects":"Improved Missile Handling (Equip)\nImproved Missile Accuracy by 1.67 Skill Level(s) when equipped.\n\nEquipment Damage Control - Weapons (Equip)\nIncreases your weapons' effectiveness at sustaining damage by 53% when equipped.\n\nScan Boost (Equip)\nAllows ship scanners to see 1280 units farther when equipped."},{"id":3105,"name":"Baron La Croix's Arun","type":16,"icon":843,"level":5,"price":38441,"stack":1,"description":"A devoted follower of Baron La Croix. Michaela Fernandez -Marquez was granted the use of Baron La Croix's Arun after fulfilling the trials of Omi, Afefe, Ina, and Oke. Baron La Croix's Arun controls the amount of damage done to weapons, increase Projectile Weapon skill, and increases scanning range.\n\nThis projectile weapon uses Chavez Arun ammunition.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Ammunition: New Chavez Ammo\nEnergy use: 19\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 5 Projectile Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 3400\nReload (sec): 2.2\nRounds per shot: 3","effects":"Equipment Damage Control - Weapons (Equip)\nIncreases your weapons' effectiveness at sustaining damage by 64% when equipped.\n\nImproved Projectile Handling (Equip)\nIncreases Projectile Accuracy by 2.33 Skill Level(s)  when equipped.\n\nScan Boost (Equip)\nAllows ship scanners to see 2205 units farther when equipped."},{"id":987,"name":"Baron La Croix's Iku","type":14,"icon":786,"level":5,"price":65712,"stack":1,"description":"Maria Escaler is probably the only woman to have successfullyBlackmailled Miguel Chavez. The amount she got out of him was undeclosed, but he was so impressed by her abilities, he hired her on and gave her one of his own EMP beam weapons as a gesture of good faith. She kept his money.\n\nBaron La Croix's Iku reduces the amount of damage taken to weapons, increases Beam Weapon skills and increases scanning range.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Weapon damage: 25\nDamage type: EMP\nEnergy use: 20\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 5 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1500\nReload (sec): 2","effects":"Equipment Damage Control - Weapons (Equip)\nIncreases your weapons' effectiveness at sustaining damage by 65% when equipped.\n\nImproved Beam Handling (Equip)\nIncreases Beam Accuracy by 2.30 Skill Level(s) when equipped.\n\nScan Boost (Equip)\nAllows ship scanners to see 2250 units farther when equipped."},{"id":2571,"name":"Baron laCroix's Afefe","type":6,"icon":968,"level":5,"price":59821,"stack":1,"description":"Rafael Torres reacquired this engine for the Chavez by stopping a Red Dragon transport and asking the pilot nicely if Baron IaCroix could have it. After sufficient persuasion, the pilot reluctanly agreed. \n\nIaCroix's Afefe increases reactor and shield recharge rates, and help control damage inflicted upon the engine.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Engine Tech\nRequirement: Level 5 Engine Tech\nEngine signature: 3300\nImpulse speed: 130\nWarp speed: 3250\nFree-warp energy / sec: 16.9","effects":""},{"id":3252,"name":"Baron laCroix's Eje","type":7,"icon":873,"level":4,"price":29577,"stack":1,"description":"","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Reactor Tech\nRequirement: Level 4 Reactor Tech\nReactor capacity: 943\nReactor recharge / sec: 14.9","effects":""},{"id":2579,"name":"Baron Samedi's Afefe","type":6,"icon":702,"level":5,"price":68975,"stack":1,"description":"Rafael Torres reacquired this engine for the Chavez by stopping a Red Dragon transport and asking the pilot nicely if Samedi could have it. After sufficient persuasion, the pilot reluctanly agreed. Baron Samedi then gave it to his mistress, Gabriela Cabrerea de Leon. She used it to fly into the arms of another lover.\n\nSamedi's Afefe increases reactor and shield recharge rates, and help control damage inflicted upon the engine.\n\n\nEffect:\nEquipment Damage Control-Engine  \nRecharge Reactor (equip)\nRecharge Shield (equip)\n","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Engine Tech\nRequirement: Level 5 Engine Tech\nEngine signature: 3300\nImpulse speed: 130\nWarp speed: 3250\nFree-warp energy / sec: 16.9","effects":"Equipment Damage Control - Engine (Equip)\nIncreases your engine's effectiveness at sustaining damage by 50% when equipped.\n\nRecharge Reactor (Equip)\n+2.5 Reactor Recharge when equipped.\n\nRecharge Shields (Equip)\n+30.0% Shield Recharge when equipped."},{"id":3703,"name":"Baron Samedi's Ala","type":2,"icon":911,"level":5,"price":69551,"stack":1,"description":"Baron Samedi's Ala thunders past its Blacksun counterparts. Guadalupe Mendoza y Ramos recovered this shield from Javier Montero's son who first stole it from the traitoroous Miguel Chavez.\n\nBaron Samedi's Ala controls damage done to te shield, increases combat speed, and increases Psionic resistance.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Shield Tech\nRequirement: Level 5 Shield Tech\nShield capacity: 2578\nShield recharge / sec: 30.8","effects":"Equipment Damage Control - Shields (Equip)\nIncreases your shield's effectiveness at sustaining damage by 65% when equipped.\n\nIncrease Speed (Equip)\nIncreases ship top speed by 120 when equipped.\n\nResist Psionic (Equip)\n+27.0 Psionic Resist when equipped."},{"id":2748,"name":"Baron Samedi's Ara","type":15,"icon":806,"level":6,"price":212374,"stack":1,"description":"Baron Samedi's Ara is said to have the power of Oluwo, the Lord of Awos. Always searching for an edge in battle. Cecilia Serrano-Basilio bartered with Baron Samecli's order eventually giving up her share of the Chavez mining operations. Cecilia has been happily disrupting Red Dragon mining operations ever since.\n\nBaron Samedi's Ara controls damage done to weapons, increases Missle Weapon skills increases scanning range, and decreases ship signature.\n\nThis launcher uses Chavez Ara Missles.  ","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Ammunition: New Chavez Missiles\nEnergy use: 91\nSkill required: Missile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 6 Missile Weapon\nReload (sec): 10.2\nRounds per shot: 4","effects":"Improved Missile Handling (Equip)\nImproved Missile Accuracy by 1.93 Skill Level(s) when equipped.\n\nEquipment Damage Control - Weapons (Equip)\nIncreases your weapons' effectiveness at sustaining damage by 57% when equipped.\n\nReduce Ship Signature (Equip)\nGives a ship 49% less radar footprint when equipped.\n\nScan Boost (Equip)\nAllows ship scanners to see 2640 units farther when equipped."},{"id":3269,"name":"Baron Samedi's Eje","type":7,"icon":873,"level":5,"price":58399,"stack":1,"description":"","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Reactor Tech\nRequirement: Level 5 Reactor Tech\nReactor capacity: 1320\nReactor recharge / sec: 20.2","effects":"Equipment Damage Control - Reactor (Equip)\nIncreases your reactor's effectiveness at sustaining damage by 66% when equipped.\n\nRecharge Shields (Equip)\n+34.0% Shield Recharge when equipped.\n\nEquipment Damage Control - Devices (Equip)\nIncreases your devices' effectiveness at sustaining damage by 66% when equipped."},{"id":1056,"name":"Baron Samedi's Iku","type":14,"icon":786,"level":6,"price":155756,"stack":1,"description":"Miguel Chavez sacrificed many Red Dragons before coming across this weapon, though it is unknown why a Red dragon was in posseeion of such a scared arifact. Miguel then granted Baron Samedi's Iku to Juan Pelayo Arnedo who is believed to be the one who will capture the traitorous Javier Montero. \n\nBaron Samedi's Iku controls damage done to weapons, increases Beam Weapon skills, boosts scan range and reduces ship's signature.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Weapon damage: 40\nDamage type: EMP\nEnergy use: 23\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 6 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1600\nReload (sec): 2","effects":"Equipment Damage Control - Weapons (Equip)\nIncreases your weapons' effectiveness at sustaining damage by 73% when equipped.\n\nImproved Beam Handling (Equip)\nImproves Beam Accuracy by 2.70 Skill Level(s) when equipped.\n\nScan Boost (Equip)\nAllows ship scanners to see 2610 units farther when equipped.\n\nReduce Ship Signature (Equip)\nGives a ship 49% less radar footprint when equipped."},{"id":3123,"name":"Baron Samedis Arun","type":16,"icon":849,"level":6,"price":47980,"stack":1,"description":"Baron Samedi's Arun was given to Rosa Garcia y Garcia by a Houngan as a symbol of the covenant Rosa has given to return to the service of her order.\n\nBaron Samedi's Arun controls damage taken to weapons, increase projectile Weapon skill, increases scanning range, and reduces ship signature.  ","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Ammunition: New Chavez Ammo\nEnergy use: 32\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 6 Projectile Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 3600\nReload (sec): 3.1\nRounds per shot: 7","effects":"Equipment Damage Control - Weapons (Equip)\nIncreases your weapons' effectiveness at sustaining damage by 71% when equipped.\n\nProjectile Weapon Skill (Equip)\nIncreases Projectile Accuracy by 2.60 Skill Level(s) when equipped.\n\nReduce Ship Signature (Equip)\nGives a ship 48% less radar footprint when equipped.\n\nScan Boost (Equip)\nAllows ship scanners to see 2520 units farther when equipped."},{"id":3739,"name":"Barrier of Ooze","type":2,"icon":743,"level":7,"price":480651,"stack":1,"description":"Your ship is surrounded by warm slime when this shield is equipped.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Shield Tech\nRequirement: Level 7 Shield Tech\nShield capacity: 18311\nShield recharge / sec: 150","effects":"Deflect Chemical (Equip)\n+30 Chemical Deflect when equipped.\n\nDeflect Impact (Equip)\n+30 Impact Deflect when equipped.\n\nHull Damage Control (Equip)\nIncreases your hulls effectiveness at sustaining damage by 33% when equipped."},{"id":3766,"name":"Barrier of Slime Eight","type":2,"icon":743,"level":8,"price":2589673,"stack":1,"description":"Your ship is surrounded by warm slime when this shield is equipped.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Shield Tech\nRequirement: Level 8 Shield Tech\nShield capacity: 45776\nShield recharge / sec: 332.7","effects":"Deflect Chemical (Equip)\n+30 Chemical Deflect when equipped.\n\nDeflect Impact (Equip)\n+30 Impact Deflect when equipped.\n\nHull Damage Control (Equip)\nIncreases your hulls effectiveness at sustaining damage by 32% when equipped.\n\nFast Tractor Beam (Equip)\nIncreases tractor beam speed by 118% when equipped."},{"id":5927,"name":"Basic Eye Stock","type":13,"icon":1371,"level":1,"price":382,"stack":60,"description":"A simple 'light-sensing' eye stock.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":1181,"name":"Basic Solar Cell","type":13,"icon":1931,"level":1,"price":215,"stack":240,"description":"A silicon disc coated with a non-reflective substance and covered with a protective glass sheet. ","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":1320,"name":"Basic Tool Repair","type":13,"icon":1280,"level":3,"price":50666,"stack":20,"description":"Volume One by Lyle MacDonald. How to fix up a mess of old tools for real cheap.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":1867,"name":"Basilisk's Breath","type":11,"icon":1011,"level":3,"price":11882,"stack":1,"description":"BlackSun Device\nExperimental Device. Use at own risk.\nWhen activated on a targeted enemy this item causes a decrease to target's chemical resistance.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 3 Device Tech","effects":"Weaken Chemical (Activated)\n-22.0 Chemical Deflect for 72 seconds to enemy when activated."},{"id":2222,"name":"Basilisk's Dire Gale","type":11,"icon":1017,"level":7,"price":478550,"stack":1,"description":"BlackSun Device\nExperimental Device.  Use at own risk.\nWhen activated on a targeted enemy this item causes a decrease to target's chemical resistance.\nWhen equipped this item gives an increase to your projectile weapon range.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 7 Device Tech","effects":"Weaken Chemical (Activated)\n-38.0 Chemical Deflect for 168 seconds to enemy when activated.\n\nBoost Projectile Range (Equip)\nIncreases Projectile Range by 38% when equipped."},{"id":2315,"name":"Basilisk's Dire Torrent","type":11,"icon":1017,"level":8,"price":1147382,"stack":1,"description":"BlackSun Device\nExperimental Device. Use at own risk.\nWhen activated on a targeted enemy this item causes a decrease to target's chemical resistance.\nWhen equipped this item gives an increase to your projectile weapon range.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 8 Device Tech","effects":"Weaken Chemical (Activated)\n-42.0 Chemical Deflect for 192 seconds to enemy when activated.\n\nBoost Projectile Range (Equip)\nIncreases Projectile Range by 42% when equipped."},{"id":2416,"name":"Basilisk's Dread Fury","type":11,"icon":1017,"level":9,"price":2926170,"stack":1,"description":"BlackSun Device\nExperimental Device. Use at own risk.\nWhen activated on a targeted enemy this item causes a decrease to target's chemical resistance.\nWhen equipped this item causes a small increase to your ship's mass, but gives an increase to your projectile weapon range and an increase to your Projectile Weapon skill.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 9 Device Tech","effects":"Weaken Chemical (Activated)\n-46.0 Chemical Deflect for 216 seconds to enemy when activated.\n\nBoost Projectile Range (Equip)\nIncreases Projectile Range by 46% when equipped.\n\nProjectile Weapon Skill (Equip)\nIncreases Projectile Accuracy by 3.33 Skill Level(s) when equipped.\n\nIncrease Mass (Equip)\nIncreases ship mass by 10% when equipped."},{"id":2043,"name":"Basilisk's Fell Aura","type":11,"icon":1014,"level":5,"price":55947,"stack":1,"description":"BlackSun Device \nExperimental Device. Use at own risk. \nWhen activated on a targeted enemy this item causes a decrease to target's chemical resistance. When equipped this item causes a small increase to your ship's mass, but gives an increase to your projectile weapon range.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 5 Device Tech","effects":"Weaken Chemical (Activated)\n-30.0 Chemical Deflect for 120 seconds to enemy when activated.\n\nBoost Projectile Range (Equip)\nIncreases Projectile Range by 30% when equipped.\n\nIncrease Mass (Equip)\nIncreases ship mass by 10% when equipped."},{"id":2131,"name":"Basilisk's Fell Turmoil","type":11,"icon":1014,"level":6,"price":117111,"stack":1,"description":"BlackSun Device\nExperimental Device. Use at own risk.\nWhen activated on a targeted enemy this item causes a decrease to target's chemical resistance.\nWhen equipped this item causes a small increase to your ship's mass, but gives an increase to your projectile weapon range.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 6 Device Tech","effects":"Weaken Chemical (Activated)\n-34.0 Chemical Deflect for 144 seconds to enemy when activated.\n\nBoost Projectile Range (Equip)\nIncreases Projectile Range by 34% when equipped.\n\nIncrease Mass (Equip)\nIncreases ship mass by 10% when equipped."},{"id":1957,"name":"Basilisk's Gust","type":11,"icon":1011,"level":4,"price":31292,"stack":1,"description":"BlackSun Device\nExperimental Device. Use at own risk.\nWhen activated on a targeted enemy this item causes a decrease to target's chemical resistance.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 4 Device Tech","effects":"Weaken Chemical (Activated)\n-26.0 Chemical Deflect for 96 seconds to enemy when activated."},{"id":3480,"name":"Bastinium","type":13,"icon":1487,"level":5,"price":491,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Bastinium Ore","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":2929,"name":"Bastinium Ore","type":13,"icon":1484,"level":5,"price":70,"stack":300,"description":"Refines to: Bastinium","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5532,"name":"Battered Gunrack","type":13,"icon":1470,"level":1,"price":354,"stack":60,"description":"Relic from Old Earth, this was often used to hold numerous firearma,such as rifles and shotguns. These were ostensibly used for 'hunting.'","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":1380,"name":"Battery Element","type":13,"icon":665,"level":4,"price":15198,"stack":20,"description":"A negatively charged plate and a positively charged plate are seperated by a porous divider.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3991,"name":"Battlebug Armorplate","type":13,"icon":1372,"level":3,"price":1134,"stack":1,"description":"Armoured attachment used by the Bogeril on thier specially bred battlebugs.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3829,"name":"Battlebug Control Bar","type":13,"icon":1471,"level":3,"price":1001,"stack":60,"description":"Implement used by the Bogeril to control and tame scuttlebugs. This control bar is specially fitted for larger breed of fighting scuttlebugs.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5406,"name":"Battlebug Dogtags","type":13,"icon":1380,"level":4,"price":1325,"stack":10,"description":"Generic nametag used to identify domesticated Bogeril battlebugs.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3992,"name":"Battlebug Laser-beam Attachment","type":13,"icon":732,"level":4,"price":1317,"stack":1,"description":"Weapon attachment used by the Bogeril on their specially bred Battlebugs.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3707,"name":"Beating String of Heart","type":2,"icon":2108,"level":5,"price":68464,"stack":1,"description":"Tada-O holiday line most string protection.  Of a heart to give for Valentines's February day.  Protective bubble of love for your ship.  No bleeding.","manufacturer":"Tada-O","stats":"Skill required: Shield Tech\nRequirement: Level 5 Shield Tech\nShield capacity: 2402\nShield recharge / sec: 30.8","effects":"Equipment Engineering (Equip)\nReduces equipment install time by 45% when equipped.\n\nIncrease Speed (Equip)\nIncreases ship top speed by 80 when equipped.\n\nDeflect Energy (Equip)\n+25 Energy Deflect when equipped.\n\nWarp Charge (Equip)\nDecreases warp engage/cooldown times by 36% when equipped."},{"id":3691,"name":"Beautiful Kimono Shield M4","type":2,"icon":906,"level":4,"price":32954,"stack":1,"description":"Nishido!  Designed to perfection by the greatest of the Shoda-kan Masters.\nWhen activated on a targeted group member, this item gives target added explosive resistance.\nWhen equipped this item gives an increase to your explosive and chemical resistances.\nUso kara deta makoto.","manufacturer":"Nishido","stats":"Skill required: Shield Tech\nRequirement: Level 4 Shield Tech\nShield capacity: 539\nShield recharge / sec: 10.9","effects":"Deflect Explosive (Activated)\n+20 Explosive Deflect for 800 seconds when activated.\n\nDeflect Explosive (Equip)\n+24 Explosive Deflect when equipped.\n\nDeflect Chemical (Equip)\n+24 Chemical Deflect when equipped."},{"id":3714,"name":"Beautiful Kimono Shield M5","type":2,"icon":906,"level":5,"price":74931,"stack":1,"description":"Nishido!  Designed to perfection by the greatest of the Shoda-kan Masters.\nWhen activated on a targeted group member, this item gives target added explosive resistance.\nWhen equipped this item gives an increase to your explosive and chemical resistances.\nUso kara deta makoto.","manufacturer":"Nishido","stats":"Skill required: Shield Tech\nRequirement: Level 5 Shield Tech\nShield capacity: 1347\nShield recharge / sec: 22.7","effects":"Deflect Explosive (Activated)\n+20 Explosive Deflect for 1000 seconds when activated.\n\nDeflect Explosive (Equip)\n+27 Explosive Deflect when equipped.\n\nDeflect Chemical (Equip)\n+27 Chemical Deflect when equipped."},{"id":3732,"name":"Beautiful Kimono Shield M6","type":2,"icon":906,"level":6,"price":206594,"stack":1,"description":"Nishido!  Designed to perfection by the greatest of the Shoda-kan Masters.\nWhen activated on a targeted group member, this item gives target added explosive resistance.\nWhen equipped this item gives an increase to your explosive and chemical resistances.\nUso kara deta makoto.","manufacturer":"Nishido","stats":"Skill required: Shield Tech\nRequirement: Level 6 Shield Tech\nShield capacity: 3369\nShield recharge / sec: 48.7","effects":"Deflect Explosive (Activated)\n+20 Explosive Deflect for 1200 seconds when activated.\n\nDeflect Explosive (Equip)\n+29 Explosive Deflect when equipped.\n\nDeflect Chemical (Equip)\n+29 Chemical Deflect when equipped."},{"id":3683,"name":"Becoming Class 2 Shield","type":2,"icon":904,"level":4,"price":29702,"stack":1,"description":"Tada-O! Big! Strong! Wow! When equipped this item gives an increase to your Repair Equipment Skill. ","manufacturer":"Tada-O","stats":"Skill required: Shield Tech\nRequirement: Level 4 Shield Tech\nShield capacity: 820\nShield recharge / sec: 9.4","effects":"Improved Repair Equipment (Equip)\nDecrease repair time by 8.00% when equipped."},{"id":4040,"name":"Beer","type":13,"icon":741,"level":2,"price":98,"stack":1,"description":"A fermented mix of wheat, yeast, and hops favored by planetbound Terrans.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5148,"name":"Belulah's Fixin's","type":13,"icon":1313,"level":1,"price":548,"stack":1,"description":"A bouniful feast of biscuits. links, gravy and devil weed sead pie, all neatly warpped in tinfoil for transport.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":1849,"name":"Ben Joseph's Concealment Shroud","type":11,"icon":921,"level":2,"price":5167,"stack":1,"description":"When this item is equipped it will improve your cloaking ability.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 2 Device Tech","effects":"Improved Cloaking (Equip)\nReduces Cloaking Engage Time by 1.3 seconds (to a minimum of 3 seconds), makes the target harder to detect with See Cloaking, and increases Stealth Strike time when equipped."},{"id":2269,"name":"Benevolence","type":11,"icon":1017,"level":7,"price":300000,"stack":1,"description":"A fragment of ancient technology.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 7 Device Tech","effects":"Missile Energy Conservation (Equip)\nReduces Missile Energy Cost by 40.0% when equipped.\n\nBeam Energy Conservation (Equip)\nReduces Beam Energy Cost by 40.0% when equipped.\n\nProjectile Energy Conservation (Equip) \nReduces Projectile Energy Cost by 40.0% when equipped."},{"id":1027,"name":"Bengal Tiger","type":14,"icon":774,"level":6,"price":119429,"stack":1,"description":"When equipped, the GETCo Tiger gives increased Hacking Skill but slightly reduces Ship Warp Speed.\nGETCo: Continuing our 500 year tradition of sustainable development.","manufacturer":"GETco","stats":"Weapon damage: 125\nDamage type: Plasma\nEnergy use: 99\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 6 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1400\nReload (sec): 7","effects":"Slow Warp (Equip)\nReduces warp speed by 250.00 when equipped.\n\nImproved Hacking (Equip)\nImproves Hacking Success by 58% when equipped."},{"id":6057,"name":"Bent Sensor Dish","type":13,"icon":925,"level":9,"price":2769,"stack":60,"description":"Sensor dishes are used for long range communication and radar. This one is badly damaged.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":635,"name":"Berserk Round","type":10,"icon":720,"level":6,"price":17,"stack":700,"description":"Berserk rounds are chemical pellets that fire from Harald's Berserk.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Ammunition: Berserk\nWeapon damage: 34\nDamage type: Chemical\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 6 Projectile Weapon","effects":""},{"id":3361,"name":"Beryl","type":13,"icon":1468,"level":1,"price":101,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Raw Beryl\nA transparent, Beryllium-based gemstone that occurs in a wide variety of colors.  ","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5113,"name":"Beta Hydri Fruit","type":13,"icon":1289,"level":2,"price":131,"stack":1,"description":"Juicy bits of sweet goodness that supply vitamin C and other important nutrients to the body. These are grown in special solar greenhouses in Glory's Orbit, and shipped in nitrogen-filled cryocontainers for extended transport.\n\nBeta Hydri Fruit is in demand at Earth Station (Earth, Sol System) and Somerled Station (New Edinburg, Tau Ceti System).","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5226,"name":"Beta Hydri News Updates","type":13,"icon":1281,"level":4,"price":78,"stack":1,"description":"News local to the Beta Hydri System. It is published by a branch of Net-7 News.\n\nThe team at Net-7 Station will be looking forward to recieveing these updates so the news can be redistributed accurately, fairly and honestly.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":2785,"name":"Big Bertha Duo","type":15,"icon":1395,"level":7,"price":358619,"stack":1,"description":"The Sparta Big Bertha Missle Launcher requires the use of Sparta Big Bertha Missles. Sparta! When the call comes, be ready. When equipped, it gives an increase to the projectile weapon skill. It also gives an increase to the range of all your equipped projectile launchers. ","manufacturer":"Sparta","stats":"Ammunition: Big Bertha\nEnergy use: 70\nSkill required: Missile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 7 Missile Weapon\nReload (sec): 7.5\nRounds per shot: 1","effects":"Improved Projectile Handling (Equip)\nIncreases Projectile Accuracy by 2.20 Skill Level(s)  when equipped.\n\nBoost Projectile Range (Equip)\nIncreases Projectile Range by 32% when equipped."},{"id":652,"name":"Big Bertha EMP Missile","type":10,"icon":709,"level":6,"price":117,"stack":180,"description":"For use with the Sparta Big Bertha Missile Launcher.  Sparta!  When the Call comes, be ready.\nThe Big Bertha EMP missile will drain your target's energy as well as its shields.","manufacturer":"Sparta","stats":"Ammunition: Big Bertha\nWeapon damage: 225\nDamage type: EMP\nSkill required: Missile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 6 Missile Weapon\nMissile maneuverability: 250\nWeapon range (m): 5400","effects":""},{"id":2808,"name":"Big Bertha Max","type":15,"icon":1395,"level":8,"price":1032549,"stack":1,"description":"The Sparta Big Bertha Missle Launcher requires the use of Sparta Big Bertha Missles. Sparta! When the call comes, be ready. When equipped, it gives an increase to the projectile weapon skill. It also gives an increase to the range of all your equipped projectile launchers. ","manufacturer":"Sparta","stats":"Ammunition: Big Bertha\nEnergy use: 103\nSkill required: Missile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 8 Missile Weapon\nReload (sec): 9.4\nRounds per shot: 2","effects":"Improved Projectile Handling (Equip)\nIncreases Projectile Accuracy by 2.49 Skill Level(s)  when equipped.\n\nBoost Projectile Range (Equip)\nIncreases Projectile Range by 36% when equipped."},{"id":653,"name":"Big Bertha Plasma Missile","type":10,"icon":709,"level":6,"price":117,"stack":180,"description":"For use with the Sparta Big Bertha Missile Launcher.  Sparta! When the Call comes, be ready.\nThe Big Bertha plasma missile will drain your target's shields over a period of time.","manufacturer":"Sparta","stats":"Ammunition: Big Bertha\nWeapon damage: 225\nDamage type: Plasma\nSkill required: Missile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 6 Missile Weapon\nMissile maneuverability: 250\nWeapon range (m): 5400","effects":""},{"id":2755,"name":"Big Bertha Prime","type":15,"icon":1395,"level":6,"price":144236,"stack":1,"description":"The Sparta Big Bertha Prime Missle Launcher requires the use of Sparta Big Bertha Missles. Sparta! When the call comes, be ready. When equipped, it gives an increase to the projectile weapon skill. It also gives an increase to the range of all your equipped projectile launchers.","manufacturer":"Sparta","stats":"Ammunition: Big Bertha\nEnergy use: 98\nSkill required: Missile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 6 Missile Weapon\nReload (sec): 12\nRounds per shot: 1","effects":"Improved Projectile Handling (Equip)\nIncreases Projectile Accuracy by 1.93 Skill Level(s)  when equipped.\n\nBoost Projectile Range (Equip)\nIncreases Projectile Range by 29% when equipped."},{"id":2468,"name":"Binder Novem","type":11,"icon":998,"level":9,"price":2654339,"stack":1,"description":"Sparta! When the Call comes, be ready.\nWhen equipped this item causes a small reduction to your scan range, but gives an increase to your Gravity Link skill and an increase to your shield's regeneration rate and a decrease to the damage your shield will take.","manufacturer":"Sparta","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 9 Device Tech","effects":"Improved Gravity Link (Equip)\nImproves Gravity Links by 3.93 Skill Level(s) when equipped.\n\nRecharge Shields (Equip)\n+46.0% Shield Recharge when equipped.\n\nEquipment Damage Control - Shields (Equip)\nIncreases your shield's effectiveness at sustaining damage by 75% when equipped.\n\nScan Blind (Equip)\nReduces scan distance by 30.0% when equipped."},{"id":2376,"name":"Binder Octo","type":11,"icon":998,"level":8,"price":1244997,"stack":1,"description":"Sp