ed a proper use for a Jenquai.","manufacturer":"Sparta","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 3 Device Tech","effects":"Improved Critical Targeting (Equip)\nIncreases Critical Hits Chance by 10.00% when equipped.\n\nImproved Combat Trance (Equip)\nImproves Combat Trance effectiveness by 1.00 Skill Level(s) when equipped.\n\nHull Damage Control (Equip)\nIncreases your hulls effectiveness at sustaining damage by 20% when equipped."},{"id":5920,"name":"BooBoomba's Ritual Stick","type":11,"icon":1373,"level":4,"price":2267,"stack":1,"description":"This ritual stick was designed according to the orignal specifications from BooBoomba, the first Progen who discovered a proper use for a Jenquai.","manufacturer":"Sparta","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 4 Device Tech","effects":"Improved Critical Targeting (Equip)\nIncreases Critical Hits Chance by 20.00% when equipped.\n\nImproved Combat Trance (Equip)\nImproves Combat Trance effectiveness by 2.00 Skill Level(s) when equipped.\n\nHull Damage Control (Equip)\nIncreases your hulls effectiveness at sustaining damage by 30% when equipped."},{"id":2268,"name":"Boon Of The Celestial","type":11,"icon":1001,"level":7,"price":399568,"stack":1,"description":"A fragment of Ancient Technology.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 7 Device Tech","effects":"See Cloaked (Equip)\nAllows a ships scanners to detect cloaked objects when equipped.\n\nWeaken Plasma (Equip)\n-10.0 Plasma Deflect when equipped."},{"id":3919,"name":"Booney's Best Handle","type":13,"icon":1373,"level":4,"price":4250,"stack":20,"description":"This battered plastic handle has been wrapped in grek hide to improve the grip.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3917,"name":"Booney's Fishing Rig","type":13,"icon":2395,"level":4,"price":1854230,"stack":20,"description":"The big one ain't gonna get away this time.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":2998,"name":"Bor