 by 64 when equipped."},{"id":5123,"name":"Cleaning Bots","type":13,"icon":210,"level":1,"price":58,"stack":1,"description":"Dust and dirt just seem to collect everywhere, even in space. Why not have a bot clean it up for you?\n\nCleaning Bots are needed at Aragoth Station (Valkyrie Twins, Aragoth System), Arx Ymir (Jotunheim, Aragoth System), Earth Station, and Net-7 (Saturn, Sol System).","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5348,"name":"Cloaking Coils","type":13,"icon":958,"level":1,"price":52,"stack":1,"description":"Without these high energy conversion coils, cloaking devices would not be able to function.\n\nParen station is in constant need of these for making new devices.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5228,"name":"Clothing","type":13,"icon":735,"level":1,"price":59,"stack":1,"description":"Garments manufactured in Tau Ceti. 80% grek hide, 20% polyester.\n\nInverness Down has the creme-de-la-creme of clothing stores.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5814,"name":"Cloud Rider Brain","type":13,"icon":1367,"level":9,"price":9683,"stack":100,"description":"The brain from a Cloud Rider.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5812,"name":"Cloud Rider Chitin","type":13,"icon":1372,"level":9,"price":9642,"stack":100,"description":"The chitin from a Cloud Rider.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5813,"name":"Cloud Rider Heart","type":13,"icon":1375,"level":9,"price":9483,"stack":100,"description":"The heart of a Cloud Rider.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3953,"name":"Cloud Rider's Force Creation Organ","type":13,"icon":1375,"level":8,"price":774912,"stack":5,"description":"The Organ that creates the projectiles used by the Dark Cloud Riders.\n\n[Price and stack unverified]","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":935,"name":"Clouded Leopard","type":14,"icon":768,"level":5,"price":56118,"stack":1,"description":"GETCo: Continuing our 500 year tradition of sustainable 