l comes, be ready.","manufacturer":"Sparta","stats":"Weapon damage: 57\nDamage type: EMP\nEnergy use: 83\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 4 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1400\nReload (sec): 9","effects":"Equipment Damage Control - Weapons (Equip)\nIncreases your weapons' effectiveness at sustaining damage by 52% when equipped.\n\nRecharge Shields (Equip)\n+26.0% Shield Recharge when equipped."},{"id":971,"name":"Club Tertius","type":14,"icon":1389,"level":5,"price":78360,"stack":1,"description":"The Sparta Club will drain your target's energy as well as its shields.\nWhen equipped, the Sparta Club gives increased Shield Regeneration and reduces direct damage to the Ship's Weapons.\nSparta. When the Call comes, be ready.","manufacturer":"Sparta","stats":"Weapon damage: 91\nDamage type: EMP\nEnergy use: 96\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 5 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1200\nReload (sec): 9","effects":"Equipment Damage Control - Weapons (Equip)\nIncreases your weapons' effectiveness at sustaining damage by 58% when equipped.\n\nRecharge Shields (Equip)\n+30.0% Shield Recharge when equipped."},{"id":3421,"name":"Coal","type":13,"icon":1486,"level":2,"price":23,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Raw Coal\nA black solid used as an additive to other metals. ","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":2894,"name":"Cobalite","type":13,"icon":1483,"level":3,"price":25,"stack":300,"description":"Refines to: Cobalt","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3437,"name":"Cobalt","type":13,"icon":1486,"level":3,"price":1004,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Cobalite\nA shine metal with a slight gray hue, Cobalt is most frequently used to create highly magnetic alloys. ","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":744,"name":"Cobalt Bile Drenched Spines","type":10,"icon":664,"level":9,"price":38,"stack":800,"description":"Viscous bile coats these spines.  Used in the Ten-Gu Bile Launcher.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Ammunition: Bile Drenched\nWeapon damage: 1085\nDamage type: Plasma\nSkill required: Missile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 9 Missile Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 5800","effects":""},{"id":2326,"name":"Cobalt MegaHurtz","type":11,"icon":1000,"level":8,"price":1069015,"stack":1,"description":"BlackSun Device\nExperimental Device.  Use at own risk.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 8 Device Tech","effects":"Weaken Energy (Activated)\n-35.5 Energy Deflect for 152 seconds to enemy when activated."},{"id":3652,"name":"Cobalt Scale","type":2,"icon":900,"level":3,"price":14958,"stack":1,"description":"The Blue Scales were created specifically for the officers of the Lan Leung tong.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Shield Tech\nRequirement: Level 3 Shield Tech\nShield capacity: 440\nShield recharge / sec: 5.8","effects":""},{"id":1690,"name":"Cobalt Ten-Gu Bile","type":13,"icon":2399,"level":9,"price":5864,"stack":240,"description":"Cobalt bile from a Ten-Gu.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3896,"name":"Cobalt Ten-Gu Bile Infused Fangs","type":10,"icon":664,"level":9,"price":56,"stack":2000,"description":"Bile has been infused into this organic ammunition.\nFor use in the Ten-Gu Bile Cannon","manufacturer":"","stats":"Ammunition: Bile Infused\nWeapon damage: 181\nDamage type: Plasma\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 9 Projectile Weapon","effects":""},{"id":5863,"name":"Cobbed Flawless Ruby","type":13,"icon":2365,"level":6,"price":19248,"stack":1,"description":"Flawless ruby. It ain't cut completely yet so it don't sparkle none.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3512,"name":"Cobbled Flawless Ruby","type":13,"icon":1468,"level":6,"price":18957,"stack":1,"description":"Flawless ruby tied to a stick.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5229,"name":"Coffee","type":13,"icon":1289,"level":1,"price":48,"stack":1,"description":"Ungrounded coffee beans grown from coffee plants on planet Earth.  Because of its caffeinated qualities, it is a popular drink around the universe.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5095,"name":"Coffee Grounds","type":13,"icon":744,"level":1,"price":150,"stack":1,"description":"Ungrounded coffee beans from the rich coffee plants of Kailaasa, favored by many Jenquai pilots.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":2462,"name":"Colloidal Magnetic Transmitter","type":11,"icon":991,"level":9,"price":708275,"stack":1,"description":"This combination of Oni parts will serve as the transmitting agent in the Oni Communication Device.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 9 Device Tech","effects":""},{"id":4037,"name":"Colorful Parrot Feather","type":13,"icon":1368,"level":7,"price":16923,"stack":5,"description":"The flamboyant colors of this feather instantly capture your attention.\n\n","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3369,"name":"Colorless Tazeron","type":13,"icon":1486,"level":1,"price":18,"stack":300,"description":"","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":1937,"name":"Coma II RSR 3","type":11,"icon":1011,"level":3,"price":15808,"stack":1,"description":"Discover the future!  Sundari.\nWhen activated on a targeted enemy this item causes a decrease to target's scan range.","manufacturer":"Sundari","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 3 Device Tech","effects":"Scan Blind (Activated)\nReduces scan distance by 43% for 72 seconds to enemy when activated."},{"id":2019,"name":"Coma II RSR 4","type":11,"icon":1011,"level":4,"price":25421,"stack":1,"description":"Discover the future!  Sundari.\nWhen activated on a targeted enemy this item causes a decrease to target's scan range.","manufacturer":"Sundari","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 4 Device Tech","effects":"Scan Blind (Activated)\nReduces scan distance by 49% for 96 seconds to enemy when activated."},{"id":2292,"name":"Coma Major RSR 7","type":11,"icon":1017,"level":7,"price":639984,"stack":1,"description":"Discover the future! Sundari.\nWhen activated on a targeted enemy this item causes a decrease to target's scan range.\nWhen equipped this item gives an increase to your scan range.","manufacturer":"Sundari","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 7 Device Tech","effects":"Scan Blind (Activated)\nReduces scan distance by 67% for 168 seconds to enemy when activated.\n\nScan Boost (Equip)\nAllows ship scanners to see 2250 units farther when equipped."},{"id":2395,"name":"Coma Major RSR 8","type":11,"icon":1017,"level":8,"price":1439262,"stack":1,"description":"Discover the future! Sundari.\nWhen activated on a targeted enemy this item causes a decrease to target's scan range.\nWhen equipped this item gives an increase to your scan range.","manufacturer":"Sundari","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 8 Device Tech","effects":"Scan Blind (Activated)\nReduces scan distance by 73% for 192 seconds to enemy when activated.\n\nScan Boost (Equip)\nAllows ship scanners to see 2550 units farther when equipped."},{"id":2111,"name":"Coma Minor RSR 5","type":11,"icon":1014,"level":5,"price":80011,"stack":1,"description":"Discover the future! Sundari.\nWhen activated on a targeted enemy this item causes a decrease to target's scan range.\nWhen equipped this item causes a small increase to your ship's mass, but gives an increase to your scan range.","manufacturer":"Sundari","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 5 Device Tech","effects":"Scan Blind (Activated)\nReduces scan distance by 55% for 120 seconds to enemy when activated.\n\nScan Boost (Equip)\nAllows ship scanners to see 1950 units farther when equipped.\n\nIncrease Mass (Equip)\nIncreases ship mass by 10% when equipped."},{"id":2201,"name":"Coma Minor RSR 6","type":11,"icon":1014,"level":6,"price":175439,"stack":1,"description":"Discover the future!  Sundari.\nWhen activated on a targeted enemy this item causes a decrease to target's scan range.\nWhen equiped this item causes a small increase to your ship's mass, but gives an increase to your scan range.","manufacturer":"Sundari","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 6 Device Tech","effects":"Scan Blind (Activated)\nReduces scan distance by 61% for 144 seconds to enemy when activated.\n\nScan Boost (Equip)\nAllows ship scanners to see 2250 units farther when equipped.\n\nIncrease Mass (Equip)\nIncreases ship mass by 10% when equipped."},{"id":2486,"name":"Coma Prime RSR 9","type":11,"icon":1017,"level":9,"price":3403756,"stack":1,"description":"Discover the future! Sundari.\nWhen activated on a targeted enemy this item causes a decrease to target's scan range.\nWhen equipped this item causes a small increase to your ship's mass, but gives an increase to your scan range and combat speed.","manufacturer":"Sundari","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 9 Device Tech","effects":"Scan Blind (Activated)\nReduces scan distance by 79% for 216 seconds to enemy when activated.\n\nScan Boost (Equip)\nAllows ship scanners to see 3150 units farther when equipped.\n\nIncrease Speed (Equip)\nIncreases ship top speed by 180 when equipped.\n\nIncrease Mass (Equip)\nIncreases ship mass by 10% when equipped."},{"id":1185,"name":"Combined V'rix Chitin","type":13,"icon":1372,"level":1,"price":250,"stack":240,"description":"A small piece of V'rix Chitin.  ","manufacturer":"Vrix","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3752,"name":"Comely Class 1 Shield","type":2,"icon":911,"level":7,"price":525463,"stack":1,"description":"Tada-O! Big! Strong! Wow!\n","manufacturer":"Tada-O","stats":"Skill required: Shield Tech\nRequirement: Level 7 Shield Tech\nShield capacity: 12817\nShield recharge / sec: 90.6","effects":"Improved Repair Equipment (Equip)\nDecrease repair time by 13.00% when equipped."},{"id":5231,"name":"Comic Books","type":13,"icon":1280,"level":2,"price":120,"stack":1,"description":"Books of comics read for entertainment. Common topics include superheros, ninjas, samurai, and pirates. CAUTION: may include zombies!\n\nThere is a huge market for these on Mercury Station. They must have the largest base of fanboys in the galaxy!","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":2460,"name":"Comm Power Source","type":11,"icon":705,"level":9,"price":2911226,"stack":1,"description":"This power source was designed by the students of Zeh Len to supply energy to their device that they hoped to use to communicate with their lost laster after her mind was captured by an unknown entity in Xipe Totec.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 9 Device Tech","effects":""},{"id":2463,"name":"Comm Relay Conduit","type":11,"icon":1017,"level":9,"price":3270269,"stack":1,"description":"This conduit channels and modifies power from source to the shielding and transmission modules. This design was created by the students of Master Zeh Len following her tragic accident.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 9 Device Tech","effects":""},{"id":3904,"name":"Comm Shielding Array","type":11,"icon":995,"level":9,"price":2624165,"stack":1,"description":"This device was designed to shield the Oni Communication Device from outside interference and keep considerable energies contained.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 9 Device Tech","effects":""},{"id":5535,"name":"Commemorative Certificate","type":13,"icon":2076,"level":1,"price":1327,"stack":1,"description":"Commemorative certificate in Honor of the First Anniversary of the Founder's Federation Club.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":6041,"name":"Communication Antenna","type":13,"icon":990,"level":7,"price":2267,"stack":60,"description":"A basic antenna for short range communication.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":6048,"name":"Communications Array","type":13,"icon":1000,"level":8,"price":2413,"stack":60,"description":"A complexed array of comm lasers and antennas used for medium range communcations.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5108,"name":"Communications Arrays","type":13,"icon":927,"level":4,"price":1021,"stack":1,"description":"Net boy, Net girl, send your impulse around the world, put your message, in a modem, and set it free, on a cyber-sea.\n\nComs Arrays are needed at Fenris Observatory.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5941,"name":"Complex Brain Stem","type":13,"icon":1368,"level":4,"price":1229,"stack":60,"description":"This complexity of this brain stem suggests an animal-like intelligence.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5936,"name":"Complex Eye Stock","type":13,"icon":1371,"level":3,"price":1058,"stack":60,"description":"An eye stock with several complex light-sensing organs at one end.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5929,"name":"Complex Nerve Cluster","type":13,"icon":1367,"level":2,"price":699,"stack":60,"description":"A highly complex nerve cluster.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":1691,"name":"Composite Steel Sheet","type":13,"icon":1481,"level":9,"price":482680,"stack":60,"description":"A composite made by combining Transparent Steel and Liquid Pagion.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3484,"name":"Compressed Manes Essence","type":13,"icon":1481,"level":5,"price":21734,"stack":20,"description":"Compressed Essence from a Manes.\n\n[Price and stack size unverified]","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":2505,"name":"Compression Thrusters","type":6,"icon":950,"level":1,"price":0,"stack":1,"description":"Engine given to beginning Jenquai Pilots.","manufacturer":"Sundari","stats":"Skill required: Engine Tech\nRequirement: Level 1 Engine Tech\nEngine signature: 1600\nImpulse speed: 62\nWarp speed: 2000\nFree-warp energy / sec: 5.3","effects":""},{"id":6012,"name":"Computer Core","type":13,"icon":728,"leve