ll required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 7 Device Tech","effects":"Turbo Weapons (Activated)\nReduces Weapons Delay by 12% for 1120 seconds when activated.\n\nIncrease Speed (Equip)\nIncreases ship top speed by 126 when equipped."},{"id":1502,"name":"Control Circuitry","type":13,"icon":1474,"level":6,"price":97023,"stack":240,"description":"Switches, knobs, buttons, gauges and blinking lights cover this gadget. Its purpose is unknown.","manufacturer":"Bogeril","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":1188,"name":"Control Light Assembly","type":13,"icon":1499,"level":1,"price":26650,"stack":240,"description":"A battered strip of lights are connected to several plastic tubes. Frayed wires, liberally wrapped in duct tape, dangle from the circuitry.  ","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":1821,"name":"Converted Bogeril Swamp Cooler","type":11,"icon":989,"level":2,"price":3276,"stack":1,"description":"This item is normally used to keep a house cool or ship cooled, cheaply. This one, however, has been modified to keep a beam weapon cooled, and helps extend the range of said beam.","manufacturer":"Bogeril","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 2 Device Tech","effects":"Boost Beam Range (Equip)\nIncreases Beam Range by 19% when equipped."},{"id":3370,"name":"Copper","type":13,"icon":187,"level":1,"price":164,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Copper Ore\nA bright-reddish material used primarily as an electrical conductor.  ","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":2735,"name":"Copper Dragonbreath","type":15,"icon":1394,"level":5,"price":70464,"stack":1,"description":"BlackSun Dragonbreath Launcher","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Ammunition: DragonBreath Missile\nEnergy use: 53\nSkill required: Missile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 5 Missile Weapon\nReload (sec): 8.4\nRounds per shot: 1","effects":""},{"id":1189,"name":"Copper Foil Sheet","type":13,"icon":1478,"level":1,"price":848,"stack":240,"description":"A thin sheet of copper approximately three feet long by one foot wide. ","manufacturer":"Bogeril","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":2838,"name":"Copper Ore","type":13,"icon":1483,"level":1,"price":2,"stack":300,"description":"Refines to: Copper","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3626,"name":"Copper Scale","type":2,"icon":900,"level":1,"price":2426,"stack":1,"description":"The BlackSun Scale series of shield generators are crafted specifically for members of the Red Dragon Tongs.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Shield Tech\nRequirement: Level 1 Shield Tech\nShield capacity: 57\nShield recharge / sec: 1.8","effects":""},{"id":3962,"name":"Corner of a Destroyed Datacube","type":13,"icon":730,"level":1,"price":10,"stack":10,"description":"Piece of a broken datacube. This once contained data, but was ruined when destroyed.\n[dahin-moon core, cenovar gladiator]","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":1809,"name":"Corona Australis I PR 1","type":11,"icon":651,"level":1,"price":2135,"stack":1,"description":"Discover the future!  Sundari.\nWhen activated on a targeted friendly this item gives an increase to target's psionic resistance.","manufacturer":"Sundari","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 1 Device Tech","effects":"Resist Psionic (Activated)\n+20 Psionic Resist for 240 seconds to target when activated."},{"id":1860,"name":"Corona Australis I PR 2","type":11,"icon":651,"level":2,"price":5631,"stack":1,"description":"Discover the future!  Sundari.\nWhen activated on a targeted friendly this item gives an increase to target's psionic resistance.","manufacturer":"Sundari","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 2 Device Tech","effects":"Resist Psionic (Activated)\n+20 Psionic Resist for 480 seconds to target when activated."},{"id":1938,"name":"Corona Australis II PR 3","type":11,"icon":651,"level":3,"price":13791,"stack":1,"description":"Discover the future!  Sundari.\nWhen activated on a targeted friendly this item gives an increase to target's psionic resistance.","manufacturer":"Sundari","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 3 Device Tech","effects":"Resist Psionic (Activated)\n+20 Psionic Resist for 720 seconds to target when activated."},{"id":2020,"name":"Corona Australis II PR 4","type":11,"icon":651,"level":4,"price":32979,"stack":1,"description":"Discover the future!  Sundari.\nWhen activated on a targeted friendly this item gives an increase to target's psionic resistance.","manufacturer":"Sundari","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 4 Device Tech","effects":"Resist Psionic (Activated)\n+20 Psionic Resist for 960 seconds to target when activated."},{"id":2293,"name":"Corona Australis Major PR 7","type":11,"icon":707,"level":7,"price":639984,"stack":1,"description":"Discover the future! Sundari.\nWhen activated on a targeted friendly this item gives an increase to target's psionic resistance.\nWhen equipped this item gives a decrease to the amount of damage your devices will take.","manufacturer":"Sundari","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 7 Device Tech","effects":"Resist Psionic (Activated)\n+20 Psionic Resist for 1680 seconds to target when activated.\n\nEquipment Damage Control - Devices (Equip)\nIncreases your devices' effectiveness at sustaining damage by 72% when equipped."},{"id":2396,"name":"Corona Australis Major PR 8","type":11,"icon":707,"level":8,"price":973445,"stack":1,"description":"Discover the future! Sundari. \nWhen activated on a targeted friendly this item gives an increase to target's psionic resistance. \nWhen equipped this item gives a decrease to the amount of damage your devices will take. ","manufacturer":"Sundari","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 8 Device Tech","effects":"Resist Psionic (Activated)\n+20 Psionic Resist for 1920 seconds to target when activated.\n\nEquipment Damage Control - Devices (Equip)\nIncreases your devices' effectiveness at sustaining damage by 79% when equipped."},{"id":2112,"name":"Corona Australis Minor PR 5","type":11,"icon":679,"level":5,"price":80011,"stack":1,"description":"Discover the future! Sundari.\nWhen activated on a targeted friendly this item gives an increase to target's psionic resistance.\nWhen equipped this item causes a small increase to your ship's signature, but gives a decrease to the amount of damage your devices will take.","manufacturer":"Sundari","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 5 Device Tech","effects":"Resist Psionic (Activated)\n+20 Psionic Resist for 1200 seconds to target when activated.\n\nEquipment Damage Control - Devices (Equip)\nIncreases your devices' effectiveness at sustaining damage by 58% when equipped.\n\nIncrease Ship Signature (Equip)\nGives a ship 30% more radar footprint when equipped."},{"id":2202,"name":"Corona Australis Minor PR 6","type":11,"icon":679,"level":6,"price":175439,"stack":1,"description":"Discover the future! Sundari.\nWhen activated on a targeted friendly this item gives an increase to target's psionic resistance. When equipped this item causes a small increase to your ship's signature, but gives a decrease to the amount of damage your devices will take.","manufacturer":"Sundari","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 6 Device Tech","effects":"Resist Psionic (Activated)\n+20 Psionic Resist for 1440 seconds to target when activated.\n\nEquipment Damage Control - Devices (Equip)\nIncreases your devices' effectiveness at sustaining damage by 65% when equipped.\n\nIncrease Ship Signature (Equip)\nGives a ship 30% more radar footprint when equipped."},{"id":2487,"name":"Corona Australis Prime PR 9","type":11,"icon":707,"level":9,"price":3403756,"stack":1,"description":"Discover the future! Sundari. \nWhen activated on a targeted friendly this item gives an increase to target's psionic resistance. \nWhen equipped this item causes a small decrease in your ship's scan range, but reduces your ship's signature and gives a decrease to the amount of damage your devices will take.","manufacturer":"Sundari","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 9 Device Tech","effects":"Resist Psionic (Activated)\n+20 Psionic Resist for 2160 seconds to target when activated.\n\nEquipment Damage Control - Devices (Equip)\nIncreases your devices' effectiveness at sustaining damage by 86% when equipped.\n\nReduce Ship Signature (Equip)\nGives a ship 75% less radar footprint when equipped.\n\nScan Blind (Equip)\nReduces scan distance by 30.0% when equipped."},{"id":1939,"name":"Corona Borealis II IPSS 3","type":11,"icon":988,"level":3,"price":15296,"stack":1,"description":"Discover the future!  Sundari.\nWhen this device is equipped it will improve your Psionic shield skill.","manufacturer":"Sundari","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 3 Device Tech","effects":"Improved Psionic Shield (Equip)\nIncreases Psionic Shield Damage absorption by 46 to 1280, depending on ability used and increases duration of shield by 138 seconds when equipped."},{"id":2021,"name":"Corona Borealis II IPSS 4","type":11,"icon":988,"level":4,"price":35237,"stack":1,"description":"Discover the future! Sundari. \nDiscover the future!  Sundari.\nWhen this device is equipped it will improve your Psionic shield skill.\n","manufacturer":"Sundari","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 4 Device Tech","effects":"Improved Psionic Shield (Equip)\nIncreases Psionic Shield Damage absorption by 58 to 1740, depending on ability used and increases duration of shield by 174 seconds when equipped."},{"id":2294,"name":"Corona Borealis Major IPSS 7","type":11,"icon":998,"level":7,"price":639984,"stack":1,"description":"Discover the future! Sundari.\nWhen equipped this item gives an increase to your Psionic Shield skill and shield regeneration rate.\n\n[Improved Psionic Shield (Equip)\n  \tIncrease Psionic Shield Damage Absorbtion by 94.00 to 2820.00, depending on ability used, and increases duration of shield by 282.00 seconds when equipped.\nRecharge Shields (Equip)\n  \t+38.00% Shield Recharge when equipped. ]","manufacturer":"Sundari","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 7 Device Tech","effects":"Improved Psionic Shield (Equip)\nIncreases Psionic Shield Damage absorption by 94 to 2820, depending on ability used and increases duration of shield by 282 seconds when equipped.\n\nRecharge Shields (Equip)\n+42.0% Shield Recharge when equipped."},{"id":2397,"name":"Corona Borealis Major IPSS 8","type":11,"icon":998,"level":8,"price":1439262,"stack":1,"description":"Discover the future! Sundari.\nWhen equipped this item gives an increase to your Psionic Shield skill and shield regeneration rate.","manufacturer":"Sundari","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 8 Device Tech","effects":"Improved Psionic Shield (Equip)\nIncreases Psionic Shield Damage absorption by 106 to 3180, depending on ability used and increases duration of shield by 318 seconds when equipped.\n\nRecharge Shields (Equip)\n+42.0% Shield Recharge when equipped."},{"id":2113,"name":"Corona Borealis Minor IPSS 5","type":11,"icon":993,"level":5,"price":80011,"stack":1,"description":"Discover the future! Sundari.\nWhen equipped this item causes a small increase to the amount of damage your shield will take, but gives an increase to your Psionic Shield skill and shield regeneration rate.","manufacturer":"Sundari","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 5 Device Tech","effects":"Improved Psionic Shield (Equip)\nIncreases Psionic Shield Damage absorption by 70 to 2100, depending on ability used and increases duration of shield by 210 seconds when equipped.\n\nRecharge Shields (Equip)\n+30.0% Shield Recharge when equipped.\n\nEquipment Damage Magnification - Shield (Equip)\nDecreases a shield's effectiveness at sustaining damage by 20% when equipped."},{"id":2203,"name":"Corona Borealis Minor IPSS 6","type":11,"icon":993,"level":6,"price":180585,"stack":1,"description":"Discover the future! Sundari.\nWhen equipped this item causes a small increase to the amount of damage your shield will take, but gives an icnrease to your Psionic Shield skill and shield regeneration rate.","manufacturer":"Sundari","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 6 Device Tech","effects":"Improved Psionic Shield (Equip)\nIncreases Psionic Shield Damage absorption by 82 to 2450, depending on ability used and increases duration of shield by 246 seconds when equipped.\n\nRecharge Shields (Equip)\n+34.0% Shield Recharge when equipped.\n\nEquipment Damage Magnification - Shield (Equip)\nDecreases a shield's effectiveness at sustaining damage by 20% when equipped."},{"id":2488,"name":"Corona Borealis Prime IPSS 9","type":11,"icon":998,"level":9,"price":3403756,"stack":1,"description":"Discover the Future! Sundari. \nWhen equipped this item causes a small increase to the amount of damage your shield will take, but gives an increase to your Psionic Shield skill and shield regeneration rate, and a decrease to the amount of damage your weapons will take.","manufacturer":"Sundari","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 9 Device Tech","effects":"Improved Psionic Shield (Equip)\nIncreases Psionic Shield Damage absorption by 118 to 3540, depending on ability used and increases duration of shield by 354 seconds when equipped.\n\nRecharge Shields (Equip)\n+45.0% Shield Recharge when equipped.\n\nEquipment Damage Control - Weapons (Equip)\nIncreases your weapons' effectiveness at sustaining damage by 75% when equipped.\n\nEquipment Damage Magnification - Shield (Equip)\nDecreases a shield's effectiveness at sustaining damage by 20% when equipped."},{"id":1385,"name":"Corrupted Mineral","type":13,"icon":1496,"level":4,"price":3950,"stack":240,"description":"Power Core","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5233,"name":"Cosmetics","type":13,"icon":157,"level":2,"price":110,"stack":1,"description":"Hair care products, makeup, perfume and other products that enhance beauty, make skin softer, and care for the body.\n\nBeauty spas and salons on Somerled host some of the most vain, shallow, benal and trite consumers of these goods in the whole Galaxy!","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5135,"name":"Cotton","type":13,"icon":735,"level":3,"price":59,"stack":1,"description":"\"The touch, of cotton... the fabric of our lives\" - Aaron Neville.  Fluffy white cuddly strands used by plants for seed dispersal, and by humans for textile production.\n\nCotton is needed on Mercury Station (Glory's Orbit, Beta Hydri System).","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3232,"name":"Courageous Heart","type":7,"icon":875,"level":4,"price":26628,"stack":1,"description":"Advanced Blacksun Heart-class reactors use cryonic Fusion-core technology for extreme combat durability. They are custom crafted by BlackSun specifically for Red Dragon Tong members.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Reactor Tech\nRequirement: Level 4 Reactor Tech\nReactor capacity: 743\nReactor recharge / sec: 14.9","effects":"Equipment Damage Control - Reactor (Equip)\nIncreases your reactor's effectiveness at sustaining damage by 42% when equipped."},{"id":3485,"name":"Covenant FlexiClear","type":13,"icon":189,"level":5,"price":11314,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Brood Oil","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":898,"name":"Coyote","type":14,"icon":768,"level":4,"price":29947,"stack":1,"description":"When equipped the GETCo Coyote gives increased Recharge Shields Skill but increases Missile Energy Cost.\nGETCo: Continuing our 500 year tradition of sustainable development.","manufacturer":"GETco","stats":"Weapon damage: 57\nDamage type: Plasma\nEnergy use: 80\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 4 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1300\nReload (sec): 9","effects":"Missle Friction (Equip)\nIncrease Missile Energy Cost by 10.00% when equipped.\n\nRecharge Shields Skill (Equip)\nIncreases Recharge Shields Effectiveness by 1.40 Skill Level(s) when equipped."},{"id":1063,"name":"Crab LGS 6","type":14,"icon":776,"level":6,"price":169398,"stack":1,"description":"Discover the future! Sundari. ","manufacturer":"Sundari","stats":"Weapon damage: 68\nDamage type: Energy\nEnergy use: 47\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 6 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1600\nReload (sec): 4","effects":""},{"id":1115,"name":"Crab LGS 7","type":14,"icon":776,"level":7,"price":425373,"stack":1,"description":"Discover the future! Sundari. ","manufacturer":"Sundari","stats":"Weapon damage: 109\nDamage type: Energy\nEnergy use: 54\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 7 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1800\nReload (sec): 4","effects":""},{"id":1157,"name":"Crab LGS 8","type":14,"icon":776,"level":8,"price":1122218,"stack":1,"description":"Discover the future! Sundari. ","manufacturer":"Sundari","stats":"Weapon damage: 175\nDamage type: Energy\nEnergy use: 61\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 8 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1900\nReload (sec): 4","effects":""},{"id":5451,"name":"Cracked Bunyip Egg","type":13,"icon":2123,"level":1,"price":568,"stack":100,"description":"A cracked Bunyip egg.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":4008,"name":"Cracked Chitin Plating","type":13,"icon":1372,"level":8,"price":2891,"stack":60,"description":"Cracked Chitin Plating from a V'rix ship.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":6033,"name":"Cracked Focusing Lens","type":13,"icon":732,"level":6,"price":1857,"stack":60,"description":"This focusing lens has a crack in it, making it useless.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":6047,"name":"Cracked Infrared Sensor","type":13,"icon":995,"level":8,"price":2457,"stack":60,"description":"A delicate infrared sensor, badly damaged.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":6022,"name":"Cracked Warp Core","type":13,"icon":1995,"level":4,"price":1342,"stack":60,"description":"This warp core is badly damaged.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3201,"name":"Crasis 1","type":7,"icon":647,"level":2,"price":4100,"stack":1,"description":"A reactor of unity.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Reactor Tech\nRequirement: Level 2 Reactor Tech\nReactor capacity: 256\nReactor recharge / sec: 7.2","effects":""},{"id":5419,"name":"Crasis 2","type":7,"icon":870,"level":3,"price":13246,"stack":1,"description":"A reactor of unity.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Reactor Tech\nRequirement: Level 3 Reactor Tech\nReactor capacity: 456\nReactor recharge / sec: 10","effects":""},{"id":1824,"name":"Crate Filled with Cement Blocks and Duct Tape","type":11,"icon":744,"level":2,"price":5966,"stack":1,"description":"Nothing helps a Bogeril fix stuff like putting it up on blocks in front of their spaceport and keeping it all together with liberal amounts of GalacDuct Tape.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 2 Device Tech","effects":"Improved Repair Equipment (Equip)\nDecrease repair time by 5.00% when equipped.\n\nIncrease Mass Absolute (Equip)\nIncreases Absolute Mass by 3% when equipped."},{"id":1820,"name":"Crate of Mouthwash and Deodorant","type":11,"icon":744,"level":2,"price":3810,"stack":1,"description":"This crate is filled with various condiments and salves used by the Borgeril when they want to make a good impression on the city folk.","manufacturer":"Bogeril","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 2 Device Tech","effects":"Improved Befriend (Equip)\nImproves Befriend Effectiveness by 0.80 Skill Level(s) when equipped."},{"id":5916,"name":"Crate of Nanobots","type":13,"icon":744,"level":1,"price":59,"stack":1,"description":"A reinforced, high-security crate containing nanobots. Entry is restricted to a security code. To be delivered to Ioanno-J Deinon at Porvenir Mons.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3844,"name":"Creeping Gazer's Energy Manipulation Organ","type":13,"icon":1375,"level":8,"price":8312,"stack":5,"description":"The Organ that allows the Creeping Gazers to emit energy beams from their eyes. ","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3795,"name":"Crimson Force Barrier","type":2,"icon":912,"level":9,"price":5262046,"stack":1,"description":"Manufactured by the Mordana. It's purpose is unknown.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Shield Tech\nRequirement: Level 9 Shield Tech\nShield capacity: 114411\nShield recharge / sec: 686.8","effects":"Improved Critical Targeting (Equip)\nIncreases Critical Hits Chance by 19.48% when equipped.\n\nImproved Combat Trance (Equip)\nImproves Combat Trance effectiveness by 3.89 Skill Level(s) when equipped.\n\nImproved Powerdown (Equip)\nIncreases Powerdown success by 117.00% when equipped.\n\nRecharge Shields (Equip)\n+44.1% Shield Recharge when equipped."},{"id":2325,"name":"Crimson MegaHurtz","type":11,"icon":1000,"level":8,"price":1035513,"stack":1,"description":"BlackSun Device\nExperimental Device. Use at own risk.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 8 Device Tech","effects":"Weaken Explosive (Activated)\n-35.3 Explosive Deflect for 152 seconds to enemy when activated."},{"id":3035,"name":"Crossbow II","type":16,"icon":834,"level":2,"price":7632,"stack":1,"description":"The Sparta Crossbow II projectile launcher requires the use of the Sparta Crossbow rounds. Sparta! When the Call comes, be ready. When equipped, the Crossbow II gives a reduction to the amount of damage your weapons might take.  ","manufacturer":"Sparta","stats":"Ammunition: Crossbow\nEnergy use: 13\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 2 Projectile Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 3100\nReload (sec): 2.4\nRounds per shot: 1","effects":"Equipment Damage Control - Weapons (Equip)\nIncreases your weapons' effectiveness at sustaining damage by 178% when equipped."},{"id":3049,"name":"Crossbow III","type":16,"icon":834,"level":3,"price":17184,"stack":1,"description":"The Sparta Crossbow III projectile launcher requires the use of the Sparta Crossbow rounds. Sparta! When the Call comes, be ready. When equipped, the Crossbow III gives a reduction to the amount of damage your weapons might take. ","manufacturer":"Sparta","stats":"Ammunition: Crossbow\nEnergy use: 10\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 3 Projectile Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 3200\nReload (sec): 1.5\nRounds per shot: 1","effects":"Equipment Damage Control - Weapons (Equip)\nIncreases your weapons' effectiveness at sustaining damage by 205% when equipped."},{"id":3073,"name":"Crossbow IV","type":16,"icon":834,"level":4,"price":37677,"stack":1,"description":"The Sparta Crossbow IV projectile launcher requires the use of the Sparta Crossbow rounds. Sparta! When the Call comes, be ready. When equipped, the Crossbow IV gives a reduction to the amount of damage your weapons might take. ","manufacturer":"Sparta","stats":"Ammunition: Crossbow\nEnergy use: 14\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 4 Projectile Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 3300\nReload (sec): 1.9\nRounds per shot: 2","effects":"Equipment Damage Control - Weapons (Equip)\nIncreases your weapons' effectiveness at sustaining damage by 232% when equipped."},{"id":537,"name":"Crossbow Projectile Round","type":10,"icon":660,"level":2,"price":24,"stack":300,"description":"For use with the Sparta Crossbow projectile launcher.  Sparta!  When the Call comes, be ready.","manufacturer":"Sparta","stats":"Ammunition: Crossbow\nWeapon damage: 7\nDamage type: Impact\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 2 Projectile Weapon","effects":""},{"id":3094,"name":"Crossbow V","type":16,"icon":840,"level":5,"price":92588,"stack":1,"description":"The Sparta Crossbow V projectile launcher requires the use of the Sparta Crossbow rounds. Sparta! When the Call comes, be ready. When equipped, the C