"},{"id":3870,"name":"Dark Matter Reticulum","type":11,"icon":2269,"level":1,"price":379690,"stack":1,"description":"These reticulum are intended to interlock creating a web-like effect.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 1 Device Tech","effects":""},{"id":704,"name":"Dark Matter Sludge","type":10,"icon":2222,"level":8,"price":50,"stack":2000,"description":"Protein mixture required to create force bolts within the Prototype Dark Matter Cannon","manufacturer":"","stats":"Ammunition: Dark Matter Sludge\nWeapon damage: 189\nDamage type: Impact\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 8 Projectile Weapon","effects":""},{"id":5453,"name":"Darkwalker Fin","type":13,"icon":1370,"level":1,"price":1460,"stack":100,"description":"A fin from a Drakwalker.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5454,"name":"Darkwalker Scythe","type":13,"icon":1369,"level":1,"price":1561,"stack":100,"description":"A Darkwalker body part.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5692,"name":"Dastardly Stalk","type":13,"icon":1367,"level":3,"price":3652,"stack":100,"description":"A root from the Evil Plant.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5693,"name":"Dasterly Stalk","type":13,"icon":1368,"level":3,"price":3213,"stack":100,"description":"A stalk from the Evil Plant.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5234,"name":"Data Cubes","type":13,"icon":740,"level":2,"price":58,"stack":1,"description":"An alternate form of memory management. Data cubes are more capable of holding data than discs but are not able to be easily overwritten.\n\nNews that spans an entire Galaxy needs tons of storage space. Net-7 Sol is in constant need of these.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5562,"name":"Data Fragment 2 from Amah","type":13,"icon":1480,"level":7,"price":7829,"stack":60,"description":"Partial Transcript of a Voice Recording Sent from A Pilot Named \"Amah\" - \"...amah codex lost held Deneb will attempt escape more... crew codex ship held Deneb rescue impossible more...\"","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5581,"name":"Data Fragment 3 from Amah","type":13,"icon":1480,"level":8,"price":8628,"stack":60,"description":"Partial Transcript of a Voice Recording Sent from A Pilot Named \"Amah\" - \"...V'rix many codex lost forbidden Deeb... V'rix aware charon appian aragoth vishao escape likely\"","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3956,"name":"Data Fragment LL","type":13,"icon":1381,"level":4,"price":3125,"stack":1,"description":"This scratched and battered data disk contains fragments of text in an unknown language.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3957,"name":"Data Fragment LR","type":13,"icon":1381,"level":4,"price":3125,"stack":1,"description":"This scratched and battered data disk contains fragments of text in an unknown language.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3958,"name":"Data Fragment UL","type":13,"icon":1381,"level":4,"price":3125,"stack":1,"description":"This scratched and battered data disk contains fragments of text in an unknown language.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3959,"name":"Data Fragment UR","type":13,"icon":1381,"level":4,"price":3125,"stack":1,"description":"This scratched and battered data disk contains fragments of text in an unknown language.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":1828,"name":"DataCom","type":11,"icon":925,"level":2,"price":4850,"stack":1,"description":"GETCo System\nContinuing our 500-year tradition of sustainable development.\nThe GETCo Datacom is a multi-functional scanner used for retrieving data from most GETCo manufactured satellites and for temporarily boosting a ship's scan range.","manufacturer":"GETco","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 2 Device Tech","effects":"Scan Boost (Activated)\nGives 25% more radar range for 400 seconds to target when activated."},{"id":1777,"name":"Datacube Restoration Device","type":11,"icon":998,"level":1,"price":15969,"stack":1,"description":"Device used to rebuild the memory structure of a broken datacube, to retrieve the data that was once stored on it.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 1 Device Tech","effects":""},{"id":3762,"name":"Deadly Barrier","type":2,"icon":193,"level":8,"price":1074589,"stack":1,"description":"A semi-organic shield originating from the Ten-Gu home world.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Shield Tech\nRequirement: Level 8 Shield Tech\nShield capacity: 43029\nShield recharge / sec: 291","effects":"Increase Shield Capacity (Equip)\n+7155 Shield Capacity when equipped.\n\nImproved Hacking (Equip)\nImproves Hacking Success by 110% when equipped.\n\nImproved Shield Inversion (Equip)\nImproves Shield Inversion duration by 7.20  seconds while equipped.\n\nImproved Psionic Shield (Equip)\nIncreases Psionic Shield Damage absorption by 109 to 3255, depending on ability used and increases duration of shield by 326 seconds when equipped."},{"id":2624,"name":"Deadly Breeze","type":6,"icon":743,"level":8,"price":1055438,"stack":1,"description":"A semi-organic engine that originates in the Ten-Gu home world.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Engine Tech\nRequirement: Level 8 Engine Tech\nEngine signature: 2200\nImpulse speed: 172\nWarp speed: 4000\nFree-warp energy / sec: 29.2","effects":"Increase Speed (Equip)\nIncreases ship top speed by 224 when equipped.\n\nImproved Critical Targeting (Equip)\nIncreases Critical Hits Chance by 15.00% when equipped.\n\nReduce Warp Cost (Equip)\n70% less energy used to engage warp when equipped.\n\nIncrease Shield Capacity (Equip)\n+6560 Shield Capacity when equipped."},{"id":2422,"name":"Deadly Focus","type":11,"icon":1017,"level":9,"price":3254458,"stack":1,"description":"Based on Jenquai technology brought over by Tzu, the Energy Focus aids in beam combat and permits a limited increase in reactor recharge.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 9 Device Tech","effects":"Recharge Reactor (Activated)\n+30.00% Reactor Recharge for 2160 seconds to target when activated.\n\nBeam Energy Conservation (Equip)\nReduces Beam Energy Cost by 40.0% when equipped.\n\nEnhance Beam (Equip)\nIncreases Beam Damage by 21.0% when equipped."},{"id":2420,"name":"Deadly Grasp","type":11,"icon":2180,"level":9,"price":2684764,"stack":1,"description":"BlackSun Device\nExperimental Device. Use at own risk.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 9 Device Tech","effects":"Repulsor Field (Equip)\nImproves Repulsor Field by 4.33 Skill Level(s) when equipped.\n\nImproved Gravity Link (Equip)\nImproves Gravity Links by 4.83 Skill Level(s) when equipped."},{"id":3814,"name":"Debris","type":13,"icon":729,"level":1,"price":519,"stack":300,"description":"Left over debris from mining. Debris cannot be refined but can be sold for a small sum to most merchants.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":1852,"name":"Decay Duo","type":11,"icon":1011,"level":2,"price":5946,"stack":1,"description":"Sparta!  When the Call comes, be ready.\nWhen activated on a targeted enemy, this item causes a reduction to target's Projectile Weapon skill.","manufacturer":"Sparta","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 2 Device Tech","effects":"Worsen Projectile Handling (Activated)\nReduces Projectile Damage by 6.70% and Projectile Accuracy by 2.70% for 48.00 seconds to enemy when activated."},{"id":2470,"name":"Decay Novem","type":11,"icon":1017,"level":9,"price":2931656,"stack":1,"description":"Sparta! When the Call comes, be ready.\nWhen activated on a targeted enemy, this item causes a decrease to target's Projectile Weapon Skill.\nWhen equipped this item causes a small decrease to your projectile range, but gives an increase to your Projectile Weapon skill and a reduction to projectile weapon energy cost.","manufacturer":"Sparta","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 9 Device Tech","effects":"Worsen Projectile Handling (Activated)\nReduces Projectile Damage by 30.00% and Projectile Accuracy by 12.00% for 216.00 seconds to enemy when activated.\n\nProjectile Weapon Skill (Equip)\nIncreases Projectile Accuracy by 3.93 Skill Level(s) when equipped.\n\nProjectile Energy Conservation (Equip) \nReduces Projectile Energy Cost by 40.0% when equipped.\n\nDecrease Projectile Range (Equip)\nDecreases Projectile Range by 20% when equipped."},{"id":2378,"name":"Decay Octo","type":11,"icon":1017,"level":8,"price":1201505,"stack":1,"description":"Sparta! When the Call comes, be ready. \nWhen activated on a targeted enemy, this item causes a decrease to target's Projectile Weapon skill. \nWhen equipped this item gives an increase to your Projectile Weapon skill. ","manufacturer":"Sparta","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 8 Device Tech","effects":"Worsen Projectile Handling (Activated)\nReduces Projectile Damage by 26.70% and Projectile Accuracy by 10.70% for 192.00 seconds to enemy when activated.\n\nProjectile Weapon Skill (Equip)\nIncreases Projectile Accuracy by 3.53 Skill Level(s) when equipped."},{"id":5509,"name":"Decay of the Vindis","type":11,"icon":1372,"level":7,"price":512934,"stack":1,"description":"A fragment of advanced cybernetic technology.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 7 Device Tech","effects":"Weaken Psionic - BOOST! (Activated)\n-53.0 Psionic Resist for 30 seconds to enemy when activated."},{"id":2005,"name":"Decay Quattuor","type":11,"icon":1014,"level":4,"price":35324,"stack":1,"description":"Sparta! When the Call comes, be ready.\nWhen activated on a targeted enemy, this item causes a reduction to target's Projectile Weapon skill. ","manufacturer":"Sparta","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 4 Device Tech","effects":"Worsen Projectile Handling (Activated)\nReduces Projectile Damage by 13.30% and Projectile Accuracy by 5.30% for 96.00 seconds to enemy when activated."},{"id":2095,"name":"Decay Quinque","type":11,"icon":988,"level":5,"price":72891,"stack":1,"description":"Sparta! When the Call comes, be ready. \nWhen activated on a targeted enemy, this item causes a reduction to target's Projectile Weapon skill.\nWhen equipped this item causes a small increase to your projectile energy cost, but increases your projectile skill. ","manufacturer":"Sparta","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 5 Device Tech","effects":"Worsen Projectile Handling (Activated)\nReduces Projectile Damage by 16.70% and Projectile Accuracy by 6.70% for 120.00 seconds to enemy when activated.\n\nProjectile Weapon Skill (Equip)\nIncreases Projectile Accuracy by 2.33 Skill Level(s) when equipped.\n\nProjectile Friction (Equip)\nIncreases Projectile Energy Cost by 10.00% when equipped."},{"id":2185,"name":"Decay Senio","type":11,"icon":1014,"level":6,"price":164759,"stack":1,"description":"Sparta! When the Call comes, be ready. \nWhen activated on a targeted enemy, this item causes a reduction to target's Projectile Weapon skill.\nWhen equipped this item causes a small increase to your projectile energy cost, but increases your projectile weapon skill. ","manufacturer":"Sparta","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 6 Device Tech","effects":"Worsen Projectile Handling (Activated)\nReduces Projectile Damage by 20.00% and Projectile Accuracy by 8.00% for 144.00 seconds to enemy when activated.\n\nProjectile Weapon Skill (Equip)\nIncreases Projectile Accuracy by 2.73 Skill Level(s) when equipped.\n\nProjectile Friction (Equip)\nIncreases Projectile Energy Cost by 10.00% when equipped."},{"id":2276,"name":"Decay Septem","type":11,"icon":1017,"level":7,"price":514632,"stack":1,"description":"Sparta! When the Call comes, be ready.\nWhen activated on a targeted enemy, this item causes a decrease to target's Projectile Weapon