","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 8 Device Tech","effects":"Turbo Warp (Equip)\nIncreases warp speed by 676.0 when equipped.\n\nReduce Warp Cost (Equip)\n69% less energy used to engage warp when equipped."},{"id":2435,"name":"Dolphin Tail L9","type":11,"icon":706,"level":9,"price":2856775,"stack":1,"description":"GETCo: Continuing our 500 year tradition of sustainable development. \nWhen equipped this item causes a small increase to the damage your engine will take, but gives an increase to your warp speed, a decrease to warp energy cost and a increase to your maneuverability.","manufacturer":"GETco","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 9 Device Tech","effects":"Turbo Warp (Equip)\nIncreases warp speed by 748.0 when equipped.\n\nReduce Warp Cost (Equip)\n76% less energy used to engage warp when equipped.\n\nIncrease Maneuverability (Equip)\nIncreases turn rate by 56% when equipped.\n\nEquipment Damage Magnification - Engine (Equip)\nDecreases a engine's effectiveness at sustaining damage by 20% when equipped."},{"id":938,"name":"Don's Clipper","type":14,"icon":765,"level":5,"price":70998,"stack":1,"description":"BlackSun Beam Weapon\nExperimental Weapon. Use at own risk.\n","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Weapon damage: 12\nDamage type: Energy\nEnergy use: 11\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 5 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1400\nReload (sec): 1.4","effects":"Deflect Explosive (Equip)\n+29 Explosive Deflect when equipped."},{"id":3487,"name":"Dop Glop","type":13,"icon":2079,"level":5,"price":8947,"stack":1,"description":"Wax used in hobby making. Makes a handy chaw gum substitute in a pinch.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3068,"name":"Double-Barreled Bogeril Junk-a-pult","type":16,"icon":841,"level":4,"price":24815,"stack":1,"description":"Primitive 'junk' launcher.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Ammunition: Junk Slugs\nEnergy use: 20\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Leve