\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 4 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1400\nReload (sec): 2","effects":""},{"id":1130,"name":"Dugrand Xango","type":14,"icon":781,"level":8,"price":1300810,"stack":1,"description":"BlackSun Beam Weapon\nExperimental Weapon. Use at own risk.\n","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Weapon damage: 50\nDamage type: Energy\nEnergy use: 15\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 8 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1400\nReload (sec): 1","effects":""},{"id":1787,"name":"Dull Warp Kaza","type":11,"icon":1011,"level":1,"price":3508,"stack":1,"description":"This alien device somehow modifies local warp fields, making warp travel faster without requiring additional energy.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 1 Device Tech","effects":"Turbo Warp (Equip)\nIncreases warp speed by 178.0 when equipped."},{"id":2824,"name":"Dung Cannon","type":15,"icon":1393,"level":9,"price":9218691,"stack":1,"description":"A very old Bogeril made weapon.  It appears to fire semi-solid Scuttlebug Dung.  It is a very potent weapon.","manufacturer":"Bogeril","stats":"Ammunition: Dung\nEnergy use: 152\nSkill required: Missile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 9 Missile Weapon\nReload (sec): 11.9\nRounds per shot: 1","effects":"Boost Missile Range (Equip)\nIncreases Missile Range by 28% when equipped.\n\nIncrease Speed (Equip)\nIncreases ship top speed by 176 when equipped.\n\nShield Renewal (Equip)\n+14.7% Shield Recharge when equipped."},{"id":2835,"name":"Dung Flinger","type":15,"icon":1393,"level":9,"price":4360219,"stack":1,"description":"A powerful semi-organic weapon used by the Scuttlebug Scooter.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Ammunition: Dung\nEnergy use: 450\nSkill required: Missile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 9 Missile Weapon\nReload (sec): 16.9\nRounds per shot: 1","effects":"Weaken Plasma (Activated)\n-31.0 Plasma Deflect for 128 seconds to enemy when activated.\n\nImproved Missile Handling (Equip)\nImproved Mis