 to your speed.\nWhen equipped this item causes a small increase to missile weapon energy cost, but gives an increase to missle weapon range.","manufacturer":"GETco","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 5 Device Tech","effects":"Turbo (Activated)\nIncreases ship top speed by 80% for 10 seconds when activated.\n\nBoost Missile Range (Equip)\nIncreases Missile Range by 24% when equipped.\n\nMissle Friction (Equip)\nIncrease Missile Energy Cost by 10.00% when equipped."},{"id":2148,"name":"Eagle Wing L6","type":11,"icon":678,"level":6,"price":130829,"stack":1,"description":"GETCo: Continuing our 500 year tradition of sustainable development.\nWhen activated on yourself this item gives a short term BOOST to your speed.\nWhen equipped this item causes a small increase to missile weapon energy cost, but gives an increase to missile weapon range.","manufacturer":"GETco","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 6 Device Tech","effects":"Turbo (Activated)\nIncreases ship top speed by 96% for 10 seconds when activated.\n\nBoost Missile Range (Equip)\nIncreases Missile Range by 27% when equipped.\n\nMissle Friction (Equip)\nIncrease Missile Energy Cost by 10.00% when equipped."},{"id":2237,"name":"Eagle Wing L7","type":11,"icon":706,"level":7,"price":514632,"stack":1,"description":"GETCo: Continuing our 500 year tradition of sustainable development.\nWhen activated on yourself this item gives a short term BOOST to your speed.\nWhen equipped this item gives an increase to missile weapon range.","manufacturer":"GETco","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 7 Device Tech","effects":"Turbo (Activated)\nIncreases ship top speed by 112% for 10 seconds when activated.\n\nBoost Missile Range (Equip)\nIncreases Missile Range by 30% when equipped."},{"id":2337,"name":"Eagle Wing L8","type":11,"icon":706,"level":8,"price":1251234,"stack":1,"description":"GETco: Continuing our 500 year tradition of sustainable development. \nWhen activated on yourself this item gives a short term BOOST to your speed. \nWhen equipped this item gives an increase to missile weapon range.","manufacturer":"GETco","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 8 Device Tech","effects":"Turbo (Activated)\nIncreases ship top speed by 128% for 10 seconds when activated.\n\nBoost Missile Range (Equip)\nIncreases Missile Range by 33% when equipped."},{"id":2436,"name":"Eagle Wing L9","type":11,"icon":706,"level":9,"price":3194471,"stack":1,"description":"GETCo: Continuing our 500 year tradition of sustainable development.\nWhen activated on yourself this item gives a short term BOOST to your speed.\nWhen equipped this item causes a small delay in missile weapon firing times, but gives an increase to missle weapon range and a decrease to missle weapon energy costs.","manufacturer":"GETco","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 9 Device Tech","effects":"Turbo (Activated)\nIncreases ship top speed by 144% for 10 seconds when activated.\n\nBoost Missile Range (Equip)\nIncreases Missile Range by 36% when equipped.\n\nMissile Energy Conservation (Equip)\nReduces Missile Energy Cost by 20.0% when equipped.\n\nSlow Missiles (Equip)\nDecrease Missile Firing Rate by 10.00% when equipped"},{"id":6101,"name":"EarthCorps Commendation Medal","type":13,"icon":1384,"level":1,"price":0,"stack":1,"description":"EarthCorps Commendation Medal, presented by EarthCorps Captain Gerard Braun on EarthCorps High Command.","manufacturer":"EarthCorps","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":2665,"name":"EarthCorps Defender","type":15,"icon":806,"level":2,"price":5844,"stack":1,"description":"A missile launcher recovered from a destroyed EarthCorps drone. ","manufacturer":"EarthCorps","stats":"Ammunition: EarthCorps\nEnergy use: 57\nSkill required: Missile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 2 Missile Weapon\nReload (sec): 6.8\nRounds per shot: 1","effects":""},{"id":508,"name":"EarthCorps Defender Missile","type":10,"icon":656,"level":1,"price":10,"stack":50,"description":"Missile ammo scavenged from a destroyed EarthCorps drone. Most likely these missile will fit in a launcher from the same drones if you can find one in working condition.","manufacturer":"EarthCorps","stats":"Ammunition: EarthCorps\nWeapon damage: 20\nDamage type: Explosive\nSkill required: Missile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 1 Missile Weapon\nMissile maneuverability: 112\nWeapon range (m): 4700","effects":""},{"id":5911,"name":"EarthCorps Infiltrator Pod","type":13,"icon":196,"level":1,"price":932,"stack":1,"description":"An EarthCorps special agent. He is specially trained in various \"wet work.\" His current mission is to destroy whatever the Bogeril are building. You are fhere to get him inside.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5402,"name":"EarthCorps Intel:\"Operation Protect and Intercept\"","type":13,"icon":1381,"level":3,"price":3158,"stack":60,"description":"A report that speculates about the pssibilities of another Progen attack to claim the 61 Cygni system. Odds are calculated at greater than 50%, given rising extremist sentiment in Progen politics. The report also analyzes the battle-readiness of EarthCorps Frontier Fleet, stationed near the plant Eshu. The author expresses concern at the Terran smugness over their safety within the system, and makes some derogatory marginal comments about the Progen,esp. with regards to their aroma.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5552,"name":"EarthCorps Military Report: \"Pirates\"","type":13,"icon":1381,"level":4,"price":4628,"stack":60,"description":"A long, detailed and psychologically sophisticated character sketch of Shou Tzu, purported leader of the Red Dragon pirate tongs. Surprising conclusion reached that his tactics in fighting and diplomacy show strong similarities to those taught by the Shinwa sect of the Jebquai. Includes some names of the Red Dragon pirates who are known to be former Shinwa.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5147,"name":"EarthCorps Military Report: \"Stranger Ships\"","type":13,"icon":1381,"level":2,"price":2524,"stack":20,"description":"Lengthy, speculative essay by a retired expert on navigational systems which suggests that the alien ships currently emerging from the Maelstroms do not exhibit random pattrerns of movements, as previously suspected. Instead it is suggested that they \"appear to be searching for something.\"V","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5537,"name":"EarthCorps Requisition Form JC-62-38","type":13,"icon":1281,"level":1,"price":1357,"stack":60,"description":"A document signing over the rights to usage of the spleen, pancreas and left ear of one second-lieutenant Cody van meegram. in the event of that soldier's death. or if he should ever learn to play the banjo. The papers are signed by a 'Corporal Minsk'.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5538,"name":"EarthCorps Requisition Form ZZ-99-12","type":13,"icon":1281,"level":1,"price":1354,"stack":60,"description":"A sixty-two page form ordering a shipment of twelve sixty gallon drums of pencillin and three packets of cough drops to be delivered to Zweihander. Page forty-three is missing, and the receiving address is illegible- blurred over by a large thumbprint and what appeard to be a blob of raspberry jam. The papers are signed by a 'Corporal Minsk.'","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":6153,"name":"EarthCorps Wanted Notice","type":13,"icon":1380,"level":5,"price":1624,"stack":60,"description":"\"Wanted: Nathan Zhao. Suspected leader of the Heung tong of Red Dragon Pirates. If apprehended, bring to Neptune Detention Centre for reward. Last sited in Asteroid Belt Alpha.\" Substantial monetary reward offered by EarthCorps.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":793,"name":"EB-X1 \"Cottonmouth\" Mk. II","type":14,"icon":782,"level":2,"price":4643,"stack":1,"description":"When equipped, the InfinitiCorp EB-X1 \"Cottonmouth\" gives increased Hull Patc