":""},{"id":5868,"name":"Energized Mazzaroth Reaper Spores","type":10,"icon":682,"level":5,"price":0,"stack":130,"description":"These Mazzaroth Reaper Spores have been energized by the Mazzaroth Womb and do enormous amounts of damage to the Warposts in the Mazzaroth Shear.\n\nTemporary","manufacturer":"","stats":"Ammunition: Spores\nWeapon damage: 155\nDamage type: Chemical\nSkill required: Missile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 5 Missile Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 5400","effects":""},{"id":6137,"name":"Energy Cannon","type":14,"icon":785,"level":1,"price":5033,"stack":1,"description":"This experimental weapon fires a blast of energy.","manufacturer":"Shikari","stats":"Weapon damage: 7500\nDamage type: Energy\nEnergy use: 15\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 1 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 7500\nReload (sec): 1","effects":"Boost Beam Range (Equip)\nIncreases Beam Range by 100% when equipped.\n\nScan Boost (Equip)\nAllows ship scanners to see 20000 units farther when equipped.\n\nImproved Beam Handling (Equip)\nImproves Beam Accuracy by 10.00 Skill Level(s) when equipped.\n\nCrank up the Juice (Equip)\n+2000 Reactor Capacity when equipped\n\nImproved Critical Targeting (Equip)\nIncreases Critical Hits Chance by 50.00% when equipped."},{"id":6009,"name":"Energy Modulator","type":13,"icon":988,"level":2,"price":689,"stack":60,"description":"Energy modulators help protect delicate circuits from power surges.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":2471,"name":"Energy Sink Novem","type":11,"icon":998,"level":9,"price":3403756,"stack":1,"description":"Sparta! When the Call comes, be ready. \nWhen equipped this item causes a small increase to your ship`s signature, but gives an increase to your Powerdown skill, a reduction to your projectile weapon energy cost and a increase to your projectile weapon's range.","manufacturer":"Sparta","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 9 Device Tech","effects":"Improved Powerdown (Equip)\nIncreases