 equipped.\n\nWorsen Beam Handling (Equip)\nReduces Beam Damage by 12.00% and Beam Accuracy by 5.00% when equipped."},{"id":3357,"name":"Europa C/9000","type":7,"icon":878,"level":9,"price":2389175,"stack":1,"description":"Discover the future!  Sundari.\nWhen activated on a targeted group member, this item converts target's reactor to shield energy.\nWhen equipped this item causes a decrease to your Beam Weapon Skill, but gives an increase to your Fold Space Skill.","manufacturer":"Sundari","stats":"Skill required: Reactor Tech\nRequirement: Level 9 Reactor Tech\nReactor capacity: 6369\nReactor recharge / sec: 47.1","effects":"Shunt to Shield (Activated)\n+25.00% Shield Recharge and -25.00% Reactor Recharge for 1440.00 seconds when activated.\n\nImproved Fold Space (Equip)\nIncreases Fold Space distance by 686 when equipped.\n\nWorsen Beam Handling (Equip)\nReduces Beam Damage by 12.00% and Beam Accuracy by 5.00% when equipped."},{"id":6113,"name":"Evacuation Pod","type":13,"icon":194,"level":3,"price":310,"stack":1,"description":"Constructed from an alloy of Tantalum. Universal Steel and Khnumium, this strong but lightweight container offers protection from both vacuum and planetary environments. It contains enough supplies for 3 people for 1 week. If jettersoned in space, it will descend to the nearest planet.\n","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3886,"name":"Eviscerator Torpedos","type":10,"icon":719,"level":6,"price":18,"stack":1,"description":"BlackSun Projectile Ammunition\nExperimental Weapon. Use at own risk.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Ammunition: Eviscerator\nWeapon damage: 36\nDamage type: Impact\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 6 Projectile Weapon","effects":""},{"id":1198,"name":"Evolver Actu8 Max","type":13,"icon":1475,"level":8,"price":287038,"stack":240,"description":"Only to be out done by ourselves the Evolver Actu8 Max is durable and almost always works when you need it. \"Always Innovating, Always Evol