Reactor Recharge for 1440 seconds to target when activated.\n\nEquipment Damage Control - Devices (Equip)\nIncreases your devices' effectiveness at sustaining damage by 65% when equipped.\n\nEquipment Damage Magnification - Reactor (Equip)\nDecreases a reactor's effectiveness at sustaining damage by 20% when equipped."},{"id":2490,"name":"Fornax Borealis Prime RE 9","type":11,"icon":707,"level":9,"price":2295627,"stack":1,"description":"Discover the future! Sundari. \nWhen activated on a targeted friendly this item gives a significant increase to target's reactor regeneration rate. \nWhen equipped this item causes a small decrease to your psionic resistance, but gives a decrease to the amount of damage your devices and reactor will take.\n","manufacturer":"Sundari","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 9 Device Tech","effects":"Recharge Reactor (Activated)\n+30.00% Reactor Recharge for 2160 seconds to target when activated.\n\nEquipment Damage Control - Devices (Equip)\nIncreases your devices' effectiveness at sustaining damage by 86% when equipped.\n\nResist Psionic (Equip)\n+30.0 Psionic Resist when equipped.\n\nEquipment Damage Magnification - Reactor (Equip)\nDecreases a reactor's effectiveness at sustaining damage by 20% when equipped."},{"id":6096,"name":"Fourth Fragment of Inspiration","type":13,"icon":730,"level":1,"price":150,"stack":1,"description":"","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":1776,"name":"Fourth Inspiration","type":11,"icon":975,"level":1,"price":20780,"stack":1,"description":"October 11, 2050 - After Spending six months abord ship, I am realizing things about human nature that I would never have realized on Earth. A new way is needed, this much I know, but...<there is more>","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 1 Device Tech","effects":""},{"id":813,"name":"Fox","type":14,"icon":785,"level":3,"price":13846,"stack":1,"description":"When equipped the GETCo Mastiff gives increased Hull Patch Skill and increases the ships tractor beam speed. \nGETCo: continuing our 500 year tradition of sustainable development.","manufacturer":"GETco","stats":"Weapon damage: 27\nDamage type: Plasma\nEnergy use: 27\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 3 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1300\nReload (sec): 6","effects":"Hull Patch Skill (Equip)\nImproves Hull Patch effectiveness by 1.13 Skill Levels when equipped.\n\nFast Tractor Beam (Equip)\nIncreases tractor beam speed by 52% when equipped."},{"id":894,"name":"Foxy Class F Laser","type":14,"icon":766,"level":4,"price":31039,"stack":1,"description":"When equipped, the Tada-O Foxy Class F Laser gives increased Repair Equipment Skill. \nTada-O Corporation very much full of pride with introducing number one new Foxy Class F Laser. Honorable client's beautiful concubine will squeal will much pleasure when Foxy Class F Laser is employed. Tada-O! Big! Strong! Wow! ","manufacturer":"Tada-O","stats":"Weapon damage: 33\nDamage type: Energy\nEnergy use: 50\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 4 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1200\nReload (sec): 5","effects":"Improved Repair Equipment (Equip)\nDecrease repair time by 8.00% when equipped."},{"id":3989,"name":"Fractured Chitin Plating","type":13,"icon":1372,"level":7,"price":99421,"stack":180,"description":"You cannot tell if this is a piece from a Vrix ship, or a piece of the Vrix itself.\n\n[Price and stack unverified]","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3963,"name":"Fragment of a Datacube","type":13,"icon":730,"level":1,"price":1022,"stack":1,"description":"Piece of a broken datacube. This once contained data, but was ruined when destroyed.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5542,"name":"Fragment violet-orange","type":13,"icon":1943,"level":1,"price":1283,"stack":60,"description":"WH6B5RD2NTH2H5M1NM3NDW3THTR5THS3TC1NTP4SS3BL6C4NT13NB4THTH2G1T2S1NDT3M21R2M6ST3C1LB1RR32RSD22M2DT42L3M3N1T2FR1GM2NT1T34N31MT21CH3NGTH2VR3XT4FL63NGR45PS","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5467,"name":"Fragmented Crystal","type":13,"icon":1939,"level":1,"price":1392,"stack":100,"description":"A fragmented crystal.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5544,"name":"Freespacer Record 6C1","type":13,"icon":1381,"level":2,"price":2148,"stack":60,"description":"Apparently an annotated list of individuals and clans that attended a recent prospecting trip to Aganju.. Groups are classified according to the strenght of thier ties to Freespacer \"Old Families.\" Parts of the document are written in English, parts in Zeppan. Paper smells strongly of spilled salsa.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5870,"name":"Freespacer Record Ga1","type":13,"icon":1381,"level":6,"price":6108,"stack":60,"description":"Apparently an annotated list of individuals and clans that wre invited to the Viceroy's recent birthday bash in Lagarto. Entries are classified according to their generosity. Parts of the document are written in English, parts in Zeppan. Paper smells strongly of spilled chilli.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5557,"name":"Freespacer Record Si1","type":13,"icon":1381,"level":5,"price":5639,"stack":60,"description":"Apparently an annotated list of individuals and clans that were killed during a recent clash in Xipe Totec.. Obituaries are classified according to thier gruesomeness. Parts of the document are written in English, parts in Zeppan. Paper smells strongly of spilled tears.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":1842,"name":"Frenzied Missile Extender","type":11,"icon":1013,"level":2,"price":4311,"stack":1,"description":"Built from various parts found in the scrapyards of Luna, this device extends the firing range of missile launchers.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 2 Device Tech","effects":"Boost Missile Range (Equip)\nIncreases Missile Range by 14% when equipped."},{"id":5930,"name":"Fresh Heart","type":13,"icon":1375,"level":2,"price":702,"stack":60,"description":"A badly-damaged, multi-valved organic 'pumping organ'.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5922,"name":"Friedrich Wilhelm Nietzsche's Writing","type":13,"icon":1280,"level":1,"price":300,"stack":1,"description":"A copy of the philosophical writing of Friedrich Wilhelm Nietzsche.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5240,"name":"Friendship Tourists","type":13,"icon":194,"level":2,"price":120,"stack":1,"description":"Tourists from Friendship-7 who want to tour Beta Hydri. \n\nIt would be profitable to bring Friendship Tourists to Friendship 7 in Beta Hydri.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":575,"name":"Fright Chemical Bullet","type":10,"icon":692,"level":3,"price":8,"stack":400,"description":"For use with the Tada-O Fright Breed PL 4B projectile launcher. Tada-O Corporation Tada-O! Big! Strong! Wow! ","manufacturer":"Tada-O","stats":"Ammunition: Fright Bullet\nWeapon damage: 8\nDamage type: Chemical\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 3 Projectile Weapon","effects":""},{"id":576,"name":"Fright Impact Bullets","type":10,"icon":692,"level":3,"price":8,"stack":400,"description":"For use with the Tada-O Fright Breed PL 4B projectile launcher. Tada-O Corporation Tada-O! Big! Strong! Wow! ","manufacturer":"Tada-O","stats":"Ammunition: Fright Bullet\nWeapon damage: 8\nDamage type: Impact\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 3 Projectile Weapon","effects":""},{"id":5706,"name":"Fringe Comb","type":13,"icon":1369,"level":3,"price":3527,"stack":100,"description":"An ivory comb made from a Fringe.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5752,"name":"Fringe Fin","type":13,"icon":1370,"level":4,"price":4388,"stack":100,"description":"The fin from a Fringe horror.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5778,"name":"Fringe Node","type":13,"icon":1367,"level":5,"price":5274,"stack":100,"description":"A brainnode from Fringe Horror.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":1583,"name":"Frit","type":13,"icon":2145,"level":7,"price":131498,"stack":240,"description":"For polishin' and other handy work.","manufacturer":"Bogeril","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5513,"name":"Frosted Heart Cookie","type":13,"icon":2391,"level":1,"price":958,"stack":1,"description":"YUMMY! A fresh-baked holiday treat created by the Elfman triplets. Flavored with pepperment. Lonny, Donny and Gunter Elfman, Inc.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5127,"name":"Frozen Animal Zygotes","type":13,"icon":1484,"level":2,"price":131,"stack":1,"description":"Little buggers cute and not so much, all cryogenically stored and waiting to be raised and consumed.\n\nZygotes are needed at Kinshasa-Mbali (Aganju, 61 Cygni A System).","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5241,"name":"Frozen Beef","type":13,"icon":1289,"level":4,"price":890,"stack":1,"description":"A long time Progen favorite, delicious beef frozen to preserve taste with no preservatives.\n\nFrozen Beef is in demand at Porvenir Mons (Planet Endriago, Gallina System)","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5103,"name":"Frozen Meat","type":13,"icon":1289,"level":2,"price":68,"stack":1,"description":"Cryogenically prepared and stored cuts of animal flesh, sufficently mixed with soy by-product to form round patties.\n\nFrozen Meat is needed at Fenris Observatory, Porvenir Mons, Friendship-7, Orsini Mining Platform, and Prasad Station.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5107,"name":"Fruit","type":13,"icon":1289,"level":2,"price":99,"stack":1,"description":"Juicy bits of sweet goodness that supply vitamin C and other important nutrients to the body. Packaged under nitrogen for freshness during extended transport.\n\nFruit is in demand at Porvenir Mons, Prasad Station, and Yasuragi City.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":4032,"name":"Full Food Barrel for Waggles","type":13,"icon":2220,"level":7,"price":66012,"stack":1,"description":"Adriel's pet waggles should enjoy this snack.\n\n[Price and stack unverified]","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":4012,"name":"Fungal Growth","type":13,"icon":1284,"level":1,"price":150,"stack":1,"description":"Fungal Growth. Care to open. Danger.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5242,"name":"Fungus Spores","type":13,"icon":148,"level":1,"price":68,"stack":1,"description":"Small spores to breed a species of fungi that is good at breaking down rock for minerals.\n\nIn demand at Kinshasa Mbali (Aganju, 61 Cygni System).","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":828,"name":"Furious Blue Gaze","type":14,"icon":782,"level":3,"price":13422,"stack":1,"description":"Gaze-class beam weapons are commonly equipped by lower order members of the Red Dragon Tongs.  The Blue Gaze beams were created specifically for officers of the Lan Leung.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Weapon damage: 4\nDamage type: Energy\nEnergy use: 7\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 3 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1300\nReload (sec): 1","effects":""},{"id":827,"name":"Furious Gaze","type":14,"icon":782,"level":3,"price":11177,"stack":1,"description":"Gaze-class beam weapons are commonly equipped by lower order members of the Red Dragon Tongs. They suffer somewhat in damage output but usually have better than average range.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Weapon damage: 8\nDamage type: Energy\nEnergy use: 16\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 3 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1300\nReload (sec): 2","effects":""},{"id":637,"name":"Fury Missiles","type":10,"icon":714,"level":6,"price":130,"stack":180,"description":"Fury Missiles are used in Thorgil's Fury.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Ammunition: Fury\nWeapon damage: 250\nDamage type: Chemical\nSkill required: Missile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 6 Missile Weapon\nMissile maneuverability: 247\nWeapon range (m): 5400","effects":""},{"id":3164,"name":"Fury of the Master","type":16,"icon":2279,"level":9,"price":2985651,"stack":1,"description":"Soul chilling malice swirls violently around this weapon.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Ammunition: Bile Infused\nEnergy use: 32\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 9 Projectile Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 3600\nReload (sec): 1.3\nRounds per shot: 1","effects":"Turbo Projectile (Equip)\nReduce Projectile Delay by 40.00% when equipped\n\nIncrease Speed (Equip)\nIncreases ship top speed by 274 when equipped.\n\nIncrease Shield Capacity (Equip)\n+9110 Shield Capacity when equipped.\n\nGreater Energy Feedback (Equip)\nFeeds back 14.3% (up to 27.4) of all energy-based damage to source."},{"id":3167,"name":"Fury of the Ten-Gu","type":16,"icon":1404,"level":9,"price":2568548,"stack":1,"description":"A weapon of incredible power!","manufacturer":"","stats":"Ammunition: Ten-Gu Shards\nEnergy use: 34\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 9 Projectile Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 3600\nReload (sec): 2\nRounds per shot: 1","effects":"Turbo Projectile (Equip)\nReduce Projectile Delay by 40.00% when equipped\n\nIncrease Speed (Equip)\nIncreases ship top speed by 234 when equipped.\n\nIncrease Shield Capacity (Equip)\n+8510 Shield Capacity when equipped."},{"id":3202,"name":"Fusion I","type":7,"icon":870,"level":2,"price":4002,"stack":1,"description":"A reactor of unity.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Reactor Tech\nRequirement: Level 2 Reactor Tech\nReactor capacity: 256\nReactor recharge / sec: 7.2","effects":""},{"id":3225,"name":"Fusion II","type":7,"icon":870,"level":3,"price":13315,"stack":1,"description":"A reactor of unity!","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Reactor Tech\nRequirement: Level 3 Reactor Tech\nReactor capacity: 456\nReactor recharge / sec: 9.9","effects":""},{"id":6008,"name":"Fusion Reactor Casing","type":13,"icon":1473,"level":2,"price":712,"stack":60,"description":"This reactor casing once held an active 'micro-sun' reaction, but now lies dormant.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3518,"name":"Galactic Chain Steel","type":13,"icon":1478,"level":6,"price":9979,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Galactic Iron.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3464,"name":"Galactic Iron","type":13,"icon":187,"level":4,"price":2310,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Galactic Ore\nRefines to: Galactic Chain Steel\n","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":2914,"name":"Galactic Ore","type":13,"icon":1483,"level":4,"price":58,"stack":300,"description":"Refines to: Galactic Iron\nRe-Refines to: Galactic Chain Steel","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":6160,"name":"Galactic Rimstone","type":13,"icon":1469,"level":7,"price":582,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Raw Galactic Rimstone","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":6025,"name":"GalaxyQuest, Season One","type":13,"icon":1381,"level":4,"price":1266,"stack":60,"description":"This is a rare boxed edition of GalaxyQuest, Season One. In Mint Condition.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3190,"name":"Gallina MCG-2","type":7,"icon":866,"level":2,"price":6628,"stack":1,"description":"Discover the future! Sundari.\nWhen activated on a targeted group member, this item gives target an increased energy regeneration.\nWhen equipped this item gives an increase to your beam range.","manufacturer":"Sundari","stats":"Skill required: Reactor Tech\nRequirement: Level 2 Reactor Tech\nReactor capacity: 331\nReactor recharge / sec: 7.6","effects":"Recharge Reactor (Activated)\n+15.00% Reactor Recharge for 500 seconds to target when activated.\n\nBoost Beam Range (Equip)\nIncreases Beam Range by 28% when equipped."},{"id":3210,"name":"Gallina MCG-3","type":7,"icon":866,"level":3,"price":15678,"stack":1,"description":"Discover the future! Sundari.\nWhen activated on a targeted group member, this item gives target an increased energy regeneration.\nWhen equipped this item gives an increase to your beam range.","manufacturer":"Sundari","stats":"Skill required: Reactor Tech\nRequirement: Level 3 Reactor Tech\nReactor capacity: 581\nReactor recharge / sec: 10.3","effects":"Recharge Reactor (Activated)\n+15.00% Reactor Recharge for 640 seconds to target when activated.\n\nBoost Beam Range (Equip)\nIncreases Beam Range by 31% when equipped."},{"id":3234,"name":"Gallina MCG-4","type":7,"icon":866,"level":4,"price":36986,"stack":1,"description":"Discover the future! Sundari.\nWhen activated on a targeted group member, this item gives target an increased energy regeneration.\nWhen equipped this item gives an increase to your beam range.","manufacturer":"Sundari","stats":"Skill required: Reactor Tech\nRequirement: Level 4 Reactor Tech\nReactor capacity: 943\nReactor recharge / sec: 14.1","effects":"Recharge Reactor (Activated)\n+15.00% Reactor Recharge for 800 seconds to target when activated.\n\nBoost Beam Range (Equip)\nIncreases Beam Range by 33% when equipped."},{"id":3439,"name":"Gallium","type":13,"icon":187,"level":3,"price":812,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Gallium Ore\nA bright, silvery-white metal, liquid at room temperature, that is frequently used as a reflective and in electrical applications.  ","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":2896,"name":"Gallium Ore","type":13,"icon":1483,"level":3,"price":20,"stack":300,"description":"Refines to: Gallium","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":6169,"name":"Garnet","type":13,"icon":1468,"level":2,"price":7,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Raw Garnet","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5243,"name":"Gas Canisters","type":13,"icon":2386,"level":2,"price":67,"stack":1,"description":"Canisters full of natural gas. It can be used as an energy source but it also helpful in manufacturing processes.\n\nGas Canisters are needed at Somerled Station (New Edinburgh, Tau Ceti System).","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5564,"name":"Gate Construction Plans","type":13,"icon":1381,"level":7,"price":7854,"stack":60,"description":"Apparently this is an incomplete schematic for constructing a Gate. Part of it is missing and and the rest has unidentifiable stains on it.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5978,"name":"Gate Turret Defense Laser","type":14,"icon":775,"level":9,"price":10,"stack":1,"description":"Pew Pew Laser Beam!\n\nRiia it isn't working. =(","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Weapon damage: 9999\nDamage type: Plasma\nEnergy use: 15\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 9 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 9999\nReload (sec): 0.1","effects":"Boost Beam Range (Equip)\nIncreases Beam Range by 100% when equipped.\n\nImproved Critical Targeting (Equip)\nIncreases Critical Hits Chance by 100.00% when equipped.\n\nHull Damage Control (Equip)\nIncreases your hulls effectiveness at sustaining damage by 100% when equipped.\n\nIncrease Weapon Skill (Equip)\nIncreases Weapon Accuracy by 500.00 Skill Level(s) when equipped."},{"id":2661,"name":"Gavone's Enforcer","type":15,"icon":2178,"level":2,"price":1690,"stack":1,"description":"","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Ammunition: Dragonspit\nEnergy use: 20\nSkill required: Missile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 2 Missile Weapon\nReload (sec): 8\nRounds per shot: 1","effects":""},{"id":2514,"name":"Gavone's Fencer","type":6,"icon":2177,"level":2,"price":4464,"stack":1,"description":"BlackSun Fencer-class engines are commonly equipped by low-ranking Red Dragon Tong members.\n","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Engine Tech\nRequirement: Level 2 Engine Tech\nEngine signature: 2300\nImpulse speed: 83\nWarp speed: 2500\nFree-warp energy / sec: 6","effects":""},{"id":1159,"name":"Gaze of Amah","type":14,"icon":1389,"level":9,"price":6313390,"stack":1,"description":"Sparta. When the call comes, be ready.\nDedicated to a fallen hero. Honor and remember her sacafice!\nCommisioned for use at the Mars Construction Yards.","manufacturer":"Sparta","stats":"Weapon damage: 528\nDamage type: Plasma\nEnergy use: 126\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 9 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1800\nReload (sec): 6","effects":"Turbo Beam (Equip)\nReduces Beam Delay by 40.0% when equipped.\n\nBeam Focus (Equip)\nIncreases Beam Damage by 3.0% when equipped."},{"id":1117,"name":"Gaze of the Martyr","type":14,"icon":1389,"level":8,"price":2207148,"stack":1,"description":"Sparta. When the Call comes, be ready.\nDeadicated to a fallen hero. Honor and remember her sacrifice!\nCommisioned for use at the Mars Construction Yards.","manufacturer":"Sparta","stats":"Weapon damage: 330\nDamage type: Plasma\nEnergy use: 116\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 8 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1800\nReload (sec): 6","effects":"Beam Focus (Equip)\nIncreases Beam Damage by 3.0% when equipped.\n\nTurbo Beam (Equip)\nReduces Beam Delay by 40.0% when equipped."},{"id":1814,"name":"Gazing Eye","type":11,"icon":925,"level":2,"price":3906,"stack":1,"description":"Blacksun eye-class scanning sensors are commonly equipped on Red Dragon tong scout ships.  The sensors employ passive microwave scanning technologies to effectively extend scouting ranges.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 2 Device Tech","effects":"Scan Boost (Equip)\nAllows ship scanners to see 930 units farther when equipped."},{"id":5511,"name":"Gene map from Amah's crew","type":13,"icon":742,"level":1,"price":0,"stack":60,"description":"The Gene-Map of one of Amah's fallen officers..","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5309,"name":"Genetic Material","type":13,"icon":743,"level":1,"price":37,"stack":1,"description":"Genetic goo used in cloning.  Needed Badly at  Praetorium Mons.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5115,"name":"GenoColor","type":13,"icon":2393,"level":4,"price":694,"stack":1,"description":"One of the rare exported products of Progen genetic engineering. Vain aristocrats pay well for the ability to color their body parts at whim.\n\nGenoColor is in demand at Somerled Station (New Edinburg, Tau Ceti System), and Loki Station (High Earth, Sol System, Traders Only!)","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3409,"name":"Germanium","type":13,"icon":1486,"level":2,"price":338,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Germanium Ore\nA greyish-white metal most commonly used as a semiconductor and as an alloying agent.  ","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":2872,"name":"Germanium Ore","type":13,"icon":1483,"level":2,"price":8,"stack":300,"description":"Refines to: Germanium","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5506,"name":"Getco artifact G2","type":13,"icon":1383,"level":3,"price":3497,"stack":100,"description":"A bent \"American Impress\" credit card form 2106. Cut half through with scissors. Name on surface: Lloyd Fernherb.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":2508,"name":"GETCo Harrier","type":6,"icon":953,"level":2,"price":5206,"stack":1,"description":"GETCo: Continuing our 500 year tradition of sustainable development.\nWhen equipped this item gives an increase to your maneuverability and increases your missile range.","manufacturer":"GETco","stats":"Skill required: Engine Tech\nRequirement: Level 2 Engine Tech\nEngine signature: 2600\nImpulse speed: 85\nWarp speed: 2500\nFree-warp energy / sec: 6","effects":"Increase Maneuverability (Equip)\nIncreases turn rate by 26% when equipped.\n\nBoost Missile Range (Equip)\nIncreases Missile Range by 15% when equipped."},{"id":3721,"name":"Gettysburg Alpha","type":2,"icon":912,"level":6,"price":212768,"stack":1,"description":"Sparta! When the Call comes, be ready.\nWhen equipped this item causes an increase to your ship's vulnerability to energy and EMP attacks, but gives an increase to your Shield Inversion Skill.","manufacturer":"Sparta","stats":"Skill required: Shield Tech\nRequirement: Level 6 Shield Tech\nShield capa