","effects":""},{"id":2224,"name":"Gorgon's Dire Gaze","type":11,"icon":1017,"level":7,"price":514632,"stack":1,"description":"BlackSun Device\nExperimental Device. Use at own risk.\nWhen activated on a targeted enemy this item causes a decrease to target's impact resistance.\nWhen equipped this item gives an increase to your missile weapon range.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 7 Device Tech","effects":"Weaken Impact (Activated)\n-38.0 Impact Deflect for 168 seconds to enemy when activated.\n\nBoost Missile Range (Equip)\nIncreases Missile Range by 30% when equipped.\n\nIncrease Mass (Equip)\nIncreases ship mass by 10% when equipped."},{"id":2318,"name":"Gorgon's Dire Stare","type":11,"icon":1017,"level":8,"price":1201505,"stack":1,"description":"BlackSun Device Experimental Device. Use at own risk. When activated on a targeted enemy this item causes a decrease to target's impact resistance. When equipped this item gives an increase to your missile weapon range.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 8 Device Tech","effects":"Weaken Impact (Activated)\n-42.0 Impact Deflect for 192 seconds to enemy when activated.\n\nBoost Missile Range (Equip)\nIncreases Missile Range by 33% when equipped."},{"id":2418,"name":"Gorgon's Dread Glare","type":11,"icon":1017,"level":9,"price":3303174,"stack":1,"description":"BlackSun Device\nExperimental Device. Use at own risk.\nWhen activated on a targeted enemy this item casues a decrease to target's impact resistance.\nWhen equipped this item causes a small increase to your ship's mass, but gives an increase to your missile weapon range and a decrease to your missile weapon energy cost.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 9 Device Tech","effects":"Weaken Impact (Activated)\n-46.0 Impact Deflect for 216 seconds to enemy when activated.\n\nBoost Missile Range (Equip)\nIncreases Missile Range 