,"effects":"Weaken Impact (Activated)\n-22.0 Impact Deflect for 72 seconds to enemy when activated."},{"id":1961,"name":"Gorgon's Glint","type":11,"icon":1011,"level":4,"price":49772,"stack":1,"description":"BlackSun Device.\nExperimental Device. Use at own risk.\nWhen activated on a targeted enemy this item causes a decrease to target's impact resistance.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 4 Device Tech","effects":"Weaken Impact (Activated)\n-26.0 Impact Deflect for 96 seconds to enemy when activated."},{"id":1026,"name":"Goring Claw","type":14,"icon":765,"level":6,"price":206859,"stack":1,"description":"Claw-class beam weapons are standard equipment for the Red Dragon Dai-Lo class fighters. They include a small targeting computer that increases the accuracy of the weapon.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Weapon damage: 36\nDamage type: Energy\nEnergy use: 25\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 6 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1600\nReload (sec): 2","effects":"Improved Beam Handling (Equip)\nImproves Beam Accuracy by 1.70 Skill Level(s) when equipped."},{"id":953,"name":"Gouging Claw","type":14,"icon":765,"level":5,"price":75108,"stack":1,"description":"Claw-class beam weapons are standard equipment for the Red Dragon Dai-Lo class fighters. They include a small targeting computer that increases the accuracy of the weapon.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Weapon damage: 22\nDamage type: Energy\nEnergy use: 21\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 5 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1500\nReload (sec): 2","effects":"Improved Beam Handling (Equip)\nImproves Beam Accuracy by 1.50 Skill Level(s) when equipped."},{"id":770,"name":"Gradient Laser","type":14,"icon":642,"level":1,"price":0,"stack":1,"description":"Basic weapon for Terran pilots.","manufacturer":"InfinitiCorp","stats":"Weapon damage: 3\nDamage type: Energy\nEnergy use: 11\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 1 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 900\nReload (sec): 2","effects":""},{"id":5081,"name":"Grail Affinity Device","type":11,"icon":649,"level":1,"price":1000,"stack":1,"description":"When Equiped this device allows you to safely harvest Quest Grail Waters from mysterious and bizarre Hydrocarbon Deposits. It also boosts scan range for asteroids bearing grail water.\n\n[temp for beta]","manufacturer":"EarthCorps","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 1 Device Tech","effects":""},{"id":3009,"name":"Grail Water","type":13,"icon":1485,"level":9,"price":3759,"stack":300,"description":"Refines to: Arthurian Plastic","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":4030,"name":"Grain","type":13,"icon":1378,"level":1,"price":51,"stack":1,"description":"A combination of wheat, barley, oats corn and rice. The staples of any diet.\n\nGrain is in demand at Fenris, Porvenir Mons, Net-7, EarthCorps Command, Friendship-7, Loki Station, Prasad Station","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":2042,"name":"Grand Ayza","type":11,"icon":995,"level":5,"price":77942,"stack":1,"description":"The BlackSun Ayza is used by Clan Chavez to protect against impact attacks.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 5 Device Tech","effects":"Deflect Impact (Activated)\n+20 Impact Deflect for 1400 seconds when activated."},{"id":2259,"name":"Grand Baka","type":11,"icon":679,"level":6,"price":181370,"stack":1,"description":"The InZen Baka is used by Clan Chavez to see farther and faster, while keeping their own signature low.","manufacturer":"InZen","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 6 Device Tech","effects":"Scan Boost (Activated)\nGives 25% more radar range for 1560 seconds to target when activated.\n\nReduce Ship Signature (Equip)\nGives a ship 37% less radar footprint when equipped."},{"id":2143,"name":"Grand Caplata","type":11,"icon":1014,"level":6,"price":186849,"stack":1,"description":"This Clan Chavez device drains a target's reactors and shields for one low energy cost.","manufacturer":"Evoco","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 6 Device Tech","effects":"Reactor Drain (Activated)\n-24.4% Reactor Recharge for 72 seconds to enemy when activated.\n\nShield Drain (Activated)\n-24.4% Shield Recharge for 72 seconds to enemy when activated."},{"id":3295,"name":"Grand Dhambier","type":7,"icon":880,"level":7,"price":504621,"stack":1,"description":"Any Dhambier Reactor will provide high recharge energy capacitance along with protection from jarring impact damage. ","manufacturer":"InZen","stats":"Skill required: Reactor Tech\nRequirement: Level 7 Reactor Tech\nReactor capacity: 2342\nReactor recharge / sec: 31.7","effects":"Deflect Impact (Equip)\n+30 Impact Deflect when equipped."},{"id":3699,"name":"Grand Hounfour","type":2,"icon":909,"level":5,"price":78806,"stack":1,"description":"The Evoco Hounfour is specially-built for Miguel Chavez's cronies. It provides the ultimate in shield-cap.","manufacturer":"Evoco","stats":"Skill required: Shield Tech\nRequirement: Level 5 Shield Tech\nShield capacity: 2930\nShield recharge / sec: 19.5","effects":""},{"id":3229,"name":"Grand Loa","type":7,"icon":874,"level":4,"price":35874,"stack":1,"description":"The Loa is often known as the little brother of the Dhambier reactor. It provides lo-cap, high-recharge energy.","manufacturer":"InZen","stats":"Skill required: Reactor Tech\nRequirement: Level 4 Reactor Tech\nReactor capacity: 689\nReactor recharge / sec: 15.3","effects":""},{"id":2732,"name":"Grand Ogun","type":15,"icon":811,"level":5,"price":83429,"stack":1,"description":"The BlackSun Ogun Missile Launcher fires plasma missiles designed to penetrate Montague shields. ","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Ammunition: Ogun\nEnergy use: 74\nSkill required: Missile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 5 Missile Weapon\nReload (sec): 10.7\nRounds per shot: 2","effects":""},{"id":2057,"name":"Grand Petro","type":11,"icon":1014,"level":5,"price":94473,"stack":1,"description":"The Chavez Grand Petro lets them lower the Montagues's energy deflection from range.","manufacturer":"Evoco","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 5 Device Tech","effects":"Weaken Energy (Activated)\n-28.3 Energy Deflect for 110 seconds to enemy when activated."},{"id":2085,"name":"Grand Rada","type":11,"icon":995,"level":5,"price":126153,"stack":1,"description":"The Rada is one of the most useful devices in the Chavez's battle with the Montague. It lets them strip away plasma deflection, making a target more vulnerable to the potent Chavez missiles.","manufacturer":"InZen","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 5 Device Tech","effects":"Weaken Plasma (Activated)\n-28.3 Plasma Deflect for 110 seconds to enemy when activated."},{"id":804,"name":"Grand Sango","type":14,"icon":779,"level":3,"price":12089,"stack":1,"description":"InZen manufactured beams have often been the highest powered weapons in the Galaxy, while being prone to malfunction. The Sango line, manufactured for the Chavez, is no different.","manufacturer":"InZen","stats":"Weapon damage: 10\nDamage type: Energy\nEnergy use: 20\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 3 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1200\nReload (sec): 2","effects":""},{"id":1079,"name":"Grand Shango","type":14,"icon":781,"level":7,"price":501041,"stack":1,"description":"InZen manufactured beams have often been the highest powered weapons in the Galaxy, while being prone to malfunction. The Sango line, manufactured for the Chavez, is no different.","manufacturer":"InZen","stats":"Weapon damage: 31\nDamage type: Energy\nEnergy use: 14\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 7 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1600\nReload (sec): 1","effects":"Deflect Impact (Equip)\n+30 Impact Deflect when equipped."},{"id":3999,"name":"Granny's Spectacles","type":13,"icon":2145,"level":7,"price":74508,"stack":1,"description":"The strategic application of duct tape has kept these battered eyeglasses from falling into pieces. The powerful lenses are scratched but still usable.  ","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3371,"name":"Graphite","type":13,"icon":1486,"level":1,"price":158,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Crude Graphite\nA common hydrocarbon often used as a lightweight, yet sturdy, building material.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":904,"name":"Grating EMP Beam 2B","type":14,"icon":670,"level":4,"price":27242,"stack":1,"description":"The Tada-O Grating EMP Beam 2B will drain your target's energy as well as it's shields. When equipped, the Tada-O Grating EMP Beam 2B gives the Ship Reduced Warp Cost. Tada-O! Big! Strong! Wow! ","manufacturer":"Tada-O","stats":"Weapon damage: 30\nDamage type: EMP\nEnergy use: 45\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 4 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1200\nReload (sec): 5","effects":"Reduce Warp Cost (Equip)\n36% less energy used to engage warp when equipped."},{"id":3148,"name":"Grave Robber's Scythe Eight","type":16,"icon":1402,"level":8,"price":2909945,"stack":1,"description":"This archaic model is still incredibly powerful.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Ammunition: Coffin\nEnergy use: 26\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 8 Projectile Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 3500\nReload (sec): 1.8\nRounds per shot: 1","effects":"Improved Critical Targeting (Equip)\nIncreases Critical Hits Chance by 18.33% when equipped.\n\nImproved Gravity Link (Equip)\nImproves Gravity Links by 2.90 Skill Level(s) when equipped.\n\nIncrease Speed (Equip)\nIncreases ship top speed by 154 when equipped."},{"id":1766,"name":"Graviton Coil","type":11,"icon":650,"level":1,"price":2322,"stack":1,"description":"GETCo: Continuing our 500 year tradition of sustainable development.\nA Gravity Component Device that reduces the mass of surrounding objects.","manufacturer":"GETco","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 1 Device Tech","effects":"Increase Speed (Equip)\nIncreases ship top speed by 20 when equipped."},{"id":1047,"name":"Great Dane","type":14,"icon":774,"level":6,"price":151959,"stack":1,"description":"When equipped the GETCo Greate Dane gives increased Recharge Shields Skill but increases Missile Energy Cost.\nGETCo: Continuing our 500 year tradition of sustainable development.","manufacturer":"GETco","stats":"Weapon damage: 146\nDamage type: Plasma\nEnergy use: 107\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 6 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1500\nReload (sec): 9","effects":"Missle Friction (Equip)\nIncrease Missile Energy Cost by 10.00% when equipped.\n\nRecharge Shields Skill (Equip)\nIncreases Recharge Shields Effectiveness by 1.93 Skill Level(s) when equipped."},{"id":2700,"name":"Great ML Type X2","type":15,"icon":814,"level":4,"price":38306,"stack":1,"description":"Tada-O Corporation take much pride with missle launcher introduction Great ML Type X2. Great is more than Good. For most usefullness please using Rocket Type X2. Tada-O! Big! Strong! Wow!\nWhen equipped, it causes a reduction to your ship's reactor recharge rate. However, it gives an increase to your hacking skill. ","manufacturer":"Tada-O","stats":"Ammunition: Rocket Type X2\nEnergy use: 86\nSkill required: Missile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 4 Missile Weapon\nReload (sec): 12\nRounds per shot: 1","effects":"Cripple Reactor (Equip)\n-10.0% Reactor Recharge when equipped.\n\nImproved Hacking (Equip)\nImproves Hacking Success by 42% when equipped."},{"id":3833,"name":"Green Bogeril Militia Kerchief","type":13,"icon":146,"level":2,"price":1246,"stack":20,"description":"The Bogeril Militia Kerchief implies rank within the Militia.  Holders of the Green Kerchiefs are generally of officer rank.","manufacturer":"Bogeril","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":776,"name":"Green Dragon Laser M2","type":14,"icon":787,"level":2,"price":4795,"stack":1,"description":"Nishido Green Dragon Laser.\nShiranu ga hotoke.\nNishido! Designed to perfection