ht say psionic are brain powers, and you need a brain to be effected by them...","manufacturer":"Bogeril","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 3 Device Tech","effects":"Resist Psionic (Equip)\n+20.8 Psionic Resist when equipped."},{"id":3952,"name":"Imbued Synthesized Crystal","type":13,"icon":2116,"level":9,"price":799331,"stack":1,"description":"An artificial crystal, its lattice structure modified by exposure to the Voltoi Ascendant in a way that defies your analysis.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3577,"name":"Immortal Flexiglass","type":13,"icon":1481,"level":8,"price":80693,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Ambrosia Crude","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":701,"name":"Impact Coffin Nails","type":10,"icon":716,"level":8,"price":32,"stack":800,"description":"Coffin nails are ammo for the Grave Robber's Scythe","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Ammunition: Coffin\nWeapon damage: 93\nDamage type: Impact\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 8 Projectile Weapon","effects":""},{"id":3410,"name":"Impact Plastic","type":13,"icon":1481,"level":2,"price":458,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Crude Oil\nA sturdy plastic created from crude oil.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":1137,"name":"Impaling Fang","type":14,"icon":771,"level":8,"price":1190903,"stack":1,"description":"Fang-class beam weapons are extremely rare, as they are crafted only for the most powerful leaders of the Red Dragon Tongs. Employing ancient technologies only known to the innermost circles, they are highly sought after for their incredible range and accuracy.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Weapon damage: 93\nDamage type: Energy\nEnergy use: 33\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 8 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1900\nReload (sec): 2","effects":"Improved Beam Handling (Equip)\nIncreases Beam Accuracy by 2.70 Skill Level(s) when equipped."},{"id":3764,"name":"Impenetrable Bastion","type":2,"icon":915,"level":8,"price":1094681,"stack":1,"description":"This shield pulses with power.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Shield Tech\nRequirement: Level 8 Shield Tech\nShield capacity: 48064\nShield recharge / sec: 343.3","effects":"Turbo Weapons (Activated)\nReduces Weapons Delay by 5% for 2080 seconds when activated.\n\nIncrease Maneuverability (Activated)\nIncrease turn rate by 36% for 2080 seconds when activated.\n\nHull Damage Control (Equip)\nIncreases your hulls effectiveness at sustaining damage by 150% when equipped."},{"id":6088,"name":"Important Jenquai Documents","type":13,"icon":1281,"level":1,"price":0,"stack":1,"description":"A bundle of documents to be delivered to Loremaster Daiki-ya.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":2804,"name":"Incinerating Dragonfire","type":15,"icon":813,"level":8,"price":1144758,"stack":1,"description":"The BlackSun Dragonfire series of missile launchers are advanced missile launchers that can usually only be obtained by higher-ranking Red Dragon Tong members. These weapons are used to fire devastating Dragonfire & Drangonspit missiles. ","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Ammunition: Dragonfire Missile\nEnergy use: 112\nSkill required: Missile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 8 Missile Weapon\nReload (sec): 9.4\nRounds per shot: 6","effects":""},{"id":2974,"name":"Inderite","type":13,"icon":1483,"level":7,"price":588,"stack":300,"description":"Refines to: Inderium\n\nNew trade mineral!","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3551,"name":"Inderium","type":13,"icon":187,"level":7,"price":4000,"stack":60,"description":"temp data","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3441,"name":"Indium","type":13,"icon":187,"level":3,"price":908,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Indium Ore\nA silvery-white metal with a slight yellow tinge that is commonly used as an alloy.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":2897,"name":"Indium Ore","type":13,"icon":1483,"level":3,"price":23,"stack":300,"description":"Refines to: Indium","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":848,"name":"Industrial Mining Laser","type":14,"icon":767,"level":3,"price":8076,"stack":1,"description":"This beam is highly prized by miners for accuracy and greater sample purity.","manufacturer":"Tada-O","stats":"Weapon damage: 35\nDamage type: Energy\nEnergy use: 79\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 3 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1000\nReload (sec): 11","effects":""},{"id":5651,"name":"Infected Kerbtier Wing","type":13,"icon":1370,"level":2,"price":2350,"stack":1,"description":"An infected wing from a Kerbtier.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3248,"name":"Inferno","type":7,"icon":867,"level":4,"price":27323,"stack":1,"description":"A pirate-modified reactor. Banned for use in civilian ships.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Reactor Tech\nRequirement: Level 4 Reactor Tech\nReactor capacity: 762\nReactor recharge / sec: 12","effects":""},{"id":3270,"name":"Inferno V","type":7,"icon":867,"level":5,"price":67073,"stack":1,"description":"A pirate-modified reactor. Banned for use in civilian shipd.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Reactor Tech\nRequirement: Level 5 Reactor Tech\nReactor capacity: 1179\nReactor recharge / sec: 16.1","effects":""},{"id":3288,"name":"Inferno VI","type":7,"icon":867,"level":6,"price":156032,"stack":1,"description":"A pirate-modified reactor. Banned for use in civilian ships.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Reactor Tech\nRequirement: Level 6 Reactor Tech\nReactor capacity: 1683\nReactor recharge / sec: 20.6","effects":""},{"id":6053,"name":"InfinitiCorp Catalog","type":13,"icon":1381,"level":8,"price":2501,"stack":60,"description":"A datapad catalog containing all 3 million Inificorp products.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5553,"name":"InfinitiCorp ExecReport Cy864","type":13,"icon":1381,"level":4,"price":4637,"stack":60,"description":"Details the profits made by InfinitiCorp from the sale of Nommos Hunting Permits in the Aganju sector of 61 Cygni. In its first year, the experimental venture attracted numerous wealthy executives from as far away as Earth, resulting in significant corporate profit. Orkael Lazarra, who first proposed the Hunting Permit program, forsees considerable possibilities for such 'alternative eco-tourism' in Aganju sector and has recently begun selling Permits to anyone able to pay his fees.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5558,"name":"InfinitiCorp Intelligence: \"Outlings\"","type":13,"icon":1381,"level":5,"price":5837,"stack":60,"description":"An internal corporate document not meant for public scrutiny. Describes in statistical detail an increase in the frequency of attacks by unknown drone ships (\"Outlings\") on InfinitiCorp vessels in the 61 Cygni system. The author speculates upon whether recent disappearances of personel and equipment indicate that these drones are somehow acting with collective purpose and intelligence.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5867,"name":"InfinitiCorp Intelligence: \"Psi-Smuggling\"","type":13,"icon":1381,"level":6,"price":6107,"stack":60,"description":"An internal corporate document not mean for public scrunity. The author speculates informally, and in an unusually indignant tone, about the existence of an \"underground railroad\" for smuggling individuals with proven Psionic abilities out of the Cygni system, behind the backs of the corporation. The possiblity that the Red Dragon tongs are involved in this \"underground railroad\" is not ruled out.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":6102,"name":"InfinitiCorp Medal of Valor","type":13,"icon":1942,"level":1,"price":0,"stack":1,"description":"Awarded by InfinitiCorp to select Terrans who show they'll let nothing stand in the way when profit is on the line! Presented by Callieach MacKellan on Earth Station. You should take it to Captain Braun aboard EarthCorps High Command.","manufacturer":"InfinitiCorp","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":2132,"name":"Insatiable Blood","type":11,"icon":1014,"level":6,"price":197208,"stack":1,"description":"Blacksun blood-class energy replenishment systems enhance the energy regeneration rate of a ship's reactor. These systems are commonly used by the Red Dragon pirate tongs.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 6 Device Tech","effects":"Recharge Reactor (Equip)\n+3.0 Reactor Recharge when equipped."},{"id":5128,"name":"Insects & Arthropods","type":13,"icon":148,"level":2,"price":141,"stack":1,"description":"Turns out the lifeforms humans generally hate most are essential for planet seeding and terraforming.\n\nInsects are needed on Kinshasa-Mbali (Aganju, 61 Cygni A System).","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":6105,"name":"Inspiration Translation","type":13,"icon":1381,"level":1,"price":0,"stack":1,"description":"A translation of the First Inspiration by Loremaster Daiki-ya.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5899,"name":"Insubstantial Vapor","type":13,"icon":189,"level":1,"price":359,"stack":60,"description":"This mist is difficult to distinguish from oxygen.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":6030,"name":"Insulated Casing","type":13,"icon":1472,"level":5,"price":1544,"stack":60,"description":"A thick insulating casing used to protect ship systems from electrical discharge.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5167,"name":"Integral Xerion Device","type":11,"icon":2243,"level":7,"price":345215,"stack":1,"description":"This Xerion device has been subtly modified by Meredith Lot. It should no longer harm the leaders of the Alliance when used on them. 1Z1Z2L may not be pleased by the results, however.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 7 Device Tech","effects":""},{"id":5876,"name":"Integrated Xerion Device","type":11,"icon":2244,"level":7,"price":345215,"stack":1,"description":"This engimatic device was given to you by 1Z1Z2L and modified by Meredith Lot. It has been charged with the essence of the three Alliance leaders.\n\nRace Restricted\nProfession Restricted","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 7 Device Tech","effects":""},{"id":5377,"name":"Integrity Abatement 3","type":11,"icon":989,"level":3,"price":9396,"stack":1,"description":"Created by the Jenquarum to serve as a reward for those valiant souls who aided in the healing of the shear.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 3 Device Tech","effects":"Equipment Damage Magnification - Hull (Activated)\nDecreases a hulls effectiveness at sustaining damage by 66% for 252 seconds to enemy when activated."},{"id":5378,"name":"Integrity Abatement 4","type":11,"icon":989,"level":4,"price":23571,"stack":1,"description":"Created by the Jenquarum to serve as a reward for those valiant souls who aided in the healing of the shear.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 4 Device Tech","effects":"Equipment Damage Magnification - Hull (Activated)\nDecreases a hulls effectiveness at sustaining damage by 88% for 252 seconds to enemy when activated."},{"id":5379,"name":"Integrity Abatement 5","type":11,"icon":989,"level":5,"price":58968,"stack":1,"description":"Created by the Jenquarum to serve as a reward for those valiant souls who aided in the healing of the shear.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 5 Device Tech","effects":"Equipment Damage Magnification - Hull (Activated)\nDecreases a hulls effectiveness at sustaining damage by 110% for 252 seconds to enemy when activated."},{"id":5380,"name":"Integrity Abatement 6","type":11,"icon":989,"level":6,"price":129866,"stack":1,"description":"Created by the Jenquarum to serve as a reward for those valiant souls who aided in the healing of the shear.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 6 Device Tech","effects":"Equipment Damage Magnification - Hull (Activated)\nDecreases a hulls effectiveness at sustaining damage by 132% for 252 seconds to enemy when activated."},{"id":5370,"name":"Integrity Dissolution 7","type":11,"icon":989,"level":7,"price":368550,"stack":1,"description":"Created by the Jenquarum to serve as a reward for those valiant souls who aided in the healing of the shear.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 7 Device Tech","effects":"Equipment Damage Magnification - Hull (Activated)\nDecreases a hulls effectiveness at sustaining damage by 40% for 154 seconds to enemy when activated."},{"id":5369,"name":"Integrity Dissolution 8","type":11,"icon":989,"level":8,"price":921375,"stack":1,"description":"Created by the Jenquarum to serve as a reward for those valiant souls who aided in the healing of the shear.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 8 Device Tech","effects":"Equipment Damage Magnification - Hull (Activated)\nDecreases a hulls effectiveness at sustaining damage by 40% for 176 seconds to enemy when activated."},{"id":5160,"name":"Integrity Dissolution 9","type":11,"icon":989,"level":9,"price":2303460,"stack":1,"description":"Created by the Jenquarum to serve as a reward fir those valiant souls who aided in the healing of the shear.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 9 Device Tech","effects":"Equipment Damage Magnification - Hull (Activated)\nDecreases a hulls effectiveness at sustaining damage by 40% for 198 seconds to enemy when activated."},{"id":2643,"name":"Intent for the Resolute","type":6,"icon":957,"level":9,"price":3374912,"stack":1,"description":"A radical Mordana engine design powered by a unique crystal. You do not fully understand how it works.\n","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Engine Tech\nRequirement: Level 9 Engine Tech\nImpulse speed: 187\nWarp speed: 4250\nFree-warp energy / sec: 24.4","effects":"Shunt to Reactor (Equip)\n+20.30 Reactor Recharge and -26.00 Shield Recharge when equipped.\n\nIncrease Maneuverability (Equip)\nIncreases turn rate by 56% when equipped.\n\nRecharge Shields (Equip)\n+49.6% Shield Recharge when equipped."},{"id":5906,"name":"Interpolative Gene Remapping Apparatus","type":11,"icon":2114,"level":4,"price":369156,"stack":1,"description":"Early reiteration attempts required an apparatus of this sort to prepare the biostruct for the process of interpolation.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 4 Device Tech","effects":""},{"id":2371,"name":"Intolerance Mk. VIII","type":11,"icon":728,"level":8,"price":1564863,"stack":1,"description":"Strike back with power using the new Intolerance Mk. VIII.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 8 Device Tech","effects":"Enhance Beam (Equip)\nIncreases Beam Damage by 30.0% when equipped.\n\nEnhance Projectiles (Equip)\nIncreases Projectile Damage by 30.0% when equipped.\n\nEnhance Missiles (Equip)\nIncreases Missile Damage by 30.0% when equipped."},{"id":3793,"name":"Invincible Bastion","type":2,"icon":915,"level":9,"price":2995731,"stack":1,"description":"This shield pulses with power.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Shield Tech\nRequirement: Level 9 Shield Tech\nShield capacity: 120131\nShield recharge / sec: 775.2","effects":"Turbo Weapons (Activated)\nReduces Weapons Delay by 5% for 2290 seconds when activated.\n\nIncrease Maneuverability (Activated)\nIncrease turn rate by 39% for 2290 seconds when activated.\n\nHull Damage Control (Equip)\nIncreases your hulls effectiveness at sustaining damage by 150% when equipped."},{"id":2272,"name":"Invisible Eye","type":11,"icon":676,"level":7,"price":341552,"stack":1,"description":"This device will effectively extend scanning ranges while simultaneously reducing hull signature.","manufacturer":"Sharushar","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 7 Device Tech","effects":"Scan Boost (Equip)\nAllows ship scanners to see 2340 units farther when equipped.\n\nReduce Ship Signature (Equip)\nGives a ship 42% less radar footprint when equipped."},{"id":2618,"name":"Io C/7000","type":6,"icon":965,"level":7,"price":588067,"stack":1,"description":"Discover the future!  Sundari.\nwhen equipped this item gives a reduction to your hull damage.","manufacturer":"Sundari","stats":"Skill required: Engine Tech\nRequirement: Level 7 Engine Tech\nEngine signature: 800\nImpulse speed: 151\nWarp speed: 3500\nFree-warp energy / sec: 27","effects":"Hull Damage Control (Equip)\nIncreases your hulls effectiveness at sustaining damage by 29% when equipped."},{"id":2635,"name":"Io C/8000","type":6,"icon":965,"level":8,"price":1233563,"stack":1,"description":"Discover the future!  Sundari.\nwhen equipped this item gives a reduction to your hull damage.","manufacturer":"Sundari","stats":"Skill required: Engine Tech\nRequirement: Level 8 Engine Tech\nEngine signature: 800\nImpulse speed: 166\nWarp speed: 3750\nFree-warp energy / sec: 31.9","effects":"Hull Damage Control (Equip)\nIncreases your hulls effectiveness at sustaining damage by 31% when equipped."},{"id":2648,"name":"Io C/9000","type":6,"icon":965,"level":9,"price":2918765,"stack":1,"description":"Discover the future!  Sundari.\nWhen equipped this item gives a reduction to your hull damage.","manufacturer":"Sundari","stats":"Skill required: Engine Tech\nRequirement: Level 9 Engine Tech\nEngine signature: 900\nImpulse speed: 181\nWarp speed: 4000\nFree-warp energy / sec: 38.3","effects":"Hull Damage Control (Equip)\nIncreases your hulls effectiveness at sustaining damage by 33% when equipped."},{"id":6080,"name":"Ionic Shard","type":13,"icon":2356,"level":8,"price":2542,"stack":60,"description":"This shard of glass-like material carries a powerful electric charge.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3552,"name":"Iridium","type":13,"icon":187,"level":7,"price":33622,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Iridium Ore","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":2975,"name":"Iridium Ore","type":13,"icon":1483,"level":7,"price":841,"stack":300,"description":"Refines to: Iridium","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":1055,"name":"Irking EMP Beam 3C","type":14,"icon":698,"level":6,"price":148034,"stack":1,"description":"The Tada-O Irking EMP Beam 3C will drain your target's energy as well as its shields. When equipped, the Tada-O Irking EMP Beam 3C gives the Ship Reduced Warp Cost.\nTada-O! Big! Strong! Wow!","manufacturer":"Tada-O","stats":"Weapon damage: 77\nDamage type: EMP\nEnergy use: 60\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 6 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1500\nReload (sec): 5","effects":"Reduce Warp Cost (Equip)\n47% less energy used to engage warp when equipped."},{"id":3375,"name":"Iron","type":13,"icon":1486,"level":1,"price":170,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Iron Ore\nRefines into: Steel\nA dull, gray metal used in a wide variety of metallurgical applications.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":2709,"name":"Iron DragonBreath","type":15,"icon":1394,"level":4,"price":36788,"stack":1,"description":"BlackSun Dragonbreath Launcher","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Ammunition: DragonBreath Missile\nEnergy use: 75\nSkill required: Missile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 4 Missile Weapon\nReload (sec): 13.5\nRounds per shot: 1","effects":""},{"id":2656,"name":"Iron Dragonclaw","type":15,"icon":806,"level":1,"price":2434,"stack":1,"description":"The Blacksun Dragonclaw series of missile launchers are standard ordinance for Red Dragon Tong members. These weapons fire long range, low yield Dragonclaw missiles. ","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Ammunition: Dragonclaw Missile\nEnergy use: 52\nSkill required: Missile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 1 Missile Weapon\nReload (sec): 10.9\nRounds per shot: 1","effects":""},{"id":5761,"name":"Iron Eater Appendage","type":13,"icon":1368,"level":4,"price":4224,"stack":100,"description":"The appendage of an Iron Eater.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5785,"name":"Iron Eater Cytoplasm","type":13,"icon":1372,"level":5,"price":5297,"stack":100,"description":"The cytoplasm of an Iron Eater.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5711,"name":"Iron Eater Tooth","type":13,"icon":1369,"level":3,"price":3817,"stack":100,"description":"The tooth from an Iron Eater.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5652,"name":"Iron Eye","type":13,"icon":1371,"level":2,"price":2383,"stack":100,"description":"An eye from a Iron Vulture.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5762,"name":"Iron Heart","type":13,"icon":1375,"level":4,"price":1255,"stack":60,"description":"The heart of an Iron Vulture.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":2842,"name":"Iron Ore","type":13,"icon":1483,"level":1,"price":1,"stack":300,"description":"Refines to: Iron\nRe-refines to: Steel","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3639,"name":"Iron Scale","type":2,"icon":900,"level":2,"price":6147,"stack":1,"description":"The BlackSun scale series of shield generators are crafted specifically for member of Red Dragon Tongs.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Shield Tech\nRequirement: Level 2 Shield Tech\nShield capacity: 142\nShield recharge / sec: 3","effects":""},{"id":5487,"name":"Ironwood Mah-jongg Kit","type":13,"icon":158,"level":1,"price":352,"stack":60,"description":"A game to keep the boredom down while waiting for the battle to begin.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3966,"name":"Ironwood Reliquary","type":13,"icon":744,"level":1,"price":419,"stack":60,"description":"Container used to store Red Dragon tong relics.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5984,"name":"Ishuan Manufactured Goods","type":13,"icon":744,"level":3,"price":259,"stack":1,"description":"Manufactured goods from the Ishuan Sector. \n\nThey are in demand on Jove's Fury in the Jupiter Sector, Sol System; Paren Station in Kailaasa, Capella System; Tokai Saikutsu in Dahin Mining Interest, Capella System; and Yasuragi in Yasuragi Area, Sirius System.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5987,"name":"Ishuan Order Slips","type":13,"icon":1281,"level":1,"price":42,"stack":1,"description":"Ishuan Order Slips that are in need to be transported to Ishuan Station in Ishuan Sector, Castor System. These Slips contain the manufacturing orders.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":4020,"name":"Ivory Carved Liu Leung Signet Ring","type":13,"icon":738,"level":9,"price":2755,"stack":60,"description":"Ivory ring signifying a the leader of the Liu Leung tong of the Red Dragon. Belongs to Anatoly Mahuzkin.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3745,"name":"Ivory Scale","type":2,"icon":914,"level":7,"price":557387,"stack":1,"description":"The BlackSun Sale series of shield generators are crafted specifically for members of the Red Dragon Tongs.  This elite shield system uses lensing technologies to focus any beam weapon emissions, effectively extending their range.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Shield Tech\nRequirement: Level 7 Shield Tech\nShield capacity: 16113\nShield recharge / sec: 110.5","effects":"Deflect Impact (Equip)\n+28 Impact Deflect when equipped.\n\nDeflect Energy (Equip)\n+28 Energy Deflect when equipped.\n\nBoost Beam Range (Equip)\nIncreases Beam Range by 50% when equipped."},{"id":2226,"name":"Ivory Ward","type":11,"icon":1001,"level":7,"price":747823,"stack":1,"description":"BlackSun Device\nExperimental Device.  Use at own risk.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 7 Device Tech","effects":"Deflect Chemical (Equip)\n+30 Chemical Deflect when equipped.\n\nDeflect EMP (Equip)\n+30 EMP Deflect when equipped.\n\nDeflect Energy (Equip)\n+30 Energy D