ammer hits real good when you need it to and even sometimes when you don't.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3921,"name":"Line Eye","type":13,"icon":1498,"level":2,"price":3877,"stack":20,"description":"These twisted circular eyelets are traditionally used to string line along a fishing pole.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":1007,"name":"Lion","type":14,"icon":774,"level":6,"price":157019,"stack":1,"description":"When equipped, the GETCo Lion gives increased Repair Equipment Skill and to the Ship's Maneuverability.\nGETCo: Continuing our 500 year tradition of sustainable development.","manufacturer":"GETco","stats":"Weapon damage: 81\nDamage type: Plasma\nEnergy use: 57\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 6 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1600\nReload (sec): 4","effects":"Improved Repair Equipment (Equip)\nDecrease repair time by 12.00% when equipped.\n\nIncrease Maneuverability (Equip)\nIncreases turn rate by 39% when equipped."},{"id":3443,"name":"Liquid Alanium","type":13,"icon":189,"level":3,"price":432,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Alanite\nA foul-smelling, bright orange liquid used for a variety of applications.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3466,"name":"Liquid Argon","type":13,"icon":189,"level":4,"price":1233,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Argon\nA colorless liquid used in power cores.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3579,"name":"Liquid Boragon","type":13,"icon":189,"level":8,"price":10374,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Boragon.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3411,"name":"Liquid Crystal","type":13,"icon":189,"level":2,"price":258,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Quartz Crystals\nPurified crystalline quartz, commonly used in electronic applications. ","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3580,"name":"Liquid Emperion","type":13,"icon":189,"level":8,"price":34399,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Emperion","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3610,"name":"Liquid Etherion","type":13,"icon":189,"level":9,"price":100100,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Etherion.\n\n","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3444,"name":"Liquid Fluorine","type":13,"icon":189,"level":3,"price":572,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Fluorine Gas\nA liquefied gas used in various applications including as a missile propellant.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3492,"name":"Liquid Halon","type":13,"icon":189,"level":5,"price":1037,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Halon","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":1340,"name":"Liquid Heat","type":13,"icon":1473,"level":3,"price":1452,"stack":240,"description":"Liquid Heat is a powerful compound.\nCan be used to warm engines, remove bunions, and as a salve for aching muscles.","manufacturer":"Bogeril","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3412,"name":"Liquid Helium","type":13,"icon":189,"level":2,"price":238,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Helium Gas\nA common gas in liquid form. ","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3377,"name":"Liquid Hydrogen","type":13,"icon":189,"level":1,"price":89,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Hydrogen\nLiquid hydrogen is frequently used in superconductor applications because of its extremely low melting point, just about absolute zero.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3521,"name":"Liquid Krypton","type":13,"icon":189,"level":6,"price":11760,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Krypton","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3413,"name":"Liquid Methane","type":13,"icon":189,"level":2,"price":180,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Methane Gas\nA common gas in liquid form used in various manufactured components.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3467,"name":"Liquid Neon","type":13,"icon":189,"level":4,"price":169,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Neon\nA substance used as a coolant in sensitive equipment","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3378,"name":"Liquid Nitrogen","type":13,"icon":189,"level":1,"price":72,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Nitrogen\nCommonly used as a refrigerant and as fuel.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3611,"name":"Liquid Noxion","type":13,"icon":743,"level":9,"price":123491,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Noxion.\nA noxious liquid, first isolated on Nox.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3379,"name":"Liquid Oxygen","type":13,"icon":189,"level":1,"price":95,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Oxygen Gas\nA pale blue liquid used in creating metallic alloys and as an oxidizing agent in rocket fuels.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3612,"name":"Liquid Pagion","type":13,"icon":189,"level":9,"price":135186,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Pagion","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3493,"name":"Liquid Radon","type":13,"icon":189,"level":5,"price":3076,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Radon","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3554,"name":"Liquid Stojsavline","type":13,"icon":189,"level":7,"price":4794,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Stojsavline","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":6015,"name":"Liquid Storage Container","type":13,"icon":189,"level":3,"price":961,"stack":60,"description":"This appears to be a now-empty liquid storage container.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3555,"name":"Liquid Vaneon","type":13,"icon":189,"level":7,"price":4797,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Vaneon Gas","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3556,"name":"Liquid Wexeon","type":13,"icon":189,"level":7,"price":17378,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Wexion","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3522,"name":"Liquid Xenon","type":13,"icon":189,"level":6,"price":13986,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Xenon","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3581,"name":"Liquid Yunieon","type":13,"icon":189,"level":8,"price":49018,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Yunieon Gas.\nA terribly foul-smelling yellow liquid. Surely, it is good for nothing or maybe something.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3380,"name":"Lithium","type":13,"icon":1487,"level":1,"price":135,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Lithium Ore\nA silver metal used as a building block for many manufactured components.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":2844,"name":"Lithium Ore","type":13,"icon":1484,"level":1,"price":3,"stack":300,"description":"Refines to: Lithium","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5129,"name":"Live Animals","type":13,"icon":1287,"level":3,"price":120,"stack":1,"description":"Cows, pigs, platypuses, you name it - animals are given some padding, some oxygen, and boxed up for shipping.\n\nLive Animals are needed in Kinshasa-Mbali (Aganju, 61 Cygni A System).","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5252,"name":"Live Animals- Chickens","type":13,"icon":1287,"level":2,"price":110,"stack":1,"description":"Mostly natural live chickens. These chickens were raised on the plains of Earth Planet. Useful as a food source: They lay eggs for most of their lives and when they stop you can eat them.\n\nLive chickens are in demand at Kinshasa Mbali (Aganju, 61 Cygni System). ","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5253,"name":"Live Animals- Cows","type":13,"icon":1287,"level":2,"price":131,"stack":1,"description":"Bovine beef. Beloved animals on farms. They are loved mostly for their wholesome milk they produce.\n\nCows are in demand at Kinshasa Mbali (Aganju, 61 Cygni System).","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5254,"name":"Live Animals- Goats","type":13,"icon":1287,"level":2,"price":89,"stack":1,"description":"A species of animal from Earth. Its milk is used for food and its hair is used to make clothes.\n\nGoats are in demand at Kinshasa Mbali (Aganju, 61 Cygni System).","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5255,"name":"Live Animals- Llamas","type":13,"icon":1287,"level":2,"price":141,"stack":1,"description":"A lovable species from Earth. It is desired for its fur and can also used as a way of transporting people and goods. With the introduction of better transporation to Earth, llamas became less of a necessity and pet llamas became more popular.\n\nLlamas are in demand at Kinshasa Mbali (Aganju, 61 Cygni System).","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":6073,"name":"Living Crystal","type":13,"icon":2369,"level":5,"price":1627,"stack":60,"description":"This small hand-sized crystal formation seems to be alive!","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":6019,"name":"Long Range Sensor Array","type":13,"icon":927,"level":4,"price":1285,"stack":60,"description":"Type-7 long range sensor array in mostly working order.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":655,"name":"Longbow Chemical Round","type":10,"icon":688,"level":6,"price":17,"stack":700,"description":"For use with the Sparta Longbow projectile launcher.  Sparta!  When the Call comes, be ready.\nThe Longbow chemical projectile will corrode your target's hull over a period of time.","manufacturer":"Sparta","stats":"Ammunition: Longbow\nWeapon damage: 42\nDamage type: Chemical\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 6 Projectile Weapon","effects":""},{"id":3131,"name":"Longbow Duo","type":16,"icon":846,"level":7,"price":511172,"stack":1,"description":"The Sparta Longbow projectile launcher requires the use of the Sparta longbow rounds. Sparta! When the Call comes, be ready.\nWhen equipped, the Longbow gives a reduction to the amount of damage your weapons might take. It also gives an increase to your projectile skill.","manufacturer":"Sparta","stats":"Ammunition: Longbow\nEnergy use: 16\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 7 Projectile Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 3700\nReload (sec): 1.4\nRounds per shot: 1","effects":"Equipment Damage Control - Weapons (Equip)\nIncreases your weapons' effectiveness at sustaining damage by 62% when equipped.\n\nProjectile Weapon Skill (Equip)\nIncreases Projectile Accuracy by 2.20 Skill Level(s) when equipped."},{"id":3170,"name":"Longbow Max","type":16,"icon":846,"level":9,"price":3041027,"stack":1,"description":"The Sparta Longbow projectile launcher requires the use of the Sparta Longbow rounds. Sparta! When the Call comes, be ready.\nWhen equipped, the Longbow gives a reduction to the amount of damage your weapons might take. It also gives an increase to your projectile weapon skill.","manufacturer":"Sparta","stats":"Ammunition: Longbow\nEnergy use: 43\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 9 Projectile Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 3900\nReload (sec): 2.7\nRounds per shot: 5","effects":"Equipment Damage Control - Weapons (Equip)\nIncreases your weapons' effectiveness at sustaining damage by 75% when equipped.\n\nProjectile Weapon Skill (Equip)\nIncreases Projectile Accuracy by 2.79 Skill Level(s) when equipped."},{"id":656,"name":"Longbow Plasma Round","type":10,"icon":688,"level":6,"price":17,"stack":700,"description":"For use with the Sparta Longbow projectile launcher.  Sparta!  When the Call comes, be ready.\nThe Longbow plasma projectile will drain your target's shields over a period of time.","manufacturer":"Sparta","stats":"Ammunition: Longbow\nWeapon damage: 42\nDamage type: Plasma\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 6 Projectile Weapon","effects":""},{"id":3115,"name":"Longbow Prime","type":16,"icon":846,"level":6,"price":156526,"stack":1,"description":"The Sparta Longbow projectile launcher requires the use of the Sparta longbow rounds. Sparta! When the Call comes, be ready. \nWhen equipped, the Longbow gives a reduction to the amount of damage yoru weapons might take. It also gives an increase to your projectile skill.","manufacturer":"Sparta","stats":"Ammunition: Longbow\nEnergy use: 22\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 6 Projectile Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 3600\nReload (sec): 2.2\nRounds per shot: 1","effects":"Equipment Damage Control - Weapons (Equip)\nIncreases your weapons' effectiveness at sustaining damage by 57% when equipped.\n\nProjectile Weapon Skill (Equip)\nIncreases Projectile Accuracy by 1.93 Skill Level(s) when equipped."},{"id":3161,"name":"Longbow Tria","type":16,"icon":846,"level":8,"price":1361853,"stack":1,"description":"The Sparta Longbow projectile launcher requires the use of the Sparta Longbow rounds. Sparta! When the Call comes, be ready.\nWhen equipped, the Longbow gives a reduction to the amount of damage your weapons might take.\nIt also gives an increase to your projectile weapon skill.","manufacturer":"Sparta","stats":"Ammunition: Longbow\nEnergy use: 36\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 8 Projectile Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 3800\nReload (sec): 2.7\nRounds per shot: 3","effects":"Equipment Damage Control - Weapons (Equip)\nIncreases your weapons' effectiveness at sustaining damage by 68% when equipped.\n\nProjectile Weapon Skill (Equip)\nIncreases Projectile Accuracy by 2.49 Skill Level(s) when equipped."},{"id":2142,"name":"Loony's Hunk O'Metal","type":11,"icon":729,"level":6,"price":54287,"stack":1,"description":"Ain't nothin but a help to have this here device equipped on your ship. Won't hurt none.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 6 Device Tech","effects":"Additive Turbo Warp (Activated)\nIncrease Warp Speed by 180 for 2160 seconds when activated.\n\nAdditive Turbo Warp (Equip)\nIncreases warp speed by 180.0 when equipped."},{"id":2332,"name":"Loony's Special Gizmoblastit","type":11,"icon":742,"level":8,"price":18571,"stack":1,"description":"When your out'n space a bunch, this will boost you somethin' fierce. Lyle \"Loony\" MacDonald says so.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 8 Device Tech","effects":"Long Tractor Beam (Equip)\nExtends tractor beam range by 84%\n\nFast Tractor Beam (Equip)\nIncreases tractor beam speed by 178% when equipped.\n\nScan Boost (Equip)\nAllows ship scanners to see 3969 units farther when equipped.\n\nReduce Ship Signature (Equip)\nGives a ship 76% less radar footprint when equipped."},{"id":5948,"name":"Loose Tendon","type":13,"icon":1373,"level":5,"price":1529,"stack":60,"description":"A strong, fibrous tendon collected from space.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":1223,"name":"Low Grade Contact Grid","type":13,"icon":728,"level":1,"price":413,"stack":60,"description":"An inexpensive sheet of copper contacts aligned in a grid pattern. ","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5170,"name":"Lucky","type":13,"icon":737,"level":1,"price":350,"stack":1,"description":"An enigmatic object you apparently got while traveling through an Ancient Gate. It defies conventional anaylsis. Aren't you lucky!","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5803,"name":"Lunar Eye","type":13,"icon":1371,"level":5,"price":1611,"stack":60,"description":"The eye from a Moon Dweller.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5763,"name":"Lunar Fang","type":13,"icon":1369,"level":4,"price":1312,"stack":60,"description":"The fang of a Moon Dweller.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5717,"name":"Lunar Tail","type":13,"icon":1368,"level":3,"price":1029,"stack":60,"description":"A piece of tail from a Moon Dweller.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3895,"name":"Lure","type":11,"icon":2402,"level":7,"price":392050,"stack":1,"description":"This flashing, blinking, and glittering spectacle is downright distracting. It's almost like you have a giant target painted on your ship. Almost.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 7 Device Tech","effects":"Increase Ship Signature (Activated)\nGives a ship 3100.00 more radar footprint for 210.00 seconds to enemy when activated."},{"id":1031,"name":"Luscious Laser Line C1","type":14,"icon":766,"level":6,"price":160452,"stack":1,"description":"When equipped, the Tada-O Luscious Laser Line C1 gives Increased Rally Skill.\nTada-O Cororation Tada-O! Big! Strong! Wow!","manufacturer":"Tada-O","stats":"Weapon damage: 85\nDamage type: Energy\nEnergy use: 67\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 6 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1400\nReload (sec): 5","effects":"Improved Rally (Equip)\nImproves Rally effectiveness by 1.93 Skill Level(s) when equipped."},{"id":3179,"name":"M1RD5KS1RR4W","type":16,"icon":2232,"level":9,"price":3394200,"stack":1,"description":"1RR4WSF4RJ5DG2M2NT","manufacturer":"Vrix","stats":"Ammunition: B1RBS\nEnergy use: 38\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 9 Projectile Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 3600\nReload (sec): 2.4\nRounds per shot: 1","effects":"Deflect Explosive (Equip)\n+30 Explosive Deflect when equipped.\n\nEquipment Damage Control - Reactor (Equip)\nIncreases your reactor's effectiveness at sustaining damage by 75% when equipped.\n\nProjectile Force (Equip)\nIncreases Projectile Damage by 3.0% when equipped."},{"id":5484,"name":"M1RG3N1L15GM2NTF32LD","type":11,"icon":994,"level":5,"price":57329,"stack":1,"description":"1TR3SKF4RR2S3D51L3M1G2R6M6TH4L4G3C1LL6S3GN3F3C1NT3F4V2R-S1T5R1T2D,5S2C15T34NS2L2CT3NGS45RC2F32LDS","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 5 Device Tech","effects":"Maximize Shields (Activated)\nIncreases shield capacity by 4% for 800.0 seconds when activated."},{"id":5890,"name":"M3NDSH32LD3NGB21MF4C5S","type":11,"icon":998,"level":9,"price":2957982,"stack":1,"description":"1TR3SKF4RR2S3D51L3M1G2R6M6TH4L4G3C1LL6S3GN3F3C1NT3F4V2R-S1T5R1T2D,5S2C15T34NS2L2CT3NGS45RC2F32LDS","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 9 Device Tech","effects":"Improved Beam Handling (Equip)\nIncreases Beam Accuracy by 3.93 Skill Level(s) when equipped.\n\nBoost Beam Range (Equip)\nIncreases Beam Range by 66% when equipped.\n\nResist Psionic (Equip)\n+30.0 Psionic Resist when equipped."},{"id":5810,"name":"Mabonae Cytoplasm","type":13,"icon":1372,"level":6,"price":1881,"stack":60,"description":"The cytoplasm of a Mabonae.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5764,"name":"Mabonae Gas Sac","type":13,"icon":1375,"level":4,"price":1325,"stack":60,"description":"A gas sac from a Mabonae.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5718,"name":"Mabonae Hide","type":13,"icon":1372,"level":3,"price":3656,"stack":60,"description":"The hide of a Mabonae.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5804,"name":"Mabonae Neuron","type":13,"icon":1367,"level":5,"price":1626,"stack":60,"description":"The brain neurons of a Mabonae.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3078,"name":"Macabre Breed PL B2","type":16,"icon":671,"level":4,"price":34114,"stack":1,"description":"The Tada-O Macare Breed PL B2 projectile launcher requires the use of the Tadao Macabre Bullets.\nTada-O! Big! Strong! Wow!\nWhen equipped, the Macabre Breed PL B2 gives and increase to the range of your missile launchers. It also gives an increase to your combat speed and your ship's manuverability.","manufacturer":"Tada-O","stats":"Ammunition: Macabre Bullet\nEnergy use: 14\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 4 Projectile Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 3000\nReload (sec): 1.8\nRounds per shot: 1","effects":"Boost Missile Range (Equip)\nIncreases Missile Range by 19% when equipped.\n\nIncrease Speed (Equip)\nIncreases ship top speed by 64 when equipped.\n\nIncrease Maneuverability (Equip)\nIncreases turn rate by 31% when equipped."},{"id":601,"name":"Macabre Chemical Bullet","type":10,"icon":689,"level":4,"price":10,"stack":700,"description":"For use with the Tada-O Macabre Breed PL B2 projectile launcher.  Tada-O Corporation Tada-O! Big! Strong! Wow!\nThe Macabre chemical projectile will corrode your target's hull over a period of time.","manufacturer":"Tada-O","stats":"Ammunition: Macabre Bullet\nWeapon damage: 12\nDamage type: Chemical\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 4 Projectile Weapon","effects":""},{"id":602,"name":"Macabre Impact Bullet","type":10,"icon":689,"level":4,"price":10,"stack":700,"description":"For use with the Tada-O Macabre Breed PL B2 projectile launcher.  Tada-O Corporation Tada-O! Big! Strong! Wow!","manufacturer":"Tada-O","stats":"Ammunition: Macabre Bullet\nWeapon damage: 12\nDamage type: Impact\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 4 Projectile Weapon","effects":""},{"id":844,"name":"Mace III","type":14,"icon":779,"level":3,"price":14614,"stack":1,"description":"The Sparta Mace will drain your target's energy as well as its shields.\nWhen equipped, the Sparta Mace gives increased Prospect Skill and increased Shield Regeneration.\nSparta. When the Call comes, be ready.","manufacturer":"Sparta","stats":"Weapon damage: 27\nDamage type: EMP\nEnergy use: 58\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 3 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1000\nReload (sec): 8","effects":"Prospect Skill (Equip)\nIncreases Prospecting Effectiveness by 1.33 Skill Level(s) when equipped.\n\nRecharge Shields (Equip)\n+22.0% Shield Recharge when equipped."},{"id":918,"name":"Mace IV","type":14,"icon":779,"level":4,"price":34605,"stack":1,"description":"The Sparta Mace IV will drain your target's energy as well as its shields. When equipped, the Sparta Mace gives increased Prospect Skill and increased Shield Regeneration. Sparta. When the Call comes, be ready. ","manufacturer":"","stats":"Weapon damage: 43\nDamage type: EMP\nEnergy use: 70\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 4 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1100\nReload (sec): 8","effects":"Prospect Skill (Equip)\nIncreases Prospecting Effectiveness by 1.67 Skill Level(s) when equipped.\n\nRecharge Shields (Equip)\n+26.0% Shield Recharge when equipped."},{"id":988,"name":"Mace V","type":14,"icon":779,"level":5,"price":95915,"stack":1,"description":"The Sparta Mace V will drain your target's energy as well as its shields. When equipped, the Sparta Mace gives increased Prospect Skill and increased Shield Regeneration. Sparta. When the Call comes, be ready. ","manufacturer":"Sparta","stats":"Weapon damage: 72\nDamage type: EMP\nEnergy use: 79\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 5 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1200\nReload (sec): 8","effects":"Prospect Skill (Equip)\nIncreases Prospecting Effectiveness by 2.00 Skill Level(s) when equipped.\n\nRecharge Shields (Equip)\n+30.0% Shield Recharge when equipped."},{"id":5293,"name":"MacGregor's Lager","type":13,"icon":2386,"level":2,"price":162,"stack":1,"description":"A crate of old MacGregor's engine brewed Lager. An aquired taste for the deep spacer.\n\nThis unique light brew is eagerly consumed on Earthcorp High Command (Zweihander, Alpha Centauri) and Jagerstadt (Planet Zweihander, Alpha Centauri).","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3414,"name":"Magnesium","type":13,"icon":1486,"level":2,"price":198,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Magnesium Ore\nA bright, silvery-white metal used as a lightweight alloy and in incendiary applications.  ","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":2875,"name":"Magnesium Ore","type":13,"icon":1483,"level":2,"price":5,"stack":300,"description":"Refines to: Magnesium","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":6006,"name":"Magnetic Monopole","type":13,"icon":736,"level":2,"price":682,"stack":60,"description":"Rare magnetic monopoles (both negative and positive) are used in various ship systems.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":6027,"name":"Magnetic Stabilizer Ring","type":13,"icon":2287,"level":5,"price":1525,"stack":60,"description":"Magnetic stabilizer rings are often use to control the flow of reactor plasma.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3381,"name":"Magnetite","type":13,"icon":1486,"level":1,"price":147,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Magnetite Ore\nA highly magnetized resource used in a variety of magnetic applications.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":2845,"name":"Magnetite Ore","type":13,"icon":1483,"level":1,"price":3,"stack":300,"description":"Refines to: Magnetite","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":1178,"name":"Magnified Solar Energy Channeler","type":14,"icon":1386,"level":9,"price":2589632,"stack":1,"description":"This weaon channels solar energy into a deadly beam. Because of its unique build it requires very little reactor power to activate.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Weapon damage: 644\nDamage type: Energy\nEnergy use: 15\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 9 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 2000\nReload (sec): 7.5","effects":"Weaken Energy (Activated)\n-49.0 Energy Deflect for 192 seconds to enemy when activated.\n\nShield Renewal (Equip)\n+23.1% Shield Recharge when equipped.\n\nIncrease Maneuverability (Equip)\nIncreases turn rate by 67% when equipped."},{"id":2373,"name":"Magnus' Enhanced Jenquai Reinforcer","type":11,"icon":704,"level":8,"price":956656,"stack":1,"description":"Created by Magnus Plenicus at the Mars Construction Site, this capital-quality device intensifies beam weapons and reduces hull damage.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 8 Device Tech","effects":"Beam Focus (Equip)\nIncreases Beam Damage by 3.0% when equipped.\n\nHull Damage Control (Equip)\nIncreases your hulls effectiveness at sustaining damage by 30% when equipped."},{"id":2374,"name":"Magnus' Enhanced Progen Reinforcer","type":11,"icon":1016,"level":8,"price":956656,"stack":1,"description":"Created by Magnus Plenicus at the Mars Construction Site, this capital-quality device intensifies projectile weapons and reduces hull damage.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 8 Device Tech","effects":"Projectile Force (Equip)\nIncreases Projectile Damage by 3.0% when equipped.\n\nHull Damage Control (Equip)\nIncreases your hulls effectiveness at sustaining damage by 30% when equipped."},{"id":2465,"name":"Magnus' Optimal Jenquai Reinforcer","type":11,"icon":1011,"level":9,"price":2458931,"stack":1,"description":"Created by Magnus Plenicus at the Mars Construction Site, this capital-quality device intensifies beam weapons, reduces hull damage' and augments the Enviromental Shield skill.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 9 Device Tech","effects":"Beam Focus (Equip)\nIncreases Beam Damage by 3.0% when equipped.\n\nHull Damage Control (Equip)\nIncreases your hulls effectiveness at sustaining damage by 30% when equipped.\n\nImproved Environment Shield (Equip)\nImproves all Environment Shield abilities by 3.63 Skill Level(s) and increases the length of Environmental Shields by 22 seconds when equipped."},{"id":2466,"name":"Magnus' Optimal Progen Reinforcer","type":11,"icon":1016,"level":9,"price":1254121,"stack":1,"description":"Created by Magnus Plenicus at the Mars Construction Site, this capital-quality device intensifies projectile weapons, reduces hull damage' and augments the Enviromental Shield skill.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 9 Device Tech","effects":"Projectile Force (Equip)\nIncreases Projectile Damage by 3.0% when equipped.\n\nHull Damage Control (Equip)\nIncreases your hulls effectiveness at sustaining damage by 30% when equipped.\n\nImproved Environment Shield (Equip)\nImproves all Environment Shield abilities by 3.63 Skill Level(s) and increases the length of Environmental Shields by 22 seconds when equipped."},{"id":3051,"name":"Maiming Dragontooth Gun","type":16,"icon":836,"level":3,"price":16971,"stack":1,"description":"BlackSun Dragontooth projectile weapons fire high-mass impact projectiles at long ranges. Red Dragon Tong members commonly equip them.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Ammunition: Dragontooth\nEnergy use: 9\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 3 Projectile Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 3100\nReload (sec): 1.3\nRounds per shot: 1","effects":""},{"id":3445,"name":"Malachite","type":13,"icon":1468,"level":3,"price":98,"stack":60,"description":"TRADE GEM\nRefined from: Raw Malachite\nAn opaque, green-hued stone.  ","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":1786,"name":"Malfunctioning Drone Detector Array","type":11,"icon":650,"level":1,"price":2311,"stack":1,"description":"A system scavenged from a drone that can be equipped in a device slot to help boost a ship's scan range.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 1 Device Tech","effects":"Scan Boost (Equip)\nAllows ship scanners to see 750 units farther when equipped."},{"id":768,"name":"Malicious Gaze","type":14,"icon":782,"level":1,"price":1976,"stack":1,"description":"Gaze-class beam weapons are commonly equipped by lower order members of the Red Dragon Tongs. They suffer somewhat in damage output but usually have better than average range.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Weapon damage: 3\nDamage type: Energy\nEnergy use: 11\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 1 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1000\nReload (sec): 2","effects":""},{"id":2091,"name":"Manes Compressor","type":11,"icon":927,"level":5,"price":79099,"stack":1,"description":"Prometheus system\nExcuisite design with advanced technology, the mark of Sabine engineering.\nUsed in the reclamation of Manes Essences, this system will improve the quality and speed with which a Sabine gathers essence.\n","manufacturer":"Prometheus","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 5 Device Tech","effects":"Prospect Skill (Equip)\nIncreases Prospecting Effectiveness by 1.50 Skill Level(s) when equipped.\n\nRefine Manes Essence (Equip)\nRefines Lv2 Manes Essence to Lv5 when prospected."},{"id":3885,"name":"Manes Distiller","type":11,"ico