): 7.5\nRounds per shot: 1","effects":"Projectile Weapon Skill (Equip)\nIncreases Projectile Accuracy by 1.93 Skill Level(s) when equipped.\n\nBoost Projectile Range (Equip)\nIncreases Projectile Range by 29% when equipped."},{"id":2810,"name":"Mangonel Max","type":15,"icon":808,"level":8,"price":1070243,"stack":1,"description":"The Sparta Mangonel Missle Launcher requires the use of Sparta Mangonel Missles. Sparta! When the call comes, be ready. When equipped, it gives an increase to the projectile weapon skill. It also gives an increase to the range of all your equipped projectile launchers. ","manufacturer":"Sparta","stats":"Ammunition: Mangonel\nEnergy use: 91\nSkill required: Missile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 8 Missile Weapon\nReload (sec): 9\nRounds per shot: 3","effects":"Projectile Weapon Skill (Equip)\nIncreases Projectile Accuracy by 2.49 Skill Level(s) when equipped.\n\nBoost Projectile Range (Equip)\nIncreases Projectile Range by 35% when equipped."},{"id":606,"name":"Mangonel Plasma Missile","type":10,"icon":681,"level":5,"price":142,"stack":150,"description":"For use with the Sparta Mangonel Missile Launcher.  Sparta!  When the Call comes, be ready.\nThe Mangonel's plasma damage will drain your target's shields over a period of time.","manufacturer":"Sparta","stats":"Ammunition: Mangonel\nWeapon damage: 140\nDamage type: Plasma\nSkill required: Missile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 5 Missile Weapon\nMissile maneuverability: 225\nWeapon range (m): 5300","effects":""},{"id":2734,"name":"Mangonel Prime","type":15,"icon":808,"level":5,"price":67794,"stack":1,"description":"The Sparta Mangonel Missile Launcher requires the use of the Sparta Mangonel Missiles. Sparta! When the Call comes, be ready. When equipped, it gives an increase to the projectile weapon skill. It also gives an increase to the range of all your equipped projectile launchers. ","manufacturer":"Sparta","stats":"Ammunition: Mangonel\nEnergy use: 83\nSkill required: Missile Weapon\nRequirement