e to your scan range, but gives an increase to your chemical resistance.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 6 Device Tech","effects":"Weaken Energy (Activated)\n-34.0 Energy Deflect for 144 seconds to enemy when activated.\n\nDeflect Chemical (Equip)\n+30 Chemical Deflect when equipped.\n\nScan Blind (Equip)\nReduces scan distance by 30.0% when equipped."},{"id":2048,"name":"Manticore's Fell Sting","type":11,"icon":1014,"level":5,"price":55947,"stack":1,"description":"BlackSun Device.\nExperimental Device. Use at own risk.\nWhen activated on a targeted enemy this item causes a decrease to target's energy resistance.\nWhen equipped this item causes a small decrease to your scan range, gives an increase to your chemical resistance.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 5 Device Tech","effects":"Weaken Energy (Activated)\n-30.0 Energy Deflect for 120 seconds to enemy when activated.\n\nDeflect Chemical (Equip)\n+30 Chemical Deflect when equipped.\n\nScan Blind (Equip)\nReduces scan distance by 30.0% when equipped."},{"id":1874,"name":"Manticore's Nettle","type":11,"icon":1011,"level":3,"price":13922,"stack":1,"description":"BlackSun Device\nExperimental Device. Use at own risk.\nWhen activated on a targeted enemy this item causes a decrease to target's energy resistance.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 3 Device Tech","effects":"Weaken Energy (Activated)\n-22.0 Energy Deflect for 72 seconds to enemy when activated."},{"id":1963,"name":"Manticore's Twinge","type":11,"icon":1011,"level":4,"price":34352,"stack":1,"description":"BlackSun Device\nExperimental Device. Use at your own risk.\nWhen activated on a targeted enemy this item causes a decrease to target's energy resistance.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 4 Device Tech","effects":"Weaken Energy (Activated)\n-26.0 Energy D