ufacturer":"Sparta","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5178,"name":"Martyr's Heart","type":11,"icon":977,"level":7,"price":403569,"stack":1,"description":"This item allows you to grant another life, even when your reactor energy is spent. Use with caution.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 7 Device Tech","effects":"Shunt Shields (Instant)\nInstantly converts 2640.00% shield recharge to 5100.00% of reactor recharge when activated."},{"id":2652,"name":"Marvelous ML Type C","type":15,"icon":806,"level":1,"price":2320,"stack":1,"description":"Tada-O Marvelous ML Type C is super cool special item order only. Rocket Type C rocket for Marvelous ML Type C is more far shooting rocket from Rocket Type C. Tada-O! Big! Strong! Wow!\nWhen equipped, it gives a reduction to the amound of energy it takes to engage warp! ","manufacturer":"Tada-O","stats":"Ammunition: Rocket Type C\nEnergy use: 55\nSkill required: Missile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 1 Missile Weapon\nReload (sec): 12.5\nRounds per shot: 1","effects":"Reduce Warp Cost (Equip)\n11% less energy used to engage warp when equipped."},{"id":509,"name":"Masaaki's Fire","type":10,"icon":690,"level":1,"price":178,"stack":200,"description":"This ammo is used for Masaaki's Vengeance.\n\"Kaji no to shinu.\"","manufacturer":"","stats":"Ammunition: Fire\nWeapon damage: 6\nDamage type: Impact\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 1 Projectile Weapon","effects":""},{"id":3029,"name":"Masaaki's Vengeance","type":16,"icon":836,"level":1,"price":2000,"stack":1,"description":"Masaaki's Vengeance is a high-quality Tech 1 projectile launcher.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Ammunition: Fire\nEnergy use: 16\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 1 Projectile Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 2900\nReload (sec): 2.7\nRounds per shot: 1","effects":"Deflect Impact (Equip)\n+17 Impact Deflect when equipped.\n\nDeflect Explosive (Equip)\n+17 Explosive Deflect when equipped."},{"id":1019,"name":"Mastiff","type":14,"icon":768,"level":6,"price":157019,"stack":1,"description":"When equipped the GETCo Mastiff gives increased Hull Patch Skill and increases the ships tractor beam speed. \nGETCo: continuing our 500 year tradition of sustainable development.","manufacturer":"GETco","stats":"Weapon damage: 112\nDamage type: Plasma\nEnergy use: 72\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 6 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1600\nReload (sec): 6","effects":"Hull Patch Skill (Equip)\nImproves Hull Patch effectiveness by 1.93 Skill Levels when equipped.\n\nFast Tractor Beam (Equip)\nIncreases tractor beam speed by 84% when equipped."},{"id":5422,"name":"Matter Sample","type":13,"icon":1378,"level":1,"price":0,"stack":1,"description":"This appears to be a box of something that smells good. This matter must be tastey!","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5428,"name":"Matter Sample Leak","type":13,"icon":2407,"level":1,"price":0,"stack":1,"description":"This containment box is leaking and is eating away your hull!!","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":1778,"name":"Mazzaroth Key","type":11,"icon":1942,"level":1,"price":216,"stack":1,"description":"Blue and white crystalline structure synthesized from rare tazeron crystals. The unique molecular matrix harnesses resonant energy at similar frequencies to those found near the Mazzaroth Maelstrom.\n\n[enter mazzaroth, activate]","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 1 Device Tech","effects":""},{"id":5554,"name":"Mazzaroth Reaper Brain","type":13,"icon":1367,"level":4,"price":1207,"stack":60,"description":"The brain of a Mazzaroth Reaper.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":2746,"name":"Mazzaroth Reaper Spore Launcher","type":15,"icon":817,"level":5,"price":78917,"stack":1,"description":"Launches Mazzaroth Reaper Spores as ammunition.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Ammunition: Spores\nEnergy use: 80\nSkill required: Missile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 5 Missile Weapon\nReload (sec): 11.5\nRounds per shot: 1","effects":""},{"id":587,"name":"Mazzaroth Reaper Spores","type":10,"icon":654,"level":4,"price":16,"stack":130,"description":"Spores found on the bodies of creatures named Mazzaroth Reapers that inhabit the Mazzeroth Maelstrom. These spores may be used as ammunition in Missile Launchers.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Ammunition: Spores\nWeapon damage: 65\nDamage type: Chemical\nSkill required: Missile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 4 Missile Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 5200","effects":""},{"id":6195,"name":"Mazzaroth Reaper Wing","type":13,"icon":1370,"level":2,"price":712,"stack":1,"description":"The wing of a Mazzarot Reaper.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":1919,"name":"MCD Computer Virus","type":11,"icon":1381,"level":3,"price":2200,"stack":1,"description":"This virus has been given to you to aid combat against the Landauer Master Drone Controller v1.3. When equipped and activated, this device will upload a computer virus that will disable some of the drone's defense measures.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 3 Device Tech","effects":""},{"id":5515,"name":"Medal of the Mondara Shear","type":13,"icon":2086,"level":1,"price":527,"stack":1,"description":"The medal of the mondara Shear.\nAwarded in the name of Tribunal and Presidium by Legatus Magnus Gratis Agustus Var in recognition of heroic service against the alien aggresors within the Mondara Maelstrom.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5119,"name":"Medical Equipment","type":13,"icon":1379,"level":3,"price":277,"stack":1,"description":"Everything used by doctors, nurses, and apothecaries galaxy-wide.  Gauze pads, ECG machines, scalpels...\n\nMedical Equipment is needed on Chernovog Station (Aragoth Prime, Aragoth System)","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":6152,"name":"Memo from the desk of Lady deWinter","type":13,"icon":1381,"level":7,"price":2198,"stack":60,"description":"FROM: the office of Lady deWinter. TO: all employees. RE: Information regarding the location of dark matter is hereby considered proprietary company information and is to be kept in strict confidentiality, as per your employment contract, section IV, page 3.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5504,"name":"Memory Capsule","type":13,"icon":733,"level":1,"price":389,"stack":1,"description":"In the tradition of honoring memories, the capsule is to be taken into space and set on its path towards the sun to be purified by fire. Remember those who have come before you and cherish the legacy they leave behind.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":669,"name":"Menace Chemical Bullet","type":10,"icon":720,"level":6,"price":18,"stack":700,"description":"For use with the Tada-O Menace Genre PL 1E projectile launcher.\nTada-O Corporation Tada-O! Big! Strong! Wow!\nThe Menace chemical projectile will corrode your target's hull over a period of time.","manufacturer":"Tada-O","stats":"Ammunition: Menace Bullet\nWeapon damage: 28\nDamage type: Impact\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 6 Projectile Weapon","effects":""},{"id":3906,"name":"Menace Genre PL 1E","type":16,"icon":847,"level":6,"price":209603,"stack":1,"description":"The Tada-O Menace Genre PL 1E projectile launcher requires the use of the Tada-O Menace Bullets.\nTada-O! Big! Strong! Wow!\nWhen equipped, the Menace Genre PL 1E gives an increase to the hacking skill and rally skill.","manufacturer":"Tada-O","stats":"Ammunition: Menace Bullet\nEnergy use: 18\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 6 Projectile Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 3100\nReload (sec): 2\nRounds per shot: 1","effects":"Improved Hacking (Equip)\nImproves Hacking Success by 58% when equipped.\n\nImproved Rally (Equip)\nImproves Rally effectiveness by 1.93 Skill Level(s) when equipped."},{"id":670,"name":"Menace Impact Bullet","type":10,"icon":720,"level":6,"price":18,"stack":700,"descrip