."},{"id":2494,"name":"Musca Prime RS 9","type":11,"icon":707,"level":9,"price":3085602,"stack":1,"description":"Discover the future! Sundari. \nWhen activated on a targeted friendly this item gives a decrease to targets ship signature. \nWhen equipped this item will cause a small increase to your ship's signature, but will decrease the damage your devices will take and increase your scan range.","manufacturer":"Sundari","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 9 Device Tech","effects":"Reduce Ship Signature (Activated)\nGives a ship 25% less radar footprint for 2160.00 seconds when activated.\n\nEquipment Damage Control - Devices (Equip)\nIncreases your devices' effectiveness at sustaining damage by 86% when equipped.\n\nScan Boost (Equip)\nAllows ship scanners to see 3150 units farther when equipped.\n\nIncrease Ship Signature (Equip)\nGives a ship 30% more radar footprint when equipped."},{"id":3036,"name":"Musket Alpha","type":16,"icon":834,"level":2,"price":5408,"stack":1,"description":"The Sparta Musket projectile launcher requires the use of the Sparta Musket rounds. Sparta! When the Call comes, be ready.","manufacturer":"Sparta","stats":"Ammunition: Musket\nEnergy use: 13\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 2 Projectile Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 2900\nReload (sec): 2.4\nRounds per shot: 1","effects":""},{"id":3050,"name":"Musket Beta","type":16,"icon":834,"level":3,"price":14424,"stack":1,"description":"The Sparta Musket projectile launcher requires the use of the Sparta Musket rounds. Sparta! When the Call comes, be ready.","manufacturer":"Sparta","stats":"Ammunition: Musket\nEnergy use: 9\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 3 Projectile Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 3000\nReload (sec): 1.5\nRounds per shot: 1","effects":""},{"id":3095,"name":"Musket Delta","type":16,"icon":840,"level":5,"price":81680,"stack":1,"description":"The Sparta Musket projectile launcher requires the use of the Sparta Musket rounds.