ck Mind","type":11,"icon":651,"level":8,"price":130826,"stack":1,"description":"Focus!  Keep yer eye on what yer doin' an' use this little gem to help ya!","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 8 Device Tech","effects":"Increase Skill Success (Equip)\nIncreases the damage required to interrupt your skill use by 40% when equipped.\n\nIncreased Accuracy (Equip)\nIncreases Weapon Accuracy By 20.00% when equipped."},{"id":3826,"name":"Oni Bioflux Pheromone","type":13,"icon":743,"level":8,"price":251021,"stack":1,"description":"Pheromones from the Oni Fiends","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":2459,"name":"Oni Communication Device","type":11,"icon":1996,"level":9,"price":11892419,"stack":1,"description":"This device was built from the recovered designs of the students of Master Zeh Len.  The original design was an attempt to communicate with that master after her unfortunate mental capture by unknown agents.  It ultimately failed.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 9 Device Tech","effects":""},{"id":3832,"name":"Oni Daeva Photon Emitter","type":13,"icon":193,"level":8,"price":251021,"stack":1,"description":"A glowing piece of the Daeva Oni","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5105,"name":"Onyx","type":13,"icon":1468,"level":1,"price":12,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Raw Onyx","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":2331,"name":"Onyx Lodestar","type":11,"icon":927,"level":8,"price":3926559,"stack":1,"description":"This solar device is based upon schematics in \"Handy Solar Projects\" by Dr. Zachariah Garrett.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 8 Device Tech","effects":"Slow Weapons (Activated)\nDecrease Weapon Firing Rate by 18% for 80 seconds to enemy when activated.\n\nReactor Drain (Activated)\n-48.4% Reactor Recharge for 192 seconds to enemy when activated.\n\nDampen Psionic (Activated)\nAn irresisable -3.