t: 1","effects":"Improved Hacking (Equip)\nImproves Hacking Success by 40% when equipped.\n\nImproved Rally (Equip)\nImproves Rally effectiveness by 1.13 Skill Level(s) when equipped."},{"id":579,"name":"Panic Impact Bullet","type":10,"icon":692,"level":3,"price":8,"stack":400,"description":"For use with the Tada-O Panic Genre PL 2F projectile launcher.  Tada-O Corporation Tada-O! Big! Strong! Wow!","manufacturer":"Tada-O","stats":"Ammunition: Panic Bullet\nWeapon damage: 7\nDamage type: Impact\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 3 Projectile Weapon","effects":""},{"id":580,"name":"Panic Plasma Bullet","type":10,"icon":692,"level":3,"price":8,"stack":400,"description":"For use with the Tada-O Panic Genre PL 2F projectile launcher.  Tada-O Corporation Tada-O! Big! Strong! Wow!","manufacturer":"Tada-O","stats":"Ammunition: Panic Bullet\nWeapon damage: 7\nDamage type: Plasma\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 3 Projectile Weapon","effects":""},{"id":5972,"name":"Partially Digested Gene Map","type":13,"icon":742,"level":9,"price":2781,"stack":60,"description":"While partially digested, this gene map may still be of value to the Progren.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5925,"name":"Patch of Flesh","type":13,"icon":1469,"level":1,"price":361,"stack":60,"description":"A common patch of flesh that looks almost Earth-like in nature.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":2552,"name":"Pegasus UGC 4","type":6,"icon":960,"level":4,"price":32723,"stack":1,"description":"Discover the future! Sundari.\nWhen equipped this item gives an increase to your Fold Space and Cloak Skills.","manufacturer":"Sundari","stats":"Skill required: Engine Tech\nRequirement: Level 4 Engine Tech\nEngine signature: 2200\nImpulse speed: 112\nWarp speed: 3000\nFree-warp energy / sec: 12.8","effects":"Improved Fold Space (Equip)\nIncreases Fold Space distance by 350 when equipped.\n\nImproved Cloaking (Equip)\nReduces Cloaking Engage Time by 1.4 seconds (to a minimum of 3 seconds), makes the target harder to detect with See Cloaking, and increases Stealth Strike time when equipped."},{"id":2574,"name":"Pegasus UGC 5","type":6,"icon":960,"level":5,"price":78698,"stack":1,"description":"Discover the future! Sundari.\nWhen equipped this item gives an increase to your Fold Space and Cloak Skills.","manufacturer":"Sundari","stats":"Skill required: Engine Tech\nRequirement: Level 5 Engine Tech\nEngine signature: 2500\nImpulse speed: 128\nWarp speed: 3250\nFree-warp energy / sec: 17","effects":"Improved Fold Space (Equip)\nIncreases Fold Space distance by 417 when equipped.\n\nImproved Cloaking (Equip)\nReduces Cloaking Engage Time by 1.7 seconds (to a minimum of 3 seconds), makes the target harder to detect with See Cloaking, and increases Stealth Strike time when equipped."},{"id":2592,"name":"Pegasus UGC 6","type":6,"icon":960,"level":6,"price":151238,"stack":1,"description":"Discover the future! Sundari.\nWhen equipped this item gives an increase to your Fold Space and Cloak Skills.","manufacturer":"Sundari","stats":"Skill required: Engine Tech\nRequirement: Level 6 Engine Tech\nEngine signature: 2800\nImpulse speed: 142\nWarp speed: 3500\nFree-warp energy / sec: 21.4","effects":"Improved Fold Space (Equip)\nIncreases Fold Space distance by 484 when equipped.\n\nImproved Cloaking (Equip)\nReduces Cloaking Engage Time by 2.0 seconds (to a minimum of 3 seconds), makes the target harder to detect with See Cloaking, and increases Stealth Strike time when equipped."},{"id":5124,"name":"PermaHair","type":13,"icon":157,"level":4,"price":760,"stack":1,"description":"Want to grow hair... anywhere?  Tired of being called cue-ball or chromedome?  Undo the thinning on top with this rare export of Progen gene technology.\n\nPermaHair is in high demand on Somerled Station (New Edinburg, Tau Ceti System), and Earth Station (Earth, Sol System)","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":2995,"name":"Persephonite","type":13,"icon":191,"level":8,"price":1078,"stack":300,"description":"Refines to: Persephonium","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3586,"name":"Persephonium","type":13,"icon":1482,"level":8,"price":53891,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Persephonite.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5315,"name":"Pesticides","type":13,"icon":1284,"level":1,"price":47,"stack":1,"description":"A mixture of bio-friendly chemicals that are used to retard voracious pests from eating tender growing crops.\n\nThe farmers on Aganju are fond of using this material.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5313,"name":"Pet Food","type":13,"icon":1378,"level":1,"price":30,"stack":1,"description":"All the nutrients and vitamines mixed in a format your pet will appealing.\n\nThe markets on Somerled need a steady stock of this item.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":6018,"name":"Pet-in-a-Jar (tm)","type":13,"icon":148,"level":3,"price":982,"stack":60,"description":"This genetically-modified space kitten mews at you from behind its glass casing.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":1866,"name":"Petit Ayza","type":11,"icon":995,"level":3,"price":13791,"stack":1,"description":"The BlackSun Ayza is used by Clan Chavez to protect against impact attacks.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 3 Device Tech","effects":"Deflect Impact (Activated)\n+20 Impact Deflect for 840 seconds when activated."},{"id":2084,"name":"Petit Baka","type":11,"icon":679,"level":5,"price":80534,"stack":1,"description":"The InZen Baka is used by Clan Chavez to see farther and faster, while keeping their own signature low.","manufacturer":"InZen","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 5 Device Tech","effects":"Scan Boost (Activated)\nGives 25% more radar range for 1300 seconds to target when activated.\n\nReduce Ship Signature (Equip)\nGives a ship 34% less radar footprint when equipped."},{"id":2056,"name":"Petit Caplata","type":11,"icon":1014,"level":5,"price":84187,"stack":1,"description":"This Clan Chavez device drains a target's reactors and shields for one low energy cost.","manufacturer":"Evoco","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 5 Device Tech","effects":"Reactor Drain (Activated)\n-22.0% Reactor Recharge for 60 seconds to enemy when activated.\n\nShield Drain (Activated)\n-22.0% Shield Recharge for 60 seconds to enemy when activated."},{"id":3256,"name":"Petit Dhambier","type":7,"icon":880,"level":5,"price":77922,"stack":1,"description":"Any Dhambier Reactor will provide high recharge energy capacitance, along with protection from jarring impact damage.","manufacturer":"InZen","stats":"Skill required: Reactor Tech\nRequirement: Level 5 Reactor Tech\nReactor capacity: 1131\nReactor recharge / sec: 19.8","effects":"Deflect Impact (Equip)\n+24 Impact Deflect when equipped."},{"id":3650,"name":"Petit Hounfour","type":2,"icon":909,"level":3,"price":13668,"stack":1,"description":"The Evoco Hounfour is specially-built for Migeul Chavez's cronies. It provides the ultimate in shield-cap.","manufacturer":"Evoco","stats":"Skill required: Shield Tech\nRequirement: Level 3 Shield Tech\nShield capacity: 469\nShield recharge / sec: 4.8","effects":""},{"id":3187,"name":"Petit Loa","type":7,"icon":868,"level":2,"price":6262,"stack":1,"description":"The Loa is often known as the little brother of the Dhambier reactor. It provides lo-cap, high-recharge energy.","manufacturer":"InZen","stats":"Skill required: Reactor Tech\nRequirement: Level 2 Reactor Tech\nReactor capacity: 226\nReactor recharge / sec: 8.1","effects":""},{"id":2685,"name":"Petit Ogun","type":15,"icon":811,"level":3,"price":15723,"stack":1,"description":"The BlackSun Ogun missile launcher fires plasma missiles designed to penetrate Montague shields. ","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Ammunition: Ogun\nEnergy use: 72\nSkill required: Missile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 3 Missile Weapon\nReload (sec): 13.8\nRounds per shot: 1","effects":""},{"id":1886,"name":"Petit Petro","type":11,"icon":1014,"level":3,"price":13450,"stack":1,"description":"The Chavez Petro lets them lower the Montague's energy deflection from range.","manufacturer":"Evoco","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 3 Device Tech","effects":"Weaken Energy (Activated)\n-21.0 Energy Deflect for 66 seconds to enemy when activated."},{"id":1910,"name":"Petit Rada","type":11,"icon":995,"level":3,"price":19284,"stack":1,"description":"The Rada is one of the most useful devices in the Chavez's battle with the Montague. It lets them strip away plasma deflection, making a target more vulnerable to the potent Chavez missiles.","manufacturer":"InZen","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 3 Device Tech","effects":"Weaken Plasma (Activated)\n-21.0 Plasma Deflect for 66 seconds to enemy when activated."},{"id":765,"name":"Petit Sango","type":14,"icon":779,"level":1,"price":2040,"stack":1,"description":"InZen manufactured beams have often been the highest powered weapons in the Galaxy, while being prone to malfunction. The Sango line, manufactured for the Chavez, is no different.","manufacturer":"InZen","stats":"Weapon damage: 4\nDamage type: Energy\nEnergy use: 15\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 1 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1000\nReload (sec): 2","effects":""},{"id":936,"name":"Petit Shango","type":14,"icon":781,"level":5,"price":111038,"stack":1,"description":"InZen manufactured beams have often been the highest powered weapons in the Galaxy, while being prone to malfunction. The Shango line, manufactured for the Chavez, is no different.","manufacturer":"InZen","stats":"Weapon damage: 12\nDamage type: Energy\nEnergy use: 10\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 5 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1400\nReload (sec): 1","effects":"Deflect Impact (Equip)\n+25 Impact Deflect when equipped."},{"id":1956,"name":"Petit-Grand Ayza","type":11,"icon":995,"level":4,"price":32979,"stack":1,"description":"The BlackSun Ayza is used by Clan Chavez to protect against impact attacks.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 4 Device Tech","effects":"Deflect Impact (Activated)\n+20 Impact Deflect for 1120 seconds when activated."},{"id":3275,"name":"Petit-Grand Dhambier","type":7,"icon":880,"level":6,"price":176756,"stack":1,"description":"Any Dhambier Reactor will provide high recharge energy capacitance along with protection from jarring impact damage.","manufacturer":"InZen","stats":"Skill required: Reactor Tech\nRequirement: Level 6 Reactor Tech\nReactor capacity: 1629\nReactor recharge / sec: 24","effects":"Deflect Impact (Equip)\n+28 Impact Deflect when equipped."},{"id":3670,"name":"Petit-Grand Hounfour","type":2,"icon":909,"level":4,"price":32795,"stack":1,"description":"The Evoco Hounfour is specially-built for Miguel Chavez's cronies. It provides the ultimate in shield-cap.","manufacturer":"Evoco","stats":"Skill required: Shield Tech\nRequirement: Level 4 Shield Tech\nShield capacity: 1172\nShield recharge / sec: 9.4","effects":""},{"id":3207,"name":"Petit-Grand Loa","type":7,"icon":868,"level":3,"price":14937,"stack":1,"description":"The Loa is often known as the little brother of the Dhambier reactor. It provides lo-cap, high-recharge energy.","manufacturer":"InZen","stats":"Skill required: Reactor Tech\nRequirement: Level 3 Reactor Tech\nReactor capacity: 406\nReactor recharge / sec: 11.3","effects":""},{"id":2706,"name":"Petit-Grand Ogun","type":15,"icon":811,"level":4,"price":35877,"stack":1,"description":"The BlackSun Ogun missile launcher fires plasma missiles designed to penetrate Montague shields. ","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Ammunition: Ogun\nEnergy use: 52\nSkill required: Missile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 4 Missile Weapon\nReload (sec): 8.6\nRounds per shot: 1","effects":""},{"id":1971,"name":"Petit-Grand Petro","type":11,"