n equipped this item gives an increase to your reactor's regeneration rate.","manufacturer":"Sundari","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 7 Device Tech","effects":"Transfer Reactor Energy (Instant)\nTransfers 705.0 units of reactor energy to target when activated.\n\nRecharge Reactor (Equip)\n+4.5 Reactor Recharge when equipped."},{"id":2404,"name":"Phoenix Major BTE 8","type":11,"icon":707,"level":8,"price":1336410,"stack":1,"description":"Discover the future! Sundari.\nWhen activated on a targeted frienldy this item gives a short term BOOSt that transfers your reactor's power to target's reactor.\nWhen equipped this item gives an increase to your reactor's regeneration rate.. ","manufacturer":"Sundari","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 8 Device Tech","effects":"Transfer Reactor Energy (Instant)\nTransfers 921.0 units of reactor energy to target when activated.\n\nRecharge Reactor (Equip)\n+5.0 Reactor Recharge when equipped."},{"id":2120,"name":"Phoenix Minor BTE 5","type":11,"icon":679,"level":5,"price":83664,"stack":1,"description":"Discover the Future! Sundari. \nWhen activated on a targeted friendly this item gives a short term BOOST that transfers your reactor's power to target's reactor. \nWhen equipped this item causes a small increase to the amount of damage your reactor will take, but gives an increase to your reactor's regeneration rate.","manufacturer":"Sundari","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 5 Device Tech","effects":"Transfer Reactor Energy (Instant)\nTransfers 360.0 units of reactor energy to target when activated.\n\nRecharge Reactor (Equip)\n+3.5 Reactor Recharge when equipped.\n\nEquipment Damage Magnification - Reactor (Equip)\nDecreases a reactor's effectiveness at sustaining damage by 20% when equipped."},{"id":2210,"name":"Phoenix Minor BTE 6","type":11,"icon":679,"level":6,"price":180918,"stack":1,"description":"Discover the future! Sundari.\nWhen activated on a targeted frienldy this item gives a short tmer BOOST that transfers your reactor's power to target's reactor.\nWhen equipped this item causes a small increase to the amount of damage your reactor will take, but gives an increase to your reactor's regeneration rate.","manufacturer":"Sundari","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 6 Device Tech","effects":"Transfer Reactor Energy (Instant)\nTransfers 518.0 units of reactor energy to target when activated.\n\nRecharge Reactor (Equip)\n+4.0 Reactor Recharge when equipped.\n\nEquipment Damage Magnification - Reactor (Equip)\nDecreases a reactor's effectiveness at sustaining damage by 20% when equipped."},{"id":2495,"name":"Phoenix Prime BTE 9","type":11,"icon":707,"level":9,"price":2931656,"stack":1,"description":"Discover the future! Sundari.\nWhen activated on a targeted frienldy this item gives a short term BOOST that transfers your reactor's power to target's reactor.\nWhen equipped this item causes a small increase to the amount of damage your reactor will take, but gives an increase to your reactor's regeneration rate and an increase to your scan range.","manufacturer":"Sundari","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 9 Device Tech","effects":"Transfer Reactor Energy (Instant)\nTransfers 1166.0 units of reactor energy to target when activated.\n\nRecharge Reactor (Equip)\n+5.5 Reactor Recharge when equipped.\n\nScan Boost (Equip)\nAllows ship scanners to see 3150 units farther when equipped.\n\nEquipment Damage Magnification - Reactor (Equip)\nDecreases a reactor's effectiveness at sustaining damage by 20% when equipped."},{"id":2878,"name":"Phosphates","type":13,"icon":185,"level":2,"price":7,"stack":300,"description":"Refines to: Phosphorous","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3418,"name":"Phosphorous","type":13,"icon":743,"level":2,"price":298,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Phosphates\nA solid used in glassmaking and incendiary applications.","manufacturer":"","stats