","type":16,"icon":1405,"level":5,"price":37952,"stack":1,"description":"Working prototype from DigiApogee. Use with Caution. Not for resale. For testing purposes only. Testing purpose: Increased bore size to accomidate explosive slugs. Stress factors have been remedied in previous prototypes. ","manufacturer":"DigiApogee","stats":"Ammunition: DigiApogeeU2\nEnergy use: 17\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 5 Projectile Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 3300\nReload (sec): 2.5\nRounds per shot: 3","effects":""},{"id":3109,"name":"Prototype Y 6","type":16,"icon":1405,"level":6,"price":44550,"stack":1,"description":"Working prototype from DigiApogee. Use with caution. Not for resale. For testing purposes only.\nTesting purpose: Increased bore size to accomodate explosive slugs. Stress fractures have been remedied in previous prototypes.","manufacturer":"DigiApogee","stats":"Ammunition: DigiApogeeU6\nEnergy use: 22\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 6 Projectile Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 3500\nReload (sec): 2.1\nRounds per shot: 1","effects":""},{"id":3139,"name":"Prototype Y 7","type":16,"icon":1405,"level":7,"price":60112,"stack":1,"description":"Working prototype from DigiApoge. Use with caution. Not for resale. For testing purposes only.\nTesting purpose: Increased bore size to accomidate explosive slugs. Stress fractures have been remedied in previous prototypes.","manufacturer":"DigiApogee","stats":"Ammunition: DigiApogeeU6\nEnergy use: 16\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 7 Projectile Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 3600\nReload (sec): 1.3\nRounds per shot: 1","effects":""},{"id":3158,"name":"Prototype Y 8","type":16,"icon":1405,"level":8,"price":2154211,"stack":1,"description":"Working prototype from DigiApoge. Use with caution. Not for resale. For testing purposes only.\nTesting purpose; Increased bore size to accomidate explosive slugs. Stress fractures have been remedied in previous prototypes.","manufacturer":"DigiApogee","stats":"Ammunition: DigiApogeeU6\nEnergy use: 36\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 8 Projectile Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 3800\nReload (sec): 2.5\nRounds per shot: 3","effects":""},{"id":3178,"name":"Prototype Z 9","type":16,"icon":1405,"level":9,"price":2549867,"stack":1,"description":"Working prototype from DigiApogee. Use with caution. Not for resale. For testing purposes only.\nTesting Purpose: Increased bore size to accomodate explosive slugs. Stress fractures have been remedied in previous prototypes.","manufacturer":"DigiApogee","stats":"Ammunition: DigiApogeeU9\nEnergy use: 35\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 9 Projectile Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 3800\nReload (sec): 2.2\nRounds per shot: 1","effects":""},{"id":6121,"name":"Proxima Centauri Intelligence Briefing","type":13,"icon":1280,"level":1,"price":0,"stack":1,"description":"Intelligence brief given to you by Gen. Otto van Hotenbaun-Bismarck intended for the eyes of Heiress van Helkein-Naverre in Guiana Station of the Equatorial Earth sector of Sol.","manufacturer":"EarthCorps","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5288,"name":"Psi-Regulator Serum","type":13,"icon":1283,"level":4,"price":499,"stack":1,"description":"Geneticaly refined polysacharides that regulate neural activity to the Pineal gland. Dampens psionic capability allowing Psi's to be managed easily.\n\nThis inhibitor has been constantly shipped to Kinshasa-Mbali since the Psi's have been tasked to work in the mines.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5289,"name":"Psi-Units","type":13,"icon":206,"level":2,"price":120,"stack":1,"description":"A pod full of rather disgruntled Psi's, not very happy about having to work in the mines. They are normally considered dangerous but use of a special serum keeps their abilities in check. It might be a good idea to keep some on hand when transporting these units.\n\nKinshasa-Mbali is more than happy to accept any shipment of Psi's to help work in the mines.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5305,"name":"Psionic Packs","type":13,"icon":146,"level":4,"price":499,"stack":1,"description":"Used to enhance any latent abilities, this item is typicaly consumed for recreation purposes.\n\nMercury Station asks for a steady supply.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3289,"name":"Puk's Blood","type":7,"icon":873,"level":6,"price":200411,"stack":1,"description":"Blacksun Device: Use with extreme caution.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Reactor Tech\nRequirement: Level 6 Reactor Tech\nReactor capacity: 1952\nReactor recharge / sec: 23.1","effects":"Boost Missile Range (Equip)\nIncreases Missile Range by 34% when equipped.\n\nImproved Rally (Equip)\nImproves Rally effectiveness by 2.73 Skill Level(s) when equipped."},{"id":986,"name":"Puk's Breath","type":14,"icon":642,"level":5,"price":88733,"stack":1,"description":"While Huang Tian Nu's involvement in the disappearance of Jing Leong is a subject od much speculation, her favor with Shou Tzu is apparent through her possession of this legendary Plasma beam.\n\nWhen equipped this beam gives an increase to your Beam Weapon skill.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Weapon damage: 25\nDamage type: Plasma\nEnergy use: 20\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 5 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1500\nReload (sec): 2","effects":"Improved Beam Handling (Equip)\nIncreases Beam Accuracy by 2.30 Skill Level(s) when equipped."},{"id":3087,"name":"Puk's Curse","type":16,"icon":2179,"level":5,"price":28971,"stack":1,"description":"","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Ammunition: New Red Dragon Ammo\nEnergy use: 10\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 5 Projectile Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 3500\nReload (sec): 1.2\nRounds per shot: 1","effects":"Missile Energy Conservation (Equip)\nReduces Missile Energy Cost by 35.0% when equipped.\n\nBoost Missile Range (Equip)\nIncreases Missile Range by 23% when equipped."},{"id":2049,"name":"Puk's Pride","type":11,"icon":651,"level":5,"price":61589,"stack":1,"description":"Fourth concubine to Shou Tzu, the gorgeous Han Ai Nu left the protection of Hong Kong to find glory in battle. Shou Tzu had this device specially made for her protection.\n\nWhen equipped this legendary device gives its owner increased Energy. Impact, and Explosive resistance. When activated on a target friendly, this device gives friendly added Explosive and Impact resistance.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 5 Device Tech","effects":"Deflect Explosive (Activated)\n+20 Explosive Deflect for 960 seconds when activated.\n\nDeflect Impact (Activated)\n+20 Impact Deflect for 960 seconds when activated.\n\nDeflect Energy (Equip)\n+30 Energy Deflect when equipped.\n\nDeflect Explosive (Equip)\n+30 Explosive Deflect when equipped.\n\nDeflect Impact (Equip)\n+30 Impact Deflect when equipped."},{"id":3902,"name":"Puk's Spit","type":15,"icon":804,"level":4,"price":33433,"stack":1,"description":"BlackSun Missile Launcher\nUse at own risk.  ","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Ammunition: New Red Dragon Missiles\nEnergy use: 44\nSkill required: Missile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 4 Missile Weapon\nReload (sec): 6.4\nRounds per shot: 1","effects":""},{"id":2580,"name":"Puk's Wing","type":6,"icon":957,"level":5,"price":55335,"stack":1,"description":"Puk's Wing improves Powerdown and conserves Projectile Energy.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Engine Tech\nRequirement: Level 5 Engine Tech\nEngine signature: 3200\nImpulse speed: 127\nWarp speed: 3250\nFree-warp energy / sec: 16.4","effects":"Improved Powerdown (Equip)\nIncreases Powerdown success by 50.00% when equipped.\n\nProjectile Energy Conservation (Equip) \nReduces Projectile Energy Cost by 31.8% when equipped."},{"id":5944,"name":"Pulsating Blood Vessel","type":13,"icon":1375,"level":4,"price":1337,"stack":60,"description":"This blood vessel still pulses, despite being removed from its host.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3679,"name":"Pulsating String of Heart","type":2,"icon":2108,"level":4,"price":28664,"stack":1,"description":"Tada-O holiday line most string protection.  Of a heart to give for Valentines's February day.  Protective bubble of love for your ship.  No bleeding.","manufacturer":"Tada-O","stats":"Skill required: Shield Tech\nRequirement: Level 4 Shield Tech\nShield capacity: 961\nShield recharge / sec: 14.6","effects":"Equipment Engineering (Equip)\nReduces equipment install time by 40% when equipped.\n\nIncrease Speed (Equip)\nIncreases ship top speed by 64 when equipped.\n\nDeflect Energy (Equip)\n+23 Energy Deflect when equipped.\n\nWarp Charge (Equip)\nDecreases warp engage/cooldown times by 30% when equipped."},{"id":769,"name":"Pulse Laser","type":14,"icon":787,"level":1,"price":0,"stack":1,"description":"Basic weapon for Jenquai pilots","manufacturer":"Nishido","stats":"Weapon damage: 3\nDamage type: Energy\nEnergy use: 11\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 1 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 900\nReload (sec): 2","effects":""},{"id":1420,"name":"Pulse Magnifier","type":13,"icon":1473,"level":4,"price":3871,"stack":240,"description":"The K3 Pulse Magnifier is an award winning power casing. Unconventional manufacturing techniques prevent K3 components from being analyzed. ","manufacturer":"K3","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":6083,"name":"Pulsing Antenna","type":13,"icon":1371,"level":7,"price":2258,"stack":1,"description":"A Pulsing Voltoi antenna.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":2360,"name":"Pulsing Bullywere Eye","type":11,"icon":1371,"level":8,"price":1018540,"stack":1,"description":"This detached eye still holds great power.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 8 Device Tech","effects":"Weaken Plasma (Activated)\n-45.0 Plasma Deflect for 208 seconds to enemy when activated.\n\nImproved Critical Targetin