. This chemical round can be used with Ying-Lung's Curse. Wyvern's Curse, and Tatsu's Curse projectile launchers.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Ammunition: New Red Dragon Ammo\nWeapon damage: 10\nDamage type: Chemical\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 3 Projectile Weapon","effects":""},{"id":555,"name":"Red Dragon's Chemical Spit","type":10,"icon":658,"level":3,"price":78,"stack":400,"description":"This ammo was specially designed for the Red Dragons. This chemical rocket can be used with Tatsu's Spit, Puk's Spit, and Taniwha's Spit missle launchers. ","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Ammunition: New Red Dragon Missiles\nWeapon damage: 60\nDamage type: Chemical\nSkill required: Missile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 3 Missile Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 5100","effects":""},{"id":5427,"name":"Red Dragon's EMP Spit","type":10,"icon":658,"level":3,"price":78,"stack":400,"description":"This ammo was specially designed for the Red Dragons. This EMP rocket can be used with Tatsu's Spit, Puk's Spit, and Taniwha's Spit missle launchers. ","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Ammunition: New Red Dragon Missiles\nWeapon damage: 60\nDamage type: EMP\nSkill required: Missile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 3 Missile Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 5100","effects":""},{"id":556,"name":"Red Dragon's Explosive Spit","type":10,"icon":658,"level":3,"price":78,"stack":400,"description":"This ammo was specially designed for the Red Dragons. This explosive rocket can be used with Tatsu's Spit, Puk's Spit, and Taniwha's Spit missle launchers. ","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Ammunition: New Red Dragon Missiles\nWeapon damage: 60\nDamage type: Explosive\nSkill required: Missile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 3 Missile Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 5100","effects":""},{"id":551,"name":"Red Dragon's Impact Curse","type":10,"icon":661,"level":3,"price":12,"stack":400,"description":"This ammo is specially designed for the Red Dragons. This chemical round can be used with Ying-Lung's Curse. Wyvern's Curse, and Tatsu's Curse projectile launchers.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Ammunition: New Red Dragon Ammo\nWeapon damage: 10\nDamage type: Impact\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 3 Projectile Weapon","effects":""},{"id":552,"name":"Red Dragon's Plasma Curse","type":10,"icon":661,"level":3,"price":12,"stack":400,"description":"This ammo is specially designed for the Red Dragons. This plasma round can be used with Ying-Lung's Curse, Wyvern's Curse, and Tatsu's Curse projectile launchers.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Ammunition: New Red Dragon Ammo\nWeapon damage: 10\nDamage type: Plasma\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 3 Projectile Weapon","effects":""},{"id":557,"name":"Red Dragon's Plasma Spit","type":10,"icon":658,"level":3,"price":78,"stack":400,"description":"This ammo was specially designed for the Red Dragons. This plasma rocket can be used with Tatsu's Spit, Puk's Spit, and Taniwha's Spit missle launchers. ","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Ammunition: New Red Dragon Missiles\nWeapon damage: 60\nDamage type: Plasma\nSkill required: Missile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 3 Missile Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 5100","effects":""},{"id":2816,"name":"Red Dragonfly","type":15,"icon":1400,"level":8,"price":1203039,"stack":1,"description":"The Nishido Red Dragonfly Missile Launcher requires the use of the Nishido Red Dragonfly Missiles. Hone ori zon no kutabire mouke. Nishido! Designed to perfection by the greatest of the Shoda-kan Masters.\nWhen equipped, it gives an increase to your shields  recharge rate. It also gives a reduction to the amount of damage your ship's hull might take and on increased resistance to EMP damage.","manufacturer":"Nishido","stats":"Ammunition: Red Dragonfly Missile\nEnergy use: 117\nSkill required: Missile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 8 Missile Weapon\nReload (sec): 10.8\nRounds per shot: 1","effects":"Deflect EMP (Equip)\n+30 EMP Deflect when equipped.\n\nHull Damage Control (Equip)\nIncreases your hulls effectiveness at sustaining damage by 30% when equipped.\n\nRecharge Shields (Equip)\n+42.0% Shield Recharge when equipped."},{"id":713,"name":"Red Dragonfly Chemical Missile","type":10,"icon":711,"level":8,"price":198,"stack":230,"description":"For use with the Nishido Red Dragonfly Missile Launcher.  Hone ori zon no kutabire mouke.  Nishido!  Designed to perfection by the greatest of the Shoda-kan Masters.\nThe Red Dragonfly chemical missile will corrode your target's hull over a period of time.","manufacturer":"Nishido","stats":"Ammunition: Red Dragonfly Missile\nWeapon damage: 450\nDamage type: Chemical\nSkill required: Missile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 8 Missile Weapon\nMissile maneuverability: 300\nWeapon range (m): 5300","effects":""},{"id":714,"name":"Red Dragonfly EMP Missile","type":10,"icon":711,"level":8,"price":198,"stack":230,"description":"For use with the Nishido Red Dragonfly Missile Launcher.  Hone ori zon no kutabire mouke.  Nishido!  Designed to perfection by the greatest of the Shoda-kan Masters.\nThe Red Dragonfly EMP missile will drain your target's energy as well as its shields.","manufacturer":"Nishido","stats":"Ammunition: Red Dragonfly Missile\nWeapon damage: 450\nDamage type: EMP\nSkill required: Missile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 8 Missile Weapon\nMissile maneuverability: 300\nWeapon range (m): 5300","effects":""},{"id":715,"name":"Red Dragonfly Plasma Missile","type":10,"icon":711,"level":8,"price":198,"stack":230,"description":"For use with the Nishido Red Dragonfly Missile Launcher.  Hone ori zon no kutabire mouke.  Nishido!  Designed to perfection by the greatest of the Shoda-kan Masters.\nThe Red Dragonfly plasma missile will drain your target's shields over a period of time.","manufacturer":"Nishido","stats":"Ammunition: Red Dragonfly Missile\nWeapon damage: 450\nDamage type: Plasma\nSkill required: Missile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 8 Missile Weapon\nMissile maneuverability: 300\nWeapon range (m): 5300","effects":""},{"id":1060,"name":"Red Dragonglare","type":14,"icon":1388,"level":6,"price":187439,"stack":1,"description":"This well made beam weapon is made by Blacksun.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Weapon damage: 107\nDamage type: Energy\nEnergy use: 69\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 6 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1400\nReload (sec): 6","effects":""},{"id":3706,"name":"Red DragonPlate","type":2,"icon":905,"level":5,"price":67449,"stack":1,"description":"BlackSun Dragonplate Shields","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Shield Tech\nRequirement: Level 5 Shield Tech\nShield capacity: 2402\nShield recharge / sec: 25.9","effects":"Deflect Energy (Equip)\n+22 Energy Deflect when equipped.\n\nDeflect Impact (Equip)\n+22 Impact Deflect when equipped."},{"id":3124,"name":"Red Dragonspike","type":16,"icon":835,"level":6,"price":45880,"stack":1,"description":"BlackSun Dragonspike Projectile Launchers.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Ammunition: Dragon Spike\nEnergy use: 31\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 6 Projectile Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 3300\nReload (sec): 2.8\nRounds per shot: 6","effects":""},{"id":5347,"name":"Red Dye #5","type":13,"icon":727,"level":1,"price":32,"stack":1,"description":"Secret Jenquai sauce. Tastes both sweet and sour. Goes great with Junta balls and Fried rice.\n\nThe tourists on Ishuan station can't get enough of this delicacy.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":873,"name":"Red Fox","type":14,"icon":785,"level":4,"price":33258,"stack":1,"description":"When equipped the GETCo Mastiff gives increased Hull Patch Skill and increases the ships tractor beam speed. \nGETCo: continuing our 500 year tradition of sustainable development.","manufacturer":"GETco","stats":"Weapon damage: 44\nDamage type: Plasma\nEnergy use: 50\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 4 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1400\nReload (sec): 6","effects":"Hull Patch Skill (Equip)\nImproves Hull Patch effectiveness by 1.40 Skill Levels when equipped.\n\nFast Tractor Beam (Equip)\nIncreases tractor beam speed by 63% when equipped."},{"id":6106,"name":"Red Glowing Sphere","type":13,"icon":1932,"level":3,"price":180,"stack":1,"description":"A smooth mathematically perfect sphere, strangely reminiscent of how oysters shape irritants into pearls. This has a soft almost hypnotic red glow.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":6075,"name":"Red Liquid Crystal","type":13,"icon":1938,"level":6,"price":1624,"stack":60,"description":"Liquid crystal is the 'life blood' of many inorganic life-forms.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3384,"name":"Red Tazeron","type":13,"icon":1481,"level":1,"price":15,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Raw Red Tazeron.\nRefines to: Red Tazeron Circle","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3385,"name":"Red Tazeron Circle","type":13,"icon":1932,"level":1,"price":1,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Red Tazeron\nRefines to: Red Tazeron Hexagon","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3386,"name":"Red Tazeron Hexagon","type":13,"icon":1938,"level":1,"price":15,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Red Tazeron Circle.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3471,"name":"Refined Centauricite","type":13,"icon":187,"level":4,"price":1722,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Raw Centauricite\nA sturdy conductor used in electronic equipment.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3387,"name":"Refined Crude Coal","type":13,"icon":1486,"level":1,"price":10,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Raw Crude Coal\nA black solid used as an additive to other metals.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3560,"name":"Refined Hadecite","type":13,"icon":187,"level":7,"price":16363,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Raw Hadecite","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5263,"name":"Refined Manes Essence","type":13,"icon":1481,"level":3,"pr