 damage by 58% when equipped.\n\nEquipment Damage Magnification - Hull (Equip)\nDecreases a hull's effectiveness at sustaining damage by 10% when equipped."},{"id":2191,"name":"Refresh Senio","type":11,"icon":679,"level":6,"price":153060,"stack":1,"description":"Sparta! When the Call comes, be ready. \nWhen activated on a targetted friendly, this item gives an increase to targets shield regeneration rate. When equipped this item causes a small increase to the damage your hull will take, but gives a decrease to the amount of damage your shield will take. ","manufacturer":"Sparta","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 6 Device Tech","effects":"Recharge Shields (Activated)\n+15.00% Shield Recharge for 1440  seconds when activated.\n\nEquipment Damage Control - Shields (Equip)\nIncreases your shield's effectiveness at sustaining damage by 65% when equipped.\n\nEquipment Damage Magnification - Hull (Equip)\nDecreases a hull's effectiveness at sustaining damage by 10% when equipped."},{"id":2282,"name":"Refresh Septem","type":11,"icon":707,"level":7,"price":484414,"stack":1,"description":"Sparta!  When the Call comes, be ready.\nWhen activated on a targeted friendly this item gives an increase to target's shield regeneration rate.\nWhen equipped this item gives a decrease to the amount of damage your shield will take.","manufacturer":"Sparta","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 7 Device Tech","effects":"Recharge Shields (Activated)\n+15.00% Shield Recharge for 1680  seconds when activated.\n\nEquipment Damage Control - Shields (Equip)\nIncreases your shield's effectiveness at sustaining damage by 72% when equipped."},{"id":2477,"name":"Refuge Novem","type":11,"icon":707,"level":9,"price":2277335,"stack":1,"description":"Sparta! When the Call comes, be ready.\nWhen activated on a targeted friendly this item gives an increase to target's shield regeneration.\nWhen equipped this item cuases a small increase to your ship's signature, bu