 an adventourous journey, far away from the cares and woes of their banal and boring lives.\nLately, Progen of both sexes have been seen secretly purchasing these books in abundance.\n\nThere is a great demand for these books on Arx Spartoi and Povenir Mons.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3643,"name":"Ronin Yoroi Shield Ichi","type":2,"icon":899,"level":2,"price":7091,"stack":1,"description":"Nishido! Designed to perfection by the greatest of the Shoda-kan Masters.\nWhen activated on a targeted group member, this item gives target added chemical resistance.\nWhen equipped this item gives an increase to your psionic resistance, energy regeneration and increases your Cloak Skill.\nKiku wa touza no haji.","manufacturer":"Nishido","stats":"Skill required: Shield Tech\nRequirement: Level 2 Shield Tech\nShield capacity: 97\nShield recharge / sec: 3.8","effects":"Deflect Chemical (Activated)\n+20 Chemical Deflect for 400 seconds when activated.\n\nResist Psionic (Equip)\n+19.0 Psionic Resist when equipped.\n\nRecharge Reactor (Equip)\n+2.0 Reactor Recharge when equipped.\n\nImproved Cloaking (Equip)\nReduces Cloaking Engage Time by 1.0 seconds (to a minimum of 3 seconds), makes the target harder to detect with See Cloaking, and increases Stealth Strike time when equipped."},{"id":3664,"name":"Ronin Yoroi Shield Ni","type":2,"icon":899,"level":3,"price":16469,"stack":1,"description":"Nishido!  Designed to perfection by the greatest of the Shoda-kan Masters.\nWhen activated on a targetd group member, this item gives target added chemical resistance.\nWhen equipped this item gives an increase to your psionic resistance, energy regeneration and increases your Cloak skill.\nKiku wa touza no haji.","manufacturer":"Nishido","stats":"Skill required: Shield Tech\nRequirement: Level 3 Shield Tech\nShield capacity: 244\nShield recharge / sec: 6","effects":"Deflect Chemical (Activated)\n+20 Chemical Deflect for 600 seconds when activated.\n\nResist Psionic (Equip)\n+21.5 Psionic Resist when equipped.\n\nRecharge Reactor (Equip)\n+2.5 Reactor Recharge when equipped.\n\nImproved Cloaking (Equip)\nReduces Cloaking Engage Time by 1.3 seconds (to a minimum of 3 seconds), makes the target harder to detect with See Cloaking, and increases Stealth Strike time when equipped."},{"id":3690,"name":"Ronin Yoroi Shield San","type":2,"icon":899,"level":4,"price":38172,"stack":1,"description":"Nishido!  Designed to perfection by the greatest of the Shoda-kan Masters.\nWhen activated on a targetd group member, this item gives target added chemical resistance.\nWhen equipped this item gives an increase to your psionic resistance, energy regeneration and increases your Cloak skill.\nKiku wa touza no haji.","manufacturer":"Nishido","stats":"Skill required: Shield Tech\nRequirement: Level 4 Shield Tech\nShield capacity: 609\nShield recharge / sec: 14.6","effects":"Deflect Chemical (Activated)\n+20 Chemical Deflect for 800 seconds when activated.\n\nResist Psionic (Equip)\n+24.0 Psionic Resist when equipped.\n\nRecharge Reactor (Equip)\n+3.0 Reactor Recharge when equipped.\n\nImproved Cloaking (Equip)\nReduces Cloaking Engage Time by 1.7 seconds (to a minimum of 3 seconds), makes the target harder to detect with See Cloaking, and increases Stealth Strike time when equipped."},{"id":1033,"name":"Rosette LGS 6","type":14,"icon":776,"level":6,"price":150267,"stack":1,"description":"When equipped, the Sundari Rosette gives increased Fold Space Skill but, will also slightly magnify direct damage to the ship's devices.\nDiscover the future! Sundari.","manufacturer":"Sundari","stats":"Weapon damage: 68\nDamage type: Energy\nEnergy use: 47\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 6 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1600\nReload (sec): 4","effects":"Equipment Damage Magnification - Devices (Equip)\nDecreases a device's effectiveness at sustaining damage by 20% when equipped.\n\nImproved Fold Space (Equip)\nIncreases Fold Space distance by 485 when equi