e Shields (Activated)\nIncreases shield capacity by 5% for 1440.0 seconds when activated."},{"id":5555,"name":"Sabine Science Report 09","type":13,"icon":1381,"level":4,"price":1326,"stack":60,"description":"Technical specifications of an antiquated cold-fusion power grid of considerable size. Document marked as classified. Note scrawled at bottom \"Get this to the crew inspecting those old Getco ruins on Risco, ASAP. They claim there's a grid that they maybe able to get back online!\"  Signed by \"Lucrecius Bor.\"","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5560,"name":"Sabine Science Report 107","type":13,"icon":1381,"level":5,"price":1670,"stack":60,"description":"Private note between two un-named Sabine Specialists, describing how Arrojar Array, recently built by Sabine engineers, helps in transportation to the site of the Appian Gate and also restricts access, providing additional gate security. Most of the report is written in an obscure, pseudo-mathematical dialect.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":829,"name":"Sabre of the Valiant 3","type":14,"icon":775,"level":3,"price":12858,"stack":1,"description":"Created by the Jenquarium to serve as a reward for those valiant souls who aided in the healing of the shear.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Weapon damage: 41\nDamage type: Energy\nEnergy use: 70\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 3 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1200\nReload (sec): 8","effects":"Turbo Beam (Equip)\nReduces Beam Delay by 12.5% when equipped."},{"id":899,"name":"Sabre of the Valiant 4","type":14,"icon":775,"level":4,"price":23150,"stack":1,"description":"Created by the Jenquarium to serve as a reward for those valiant souls who aided in the healing of the shear.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Weapon damage: 66\nDamage type: Energy\nEnergy use: 82\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 4 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1300\nReload (sec): 8","effects":"Turbo Beam (Equip)\nReduces Beam Delay by 15.0% when equipped."},{"id":967,"name":"Sabre of the Valiant 5","type":14,"icon":775,"level":5,"price":71653,"stack":1,"description":"Created by the Jenquarium to serve as a reward for those valiant souls who aided in the healing of the shear.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Weapon damage: 105\nDamage type: Energy\nEnergy use: 94\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 5 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1400\nReload (sec): 8","effects":"Turbo Beam (Equip)\nReduces Beam Delay by 17.5% when equipped."},{"id":1040,"name":"Sabre of the Valiant 6","type":14,"icon":775,"level":6,"price":182950,"stack":1,"description":"Created by the Jenquarium to serve as a reward for those valiant souls who aided in the healing of the shear.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Weapon damage: 168\nDamage type: Energy\nEnergy use: 108\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 6 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1600\nReload (sec): 8","effects":"Turbo Beam (Equip)\nReduces Beam Delay by 20.0% when equipped."},{"id":2924,"name":"Saganite","type":13,"icon":191,"level":4,"price":41,"stack":300,"description":"Refines to: Saganium","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3473,"name":"Saganium","type":13,"icon":1482,"level":4,"price":1624,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Saganite","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5346,"name":"Sagittarius UGC 5","type":14,"icon":770,"level":5,"price":73667,"stack":1,"description":"The Sundari Sagittarius will drain your target's energy as well as it's shields.\nWhen equipped, the Sundari Sagittarius gives the Ship additional EMP Resistance and Energy Resistance.\nDiscover the future! Sundari.","manufacturer":"Sundari","stats":"Weapon damage: 47\nDamage type: EMP\nEnergy use: 42\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 5 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1600\nReload (sec): 4","effects":"Deflect Energy (Equip)\n+24 Energy Deflect when equipped.\n\nDeflect EMP (Equip)\n+24 EMP Deflect when equipped."},{"id":1010,"name":"Sagittarius UGC 6","type":14,"icon":770,"level":6,"price":142731,"stack":1,"description":"The Sundari Sagittarius will drain your target's energy as well as it's shields.\nWhen equipped, the Sundari Sagittarius gives the Ship additional EMP Resistance and Energy Resistance.\nDiscover the future! Sundari.","manufacturer":"Sundari","stats":"Weapon damage: 75\nDamage type: EMP\nEnergy use: 48\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 6 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1700\nReload (sec): 4","effects":"Deflect Energy (Equip)\n+27 Energy Deflect when equipped.\n\nDeflect EMP (Equip)\n+27 EMP Deflect when equipped."},{"id":1086,"name":"Sagittarius UGC 7","type":14,"icon":770,"level":7,"price":403649,"stack":1,"description":"The Sundari Sagittarius will drain your target's energy as well as it's shields.\nWhen equipped, the Sundari Sagittarius gives the ship additional EMP Resistance and Energy Resistance.\nDiscover the future! Sundari.","manufacturer":"Sundari","stats":"Weapon damage: 119\nDamage type: EMP\nEnergy use: 52\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 7 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1800\nReload (sec): 4","effects":"Deflect Energy (Equip)\n+30 Energy Deflect when equipped.\n\nDeflect EMP (Equip)\n+30 EMP Deflect when equipped."},{"id":2271,"name":"Sai'Li's Circle","type":11,"icon":1381,"level":7,"price":389750,"stack":1,"description":"A metallic circle with seemingly no special qualities. though pondering the circle draws the eye and settles the mind.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 7 Device Tech","effects":"Resist Psionic (Equip)\n+28.0 Psionic Resist when equipped.\n\nHull Damage Control (Equip)\nIncreases your hulls effectiveness at sustaining damage by 143% when equipped.\n\nRecharge Shields (Equip)\n+32.4% Shield Recharge when equipped."},{"id":3735,"name":"Saint Jacques Ala","type":2,"icon":911,"level":6,"price":198687,"stack":1,"description":"Saint Jacques Ala thunders past its Blacksun counterparts. Guadalupe Mendoza y Ramos recovered this shield from Javier Montero's son who first stole it from the traitoroous Miguel Chavez. Saint Jacques Ala controls damage done to te shield, increases combat speed, and increases Psionic resistance. ","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Shield Tech\nRequirement: Level 6 Shield Tech","effects":"Equipment Damage Control - Shields (Equip)\nIncreases your shield's effectiveness at sustaining damage by 66% when equipped.\n\nIncrease Speed (Equip)\nIncreases ship top speed by 96 when equipped.\n\nResist Psionic (Equip)\n+25.0 Psionic Resist when equipped."},{"id":840,"name":"Saint Jacques Iku","type":14,"icon":765,"level":3,"price":13693,"stack":1,"description":"Saint Jacques Iku","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Weapon damage: 10\nDamage type: Energy\nEnergy use: 15\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 3 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1300\nReload (sec): 2","effects":"Equipment Damage Control - Weapons (Equip)\nIncreases your weapons' effectiveness at sustaining damage by 48% when equipped."},{"id":2605,"name":"Saint Jacques' Afefe","type":6,"icon":957,"level":6,"price":156987,"stack":1,"description":"","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Engine Tech\nRequirement: Level 6 Engine Tech\nEngine signature: 4000\nImpulse speed: 140\nWarp speed: 3500\nFree-warp energy / sec: 20.5","effects":""},{"id":2692,"name":"Saint Jacques' Ara","type":15,"icon":806,"level":3,"price":18000,"stack":1,"description":"Ernesto Jimenez y Ramos brought this BlackSun missle launcher to Saint Jaques' high priest to give it the power to inflict heavy damage upon enemy weapons. The elderly priest misheard Ernesto and granted Saint Jacques' Ara with weapon damage control instead.\n\nThis launcher uses Chavez Ara Missiles.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Ammunition: New Chavez Missiles\nEnergy use: 60\nSkill required: Missile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 3 Missile Weapon\nReload (sec): 10.4\nRounds per shot: 1","effects":"Equipment Damage Control - Weapons (Equip)\nIncreases your weapons' effectiveness at sustaining damage by 51% when equipped."},{"id":3066,"name":"Saint Jacques' Arun","type":16,"icon":837,"level":3,"price":12156,"stack":1,"description":"The Eggun of Saint Jacques' claimed to have blessed this projectile weapon to grant the bearer infinite reactor energy. With his shrewd eye, Enrique Solis-Cano easily noticed that it did no such thing.\nConfronted by this false advertising, the priests of Saint Jacques' were forced to sell it for a song, and Enrique even got them to throw in a weapon damage control ability in exchange for keeping his mouth shut.\n\nThis projectile weapon uses Chavez Arun ammunition.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Ammunition: New Chavez Ammo\nEnergy use: 12\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 3 Projectile Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 3200\nReload (sec): 1.9\nRounds per shot: 1","effects":"Equipment Damage Control - Weapons (Equip)\nIncreases your weapons' effectiveness at sustaining damage by 48% when equipped."},{"id":3290,"name":"Saint Jacques' Eje","type":7,"icon":873,"level":6,"price":201366,"stack":1,"description":"","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Reactor Tech\nRequirement: Level 6 Reactor Tech\nReactor capacity: 1952\nReactor recharge / sec: 23.1","effects":""},{"id":1967,"name":"Salamander's Breath","type":11,"icon":1011,"level":4,"price":31205,"stack":1,"description":"BlackSun Device\nExperimental Device. Use at own risk.\nWhen activated on a targeted enemy this item causes a decrease to target's explosive resistance.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 4 Device Tech","effects":"Weaken Explosive (Activated)\n-26.0 Explosive Deflect for 96 seconds to enemy when activated."},{"id":2328,"name":"Salamander's Dire Simoon","type":11,"icon":1017,"level":8,"price":992552,"stack":1,"description":"BlackSun Device\nExperimental Device. Use at own risk.\nWhen activated on a targe