nShield recharge / sec: 106","effects":"Equipment Engineering (Activated)\nReduces equipment install time by 50% for 1120 seconds when activated.\n\nHull Patch Skill (Equip)\nImproves Hull Patch effectiveness by 2.20 Skill Levels when equipped."},{"id":3804,"name":"SH-X9 \"Great Dane\" Mk. IX","type":2,"icon":917,"level":9,"price":2460743,"stack":1,"description":"InfinitiCorp: Bringing technology to you!\nWhen activated on a targeted group member, this item gives target a faster equip time for ship components.\nWhen equipped this item gives an increase to your Hull Patch skill.","manufacturer":"InfinitiCorp","stats":"Skill required: Shield Tech\nRequirement: Level 9 Shield Tech\nShield capacity: 86957\nShield recharge / sec: 656","effects":"Equipment Engineering (Activated)\nReduces equipment install time by 50% for 1440 seconds when activated.\n\nHull Patch Skill (Equip)\nImproves Hull Patch effectiveness by 2.79 Skill Levels when equipped."},{"id":3749,"name":"SH-X9 \"Great Dane\" Mk. VII","type":2,"icon":917,"level":7,"price":566411,"stack":1,"description":"InfinitiCorp: Bringing technology to you!\nWhen activated on a targeted group member, this item gives target a faster equip time for ship components.\nWhen equipped this item gives an increase to your Hull Patch skill.","manufacturer":"InfinitiCorp","stats":"Skill required: Shield Tech\nRequirement: Level 7 Shield Tech\nShield capacity: 13916\nShield recharge / sec: 140","effects":"Equipment Engineering (Activated)\nReduces equipment install time by 50% for 1120 seconds when activated.\n\nHull Patch Skill (Equip)\nImproves Hull Patch effectiveness by 2.20 Skill Levels when equipped."},{"id":3779,"name":"SH-X9 \"Great Dane\" Mk. VIII","type":2,"icon":917,"level":8,"price":1076457,"stack":1,"description":"InfinitiCorp: Bringing technology to you!\nWhen activated on a targeted group member, this item gives target a faster equip time for ship components.\nWhen equipped this item gives an increase to your Hull Patch skill.","manufacturer":"InfinitiCorp","stats":"Skill required: Shield Tech\nRequirement: Level 8 Shield Tech\nShield capacity: 34790\nShield recharge / sec: 290.9","effects":"Equipment Engineering (Activated)\nReduces equipment install time by 50% for 1280 seconds when activated.\n\nHull Patch Skill (Equip)\nImproves Hull Patch effectiveness by 2.49 Skill Levels when equipped."},{"id":5182,"name":"SH1R2DV3S34NR2L31BL2","type":11,"icon":707,"level":8,"price":967821,"stack":1,"description":"1TR3SKF4RR2S3D51L3M1G2R6M6TH4L4G3C1LL6S3GN3F3C1N3TF4V2R-S1T5R1T2D,5S2C15T34NS2L2CT3NGS45RC2F32LDS","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 8 Device Tech","effects":"ScanRange - BOOST! (Activated)\nGives a ship 14550 more radar range for 10 seconds to target when activated.\n\nEquipment Damage Control - Devices (Equip)\nIncreases your devices' effectiveness at sustaining damage by 375% when equipped."},{"id":6154,"name":"Sha'ha'dem Scientific Report Si2","type":13,"icon":1381,"level":2,"price":658,"stack":60,"description":"A confusing, oftentimes contradictory account of three months of research beyond the Intzalan Line, near the primary star of Sirius. Describes some of the unexplained effects reported by ships in this area, including temporary loss of equipment functionality, temporary reductions in in engine speed, and sudden losses of reactor energy. Effects are almost always preceded by a prickling at the back of the neck, a feeling of dread, or a sense of being observed from afar.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5668,"name":"Sha'ha'dem Scientific Reports 2","type":13,"icon":1381,"level":2,"price":601,"stack":60,"description":"","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5875,"name":"Sha'ha'dem Scientific Reports Ca3","type":13,"icon":1381,"level":5,"price":1637,"stack":60,"description":"Inventory of some Ancient artifacts found in the Yokan sector and along Shiva's belt in the cappella system. Some speculative but implausible notes on the functions of these artifacts (e.g. \"see invisible\")","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3883,"name":"Shaitan Deflectors","type":2,"icon":903,"level":2,"price":3792,"stack":1,"description":"Personal shield of the Shaitan Prophet.","manufacturer":"Shaitan","stats":"Skill required: Shield Tech\nRequirement: Level 2 Shield Tech\nShield capacity: 131\nShield recharge / sec: 2.3","effects":""},{"id":2523,"name":"Shaitan Motivator","type":6,"icon":702,"level":2,"price":5625,"stack":1,"description":"A recovered engine from a destroyed Shaitan. It will move your ship but not nearly as well as it moved the Shaitan.","manufacturer":"Shaitan","stats":"Skill required: Engine Tech\nRequirement: Level 2 Engine Tech\nEngine signature: 1900\nImpulse speed: 76\nWarp speed: 2250\nFree-warp energy / sec: 6.7","effects":""},{"id":1848,"name":"Shaitan Power Core","type":11,"icon":743,"level":2,"price":5789,"stack":1,"description":"A power core from a Shaitan.  It can be used as a device to aid in energy regeneration.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 2 Device Tech","effects":"Recharge Reactor (Equip)\n+2.0 Reactor Recharge when equipped."},{"id":1790,"name":"Shaitan Power Pod","type":11,"icon":743,"level":1,"price":2240,"stack":1,"description":"A power core from a Shaitan.  It can be used as a device to aid in energy regeneration.\n","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 1 Device Tech","effects":"Recharge Reactor (Equip)\n+1.5 Reactor Recharge when equipped."},{"id":5615,"name":"Shakaku Cortex","type":13,"icon":1367,"level":1,"price":303,"stack":60,"description":"The brain cortex of a Shakaku.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5669,"name":"Shakaku Hide","type":13,"icon":1372,"level":2,"price":714,"stack":60,"description":"The hide of a Shakaku.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5616,"name":"Shakaku Skin","type":13,"icon":1372,"level":1,"price":930,"stack":60,"description":"A piece of skin from a Shakaku.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5732,"name":"Shakaku Tail","type":13,"icon":1368,"level":3,"price":962,"stack":60,"description":"The tail of a Shakaku.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5774,"name":"Shakaku Wing","type":13,"icon":1370,"level":4,"price":1233,"stack":60,"description":"A Shakaku wing.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5280,"name":"Shakespeare's Plays","type":13,"icon":1280,"level":3,"price":381,"stack":1,"description":"The Bard's works are very popular within the Jenquai Hierata.\n\nShakespeare's Plays are in demand at Paren Station (Kailaasa, Capella System) and Prasad Station (Xipe Totec, Sirius System).","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5989,"name":"Sharim Prototype Shield","type":2,"icon":913,"level":8,"price":912970,"stack":1,"description":"This shield was maunufactured by the Mordana. Increases shield and reactor capacity. ","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Shield Tech\nRequirement: Level 8 Shield Tech\nShield capacity: 44904\nShield recharge / sec: 327","effects":"Recharge Shields Skill (Equip)\nIncreases Recharge Shields Effectiveness by 3.00 Skill Level(s) when equipped.\n\nImproved Psionic Shield (Equip)\nIncreases Psionic Shield Damage absorption by 7500 to 10500, depending on ability used and increases duration of shield by 120 seconds when equipped.\n\nIncrease Reactor Capacity (Equip)\n+726 Reactor Capacity when equipped.\n\nRecharge Reactor (Equip)\n+51.6 Reactor Recharge when equipped."},{"id":5343,"name":"Sharim Shields","type":2,"icon":899,"level":2,"price":6250,"stack":1,"description":"An old set of shield that have been well used and have a good bit of carbon scoring on the casing. They seem to be customized to allow a boost to Recharge Shield Skill.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Shield Tech\nRequirement: Level 2 Shield Tech\nShield capacity: 154\nShield recharge / sec: 3.8","effects":"Recharge Shields Skill (Equip)\nIncreases Recharge Shields Effectiveness by 1.00 Skill Level(s) when equipped."},{"id":1830,"name":"Shark Fin L2","type":11,"icon":650,"level":2,"price":3367,"stack":1,"description":"GETCo: Continuing our 500 year tradition of sustainable development.\nWhen activated on yourself this item gives an increase to your combat speed.","manufacturer":"GETco","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 2 Device Tech","effects":"Increase Speed (Activated)\nIncreases ship top speed by 50 for 480 seconds when activated."},{"id":1895,"name":"Shark Fin L3","type":11,"icon":650,"level":3,"price":11882,"stack":1,"description":"GETCo: Continuing our 500 year tradition of sustainable development.\nWhen activated on yourself this item gives an increase to your combat speed.","manufacturer":"GETco","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 3 Device Tech","effects":"Increase Speed (Activated)\nIncreases ship top speed by 50 for 720 seconds when activated."},{"id":1980,"name":"Shark Fin L4","type":11,"icon":650,"level":4,"price":31292,"stack":1,"description":"GETCo: Continuing our 500 year tradition of sustainable development.\nWhen activated on yourself this item gives an increase to your combat speed.","manufacturer":"GETco","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 4 Device Tech","effects":"Increase Speed (Activated)\nIncreases ship top speed by 50 for 960 seconds when activated."},{"id":2066,"name":"Shark Fin L5","type":11,"icon":678,"level":5,"price":48671,"stack":1,"description":"GETCo: Continuing our 500 year tradition of sustainable development.\nWhen activated on yourself this item gives an increase to your comabt speed.\nWhen equipped this item causes a small increase to your ship's signature, but gives an increase to your Rally skill.","manufacturer":"GETco","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 5 Device Tech","effects":"Increase Speed (Activated)\nIncreases ship top speed by 50 for 1200 seconds when activated.\n\nImproved Rally (Equip)\nImproves Rally effectiveness by 2.00 Skill Level(s) when equipped.\n\nIncrease Ship Signature (Equip)\nGives a ship 30% more radar footprint when equipped."},{"id":2152,"name":"Shark Fin L6","type":11,"icon":678,"level":6,"price":128429,"stack":1,"description":"GETCo: Continuing our 500 year tradition of sustainable development. \nWhen activated on yourself this item gives an increase to your comabt speed. \nWhen equipped this item causes a small increase to your ship's signature, but gives an increase to your Rally skill. ","manufacturer":"GETco","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 6 Device Tech","effects":"Increase Speed (Activated)\nIncreases ship top speed by 50 for 1440 seconds when activated.\n\nImproved Rally (Equip)\nImproves Rally effectiveness by 2.33 Skill Level(s) when equipped.\n\nIncrease Ship Signature (Equip)\nGives a ship 30% more radar footprint when equipped."},{"id":2241,"name":"Shark Fin L7","type":11,"icon":706,"level":7,"price":484414,"stack":1,"description":"GETCo: Continuing our 500 year tradition of sustainable development.\nWhen activated on yourself this item gives an increase to your combat speed.\nWhen equipped this item gives an increase to your Rally skill.","manufacturer":"GETco","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 7 Device Tech","effects":"Increase Speed (Activated)\nIncreases ship top speed by 50 for 1680 seconds when activated.\n\nImproved Rally (Equip)\nImproves Rally effectiveness by 2.66 Skill Level(s) when equipped."},{"id":2341,"name":"Shark Fin L8","type":11,"icon":706,"level":8,"price":1205907,"stack":1,"description":"GETCo: Continuing our 500 year tradition of sustainable development. \nWhen activated on yourself this item gives an increase to your combat speed. \nWhen equipped this item gives an increase to your Rally skill. ","manufacturer":"GETco","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 8 Device Tech","effects":"Increase Speed (Activated)\nIncreases ship top speed by 50 for 1920 seconds when activated.\n\nImproved Rally (Equip)\nImproves Rally effectiveness by 3.00 Skill Level(s) when equipped."},{"id":2440,"name":"Shark Fin L9","type":11,"icon":706,"level":9,"price":2931656,"stack":1,"description":"GETCo: Continuing our 500 year tradition of sustainable development. \nWhen activated on yourself this item gives an increase to your comabt speed. \nWhen equipped this item causes a small increase to your ship's signature, but gives an increase to your Rally skill and an increase to your manuverablity. ","manufacturer":"GETco","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 9 Device Tech","effects":"Increase Speed (Activated)\nIncreases ship top speed by 50 for 2160 seconds when activated.\n\nImproved Rally (Equip)\nImproves Rally effectiveness by 3.33 Skill Level(s) when equipped.\n\nIncrease Maneuverability (Equip)\nIncreases turn rate by 56% when equipped.\n\nIncrease Ship Signature (Equip)\nGives a ship 30% more radar footprint when equipped."},{"id":2479,"name":"Shatter Novem","type":11,"icon":1017,"level":9,"price":3403756,"stack":1,"description":"Sparta! When the Call comes, be ready. \nWhen activated on a targeted enemy, this item causes an interruption to target's reactor regeneration. \nWhen equipped this item causes a small increase to the amount of damage your shield will take, but gives an increase to the combat trance skill and Shield Inversion.","manufacturer":"Sparta","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 9 Device Tech","effects":"Reactor Interrupt (Activated)\nStops all Reactor Recharge for 64.00 seconds to enemy when activated.\n\nImproved Combat Trance (Equip)\nImproves Combat Trance effectiveness by 3.33 Skill Level(s) when equipped.\n\nImproved Shield Inversion (Equip)\nImproves Shield Inversion duration by 5.40  seconds while equipped.\n\nEquipment Damage Magnification - Shield (Equip)\nDecreases a shield's effectiveness at sustaining damage by 20% when equipped."},{"id":2388,"name":"Shatter Octo","type":11,"icon":1017,"level":8,"price":1346049,"stack":1,"description":"Sparta! When the Call comes, be ready.\nWhen activated on a targeted enemy, this item causes an interruption to target's reactor regeneration.\nWhen equipped this item gives an increas to the combat trance skill..","manufacturer":"Sparta","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 8 Device Tech","effects":"Reactor Interrupt (Activated)\nStops all Reactor Recharge for 64.00 seconds to enemy when activated.\n\nImproved Combat Trance (Equip)\nImproves Combat Trance effectiveness by 3.00 Skill Level(s) when equipped."},{"id":2011,"name":"Shatter Quattuor","type":11,"icon":1011,"level":4,"price":29151,"stack":1,"description":"Sparta! When the Call comes, be ready.\nWhen activated on a targeted enemy, this item causes an interruption to target's reactor regeneration.","manufacturer":"Sparta","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 4 Device Tech","effects":"Reactor Interrupt (Activated)\nStops all Reactor Recharge for 32.00 seconds to enemy when activated."},{"id":2104,"name":"Shatter Quinque","type":11,"icon":1014,"level":5,"price":71894,"stack":1,"description":"Sparta! When the Call comes, be ready. \nWhen activated on a targeted enemy, this item causes an interruption to target's reactor regeneration. \nWhen equipped this item causes a small increase to the amount of damage your shield will take, but gives an increase to the combat trance skill.","manufacturer":"Sparta","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 5 Device Tech","effects":"Reactor Interrupt (Activated)\nStops all Reactor Recharge for 40.00 seconds to enemy when activated.\n\nEquipment Damage Magnification - Shield (Equip)\nDecreases a shield's effectiveness at sustaining damage by 20% when equipped."},{"id":2194,"name":"Shatter Senio","type":11,"icon":1014,"level":6,"price":168410,"stack":1,"description":"S