:"Dampen Chemical and EMP (Activated)\nAn Irresistable -4.0 debuff to Chemical and EMP Resists for 168 seconds to enemy when activated."},{"id":1816,"name":"Shield Augmentation Nanoprobes","type":11,"icon":2175,"level":2,"price":3208,"stack":1,"description":"BlackSun Device \nExperimental Device. Use at your own risk.\nWhen this device is equipped it will increase your ships ability to deflect impact. It will also increase the rate at which your shields regenerate!","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 2 Device Tech","effects":"Deflect Impact (Equip)\n+30 Impact Deflect when equipped.\n\nRecharge Shields (Equip)\n+18.0% Shield Recharge when equipped."},{"id":6051,"name":"Shield Emitter","type":13,"icon":990,"level":8,"price":2424,"stack":60,"description":"A typical shield emitter used on many ships and cybertonic systems.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5884,"name":"Shield Energy Converter","type":11,"icon":977,"level":7,"price":408726,"stack":1,"description":"This item allows reroute a portion of your shield power to your reactor.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 7 Device Tech","effects":"Reroute Shield Energy (Instant)\nInstantly reroutes 43.00% of your maximum shield energy to 22.00% of your reactor energy when activated."},{"id":1818,"name":"Shieldgen LT","type":11,"icon":1009,"level":2,"price":5856,"stack":1,"description":"The Blacksun Shieldgen system amplifies any shield system's power generator's, significantly increasing it's recharge rate.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 2 Device Tech","effects":"Recharge Shields (Equip)\n+14.8% Shield Recharge when equipped."},{"id":1879,"name":"Shieldgen MT","type":11,"icon":1009,"level":3,"price":13848,"stack":1,"description":"The BlackSun Shieldgen system amplififies and shield system's power generators, significantly increasing it's recharge rate.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 3 Device Tech","effects":"Recharge Shields (Equip)\n+17.2% Shield Recharge when equipped."},{"id":1968,"name":"Shieldgen XT","type":11,"icon":1009,"level":4,"price":33456,"stack":1,"description":"The Blacksun Shieldgen system amplifies any shield systems's power generators, signicantly increasing it's recharge rate.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 4 Device Tech","effects":"Recharge Shields (Equip)\n+19.6% Shield Recharge when equipped."},{"id":1788,"name":"Shikari Armorplate","type":11,"icon":999,"level":1,"price":2170,"stack":1,"description":"A recovered system from a Shikari that can be equipped in a device slot to provide increased deflection against impact weapon volleys.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 1 Device Tech","effects":"Deflect Impact (Equip)\n+16 Impact Deflect when equipped."},{"id":1847,"name":"Shikari Deflector","type":11,"icon":990,"level":2,"price":5727,"stack":1,"description":"A deflector from a Shikari. If equipped in a device slot it can offer a small amount of resistance to energy based attacks.","manufacturer":"Shikari","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 2 Device Tech","effects":"Deflect Energy (Equip)\n+20 Energy Deflect when equipped."},{"id":1789,"name":"Shikari Deflector - Dented","type":11,"icon":990,"level":1,"price":2199,"stack":1,"description":"A deflector from a Shikari.  If equipped in a device slot it can offer a small amount of resistance to energy based attacks.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 1 Device Tech","effects":"Deflect Energy (Equip)\n+16 Energy Deflect when equipped."},{"id":5211,"name":"Shikari Motivator","type":6,"icon":950,"level":1,"price":1000,"stack":1,"description":"An unusual engine from a rogue Shikari drone. It will move your ship also, but not as well as it moved the Shikari. No one has yet determined exactly how the drones build items.","manufacturer":"Shikari","stats":"Skill required: Engine Tech\nRequirement: Level 1 Engine Tech\nEngine signature: 1000\nImpulse speed: 55\nWarp speed: 3000\nFree-warp energy / sec: 6.5","effects":""},{"id":3292,"name":"Shimmering Balefire","type":7,"icon":868,"level":7,"price":1871740,"stack":1,"description":"This solar reactor is based upon schematics in \"Handy Solar Projects\" by Dr. Zachariah Garrett.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Reactor Tech\nRequirement: Level 7 Reactor Tech\nReactor capacity: 2831\nReactor recharge / sec: 30.9","effects":"Increase Maneuverability (Activated)\nIncrease turn rate by 35% for 1960 seconds when activated.\n\nRecharge Reactor (Equip)\n+5.2 Reactor Recharge when equipped."},{"id":915,"name":"Shimmering Glaive","type":14,"icon":779,"level":4,"price":29753,"stack":1,"description":"When equipped, the Sparta Glaive gives increased Gravity Link Skill and increased Powerdown Skill.\nSparta! When the Call comes, be ready.","manufacturer":"Sparta","stats":"Weapon damage: 54\nDamage type: Energy\nEnergy use: 85\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 4 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1100\nReload (sec): 10","effects":"Improved Gravity Link (Equip)\nImproves Gravity Links by 1.67 Skill Level(s) when equipped.\n\nImproved Powerdown (Equip)\nIncreases Powerdown success by 50.00% when equipped."},{"id":5561,"name":"Shinwa Badge of Valor","type":13,"icon":1935,"level":5,"price":1527,"stack":60,"description":"A ceremonial decoration awarded to Shinwa warriors who embody the principle of Valor.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5551,"name":"Shinwa Intelligence Sirius 1","type":13,"icon":1381,"level":3,"price":994,"stack":60,"description":"Catalogue of some recent trips beyond the Intzalan Line in the Sirius sector. Author mentions a strange incident in which her ship's shields were suddenly drained of power, and another where the range of her scanning computer was substantially reduced. In all cases, she reports a sense of being observed, even \"toyed with\" by a disant entity that she idenifies as \"The Hidden One.\"","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5546,"name":"Shinwa Orders: Code Falcon","type":13,"icon":1381,"level":2,"price":645,"stack":60,"description":"Dumont ben Joseph reported missing for the fifth time in two months, thought to be somewhere in Sirius, \"since this is where he has been forbidden to go.\" His father, Dryden ben Joseph, is said to be \"highly put out.\" Author suggests that the search effort  be quiet and discrete. addressed to \"Master Ayam, of the Sev Tushnim.\"","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5617,"name":"Shinwa Orders: Code Phoenix","type":13,"icon":1381,"level":1,"price":382,"stack":60,"description":"","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":1912,"name":"Shiny Warp Kaza","type":11,"icon":1011,"level":3,"price":13319,"stack":1,"description":"This alien device somehow modifies local warp fields, making warp travel faster without requiring additional energy.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 3 Device Tech","effects":"Turbo Warp (Equip)\nIncreases warp speed by 334.0 when equipped."},{"id":5618,"name":"Shipment of Fine Jewelty","type":13,"icon":158,"level":1,"price":727,"stack":60,"description":"Jewelry smuggling is one of the more profitable ventures Smugglers engage in.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3713,"name":"Shizoku Yoroi Shield Ichi","type":2,"icon":899,"level":5,"price":80990,"stack":1,"description":"Nishido! Designed to perfection by the greatest of the Shoda-kan Masters.","manufacturer":"Nishido","stats":"Skill required: Shield Tech\nRequirement: Level 5 Shield Tech\nShield capacity: 1523\nShield recharge / sec: 22.7","effects":"Deflect Energy (Activated)\n+20 Energy Deflect for 800 seconds when activated.\n\nResist Psionic (Equip)\n+25.0 Psionic Resist when equipped.\n\nRech