s","type":11,"icon":651,"level":1,"price":2118,"stack":1,"description":"Bogeril just aren't that effected by psionic powers.  Why, you ask?  Well, one might say psionics are brain powers, and you need a brain to be effected by them.","manufacturer":"Bogeril","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 1 Device Tech","effects":"Resist Psionic (Equip)\n+16.3 Psionic Resist when equipped."},{"id":5856,"name":"Singed Ten-Gu Fin","type":13,"icon":1370,"level":7,"price":2151,"stack":60,"description":"The singed fin of a Ten-Gu.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5853,"name":"Singed Ten-Gu Hide","type":13,"icon":1372,"level":7,"price":2151,"stack":60,"description":"The singed hide of a Ten-Gu.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":6071,"name":"Singing Crystal","type":13,"icon":2358,"level":4,"price":1220,"stack":60,"description":"A piezoelectric crystal which 'sings' with a high pitched tone.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":724,"name":"Singularity Grenade","type":10,"icon":693,"level":9,"price":46,"stack":800,"description":"Designed for use with the Singularity Mortar, BlackSun Singularity Grenades are a shining example of superior Red Dragon Technology.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Ammunition: Singularity Grenade\nWeapon damage: 172\nDamage type: Impact\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 9 Projectile Weapon","effects":""},{"id":3180,"name":"Singularity Mortar","type":16,"icon":1404,"level":9,"price":2654730,"stack":1,"description":"The Blacksun Singularity Mortar create powerful gravity fields that hamper the movements of the enemy. The gravity field also assists the ship it is equipped on by reducting inertia.\nRequires Gravity Link Level 5 ","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Ammunition: Singularity Grenade\nEnergy use: 40\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 9 Projectile Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 3700\nReload (sec): 3.8\nRounds per shot: 1","effects":"Decrease Speed (Activated)\nDecrease ship top speed by 32.00 for 180 seconds to enemy when activated.\n\nDecrease Maneuverability (Activated)\nDecreases turn rate by 40.0%  for 180 seconds to enemy when activated.\n\nImproved Gravity Link (Equip)\nImproves Gravity Links by 4.85 Skill Level(s) when equipped.\n\nIncrease Maneuverability (Equip)\nIncreases turn rate by 74% when equipped.\n\nIncrease Speed (Equip)\nIncreases ship top speed by 180 when equipped."},{"id":5675,"name":"Six Tung Tile","type":13,"icon":1937,"level":2,"price":633,"stack":60,"description":"A game tile from a  Red Dragon Mah Jong Game.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":1110,"name":"Skofnung","type":14,"icon":1388,"level":7,"price":472411,"stack":1,"description":"A ferocious beam dropped by Thorgil, the leader of the Einherjar. It was passed down for generations for its killing ability and helpful bonuses.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Weapon damage: 32\nDamage type: Energy\nEnergy use: 14\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 7 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1800\nReload (sec): 1","effects":"Deflect Energy (Equip)\n+30 Energy Deflect when equipped."},{"id":3505,"name":"Skystone","type":13,"icon":1468,"level":5,"price":5640,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Raw Skystone","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":2461,"name":"Slagged Oni Communication Device","type":11,"icon":1995,"level":9,"price":716,"stack":1,"description":"...Zeh Len...calls...agony...Rescue will be...We come..speak...Vasarugi...","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 9 Device Tech","effects":""},{"id":815,"name":"Sleeping Cheetah","type":14,"icon":768,"level":3,"price":13846,"stack":1,"description":"When equipped. the Getco Cheetah gives increased Hacking Skill but slightly reduced Ship Warp Speed.\nGETCo: Continuing our 500 year tradition of sustainable development. ","manufacturer":"GETco","stats":"Weapon damage: 30\nDamage type: Plasma\nEnergy use: 63\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 3 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1100\nReload (sec): 7","effects":"Improved Hacking (Equip)\nImproves Hacking Success by 34% when equipped.\n\nSlow Warp (Equip)\nReduces warp speed by 250.00 when equipped."},{"id":972,"name":"Sleeping Great Dane","type":14,"icon":774,"level":5,"price":70294,"stack":1,"description":"When equipped the GETCo Great Dane gives increased Recharge Shields Skill but increases Missile Energy Cost.\nGETCo: Continuing our 500 year tradition of sustainable development.","manufacturer":"GETco","stats":"Weapon damage: 91\nDamage type: Plasma\nEnergy use: 92\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 5 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1400\nReload (sec): 9","effects":"Missle Friction (Equip)\nIncrease Missile Energy Cost by 10.00% when equipped.\n\nRecharge Shields Skill (Equip)\nIncreases Recharge Shields Effectiveness by 1.67 Skill Level(s) when equipped."},{"id":3194,"name":"Sleeping Kelpie","type":7,"icon":870,"level":2,"price":5412,"stack":1,"description":"GETCo: Continuing our 500 year tradition of sustainable development.\nWhen equipped this item gives a faster equip time for ship components.","manufacturer":"GETco","stats":"Skill required: Reactor Tech\nRequirement: Level 2 Reactor Tech\nReactor capacity: 196\nReactor recharge / sec: 7.2","effects":"Equipment Engineering (Equip)\nReduces equipment install time by 30% when equipped."},{"id":934,"name":"Sleeping Lion","type":14,"icon":774,"level":5,"price":73667,"stack":1,"description":"When equipped, the GETCo Lion gives increased Repair Equipment Skill and to the Ship's Maneuverability.\nGETCo: Continuing our 500 year tradition of sustainable development.","manufacturer":"GETco","stats":"Weapon damage: 50\nDamage type: Plasma\nEnergy use: 48\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 5 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1400\nReload (sec): 4","effects":"Improved Repair Equipment (Equip)\nDecrease repair time by 10.00% when equipped.\n\nIncrease Maneuverability (Equip)\nIncreases turn rate by 36% when equipped."},{"id":945,"name":"Sleeping Mastiff","type":14,"icon":768,"level":5,"price":73667,"stack":1,"description":"When equipped the GETCo Mastiff gives increased Hull Patch Skill and increases the ships tractor beam speed. \nGETCo: continuing our 500 year tradition of sustainable development.","manufacturer":"GETco","stats":"Weapon damage: 70\nDamage type: Plasma\nEnergy use: 65\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 5 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1500\nReload (sec): 6","effects":"Hull Patch Skill (Equip)\nImproves Hull Patch effectiveness by 1.67 Skill Levels when equipped.\n\nFast Tractor Beam (Equip)\nIncreases tractor beam speed by 73% when equipped."},{"id":2503,"name":"Sleeping Tail","type":6,"icon":646,"level":1,"price":2515,"stack":1,"description":"BlackSun tail-class engines are commonly equipped by lowranking Red Dragon Tong members.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Engine Tech\nRequirement: Level 1 Engine Tech\nEngine signature: 1600\nImpulse speed: 62\nWarp speed: 2000\nFree-warp energy / sec: 5.4","effects":""},{"id":3263,"name":"Sleeping Unicorn","type":7,"icon":882,"level":5,"price":66151,"stack":1,"description":"GETCo: Continuing our 500 year tradition of sustainable development.\nWhen activated on a targeted group member, this item gives target an increased warp speed.  When equipped this item gives a faster equip time for ship components.","manufacturer":"GETco","stats":"Skill required: Reactor Tech\nRequirement: Level 5 Reactor Tech\nReactor capacity: 990\nReactor recharge / sec: 18","effects":"Turbo Warp (Activated)\nIncrease Warp Speed by 750 for 1000 seconds when activated.\n\nEquipment Engineering (Equip)\nReduces equipment install time by 45% when equipped."},{"id":5924,"name":"Slime","type":13,"icon":2400,"level":1,"price":381,"stack":60,"description":"Slime, found on many life forms in space.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":682,"name":