: 1","effects":"Turbo Missile (Equip)\nReduces Missile Delay by 40.00% when equipped\n\nMissile Energy Conservation (Equip)\nReduces Missile Energy Cost by 40.0% when equipped.\n\nGreater Energy Feedback (Equip)\nFeeds back 14.3% (up to 27.4) of all energy-based damage to source."},{"id":727,"name":"Smiters - Chemical","type":10,"icon":711,"level":9,"price":416,"stack":200,"description":"Missiles used for the Smiter's Fury","manufacturer":"","stats":"Ammunition: Smiter's\nWeapon damage: 1010\nDamage type: Chemical\nSkill required: Missile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 9 Missile Weapon\nMissile maneuverability: 322\nWeapon range (m): 5800","effects":""},{"id":728,"name":"Smiters - EMP","type":10,"icon":711,"level":9,"price":416,"stack":200,"description":"Missiles used for the Smiter's Fury","manufacturer":"","stats":"Ammunition: Smiter's\nWeapon damage: 1010\nDamage type: EMP\nSkill required: Missile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 9 Missile Weapon\nMissile maneuverability: 322\nWeapon range (m): 5800","effects":""},{"id":729,"name":"Smiters - Explosive","type":10,"icon":711,"level":9,"price":416,"stack":200,"description":"Missiles used for the Smiter's Fury","manufacturer":"","stats":"Ammunition: Smiter's\nWeapon damage: 1010\nDamage type: Explosive\nSkill required: Missile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 9 Missile Weapon\nMissile maneuverability: 322\nWeapon range (m): 5800","effects":""},{"id":730,"name":"Smiters - Plasma","type":10,"icon":711,"level":9,"price":416,"stack":200,"description":"Missiles used for the Smiter's Fury","manufacturer":"","stats":"Ammunition: Smiter's\nWeapon damage: 1010\nDamage type: Plasma\nSkill required: Missile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 9 Missile Weapon\nMissile maneuverability: 322\nWeapon range (m): 5800","effects":""},{"id":5523,"name":"Smoky Particles","type":13,"icon":743,"level":1,"price":279,"stack":60,"description":"This misty vapor smells horrible.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":2724,"name":"Smoldering Dragonfire","typ