ch\nRequirement: Level 5 Engine Tech\nEngine signature: 4400\nImpulse speed: 127\nWarp speed: 3000\nFree-warp energy / sec: 18.9","effects":"Equipment Damage Magnification - Engine (Equip)\nDecreases a engine's effectiveness at sustaining damage by 20% when equipped.\n\nIncrease Maneuverability (Equip)\nIncreases turn rate by 36% when equipped."},{"id":5601,"name":"Snugs 'N Hugs Deluxe Plush Chipper","type":11,"icon":2404,"level":7,"price":397642,"stack":1,"description":"Cuddly Snugs 'N Hugs - A Valentine's Day treat created by  the Elfman Triplets. Give someone a hug today. Lonny, Donny and Gunter Elfman, Inc.","manufacturer":"Play-O","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 7 Device Tech","effects":"Group Hug (Activated)\nIncrease hull damage control by 7% for 1680 seconds when activated."},{"id":5495,"name":"Snugs 'N Hugs Deluxe Plush Sparkles","type":11,"icon":2404,"level":8,"price":998257,"stack":1,"description":"Cuddly Snugs 'N Hugs - A Valentine's Day treat created by  the Elfman Triplets. Give someone a hug today. Lonny, Donny and Gunter Elfman, Inc.","manufacturer":"Play-O","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 8 Device Tech","effects":"Group Hug (Activated)\nIncrease hull damage control by 8% for 1920 seconds when activated."},{"id":5782,"name":"Snugs 'N Hugs Deluxe Plush Twinkles","type":11,"icon":2404,"level":9,"price":1938216,"stack":1,"description":"Cuddly Snugs 'N Hugs - A Valentine's Day treat created by  the Elfman Triplets. Give someone a hug today. Lonny, Donny and Gunter Elfman, Inc.","manufacturer":"Play-O","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 9 Device Tech","effects":"Group Hug (Activated)\nIncrease hull damage control by 9% for 2160 seconds when activated."},{"id":5783,"name":"Snugs 'N Hugs Extra-Plush Dazzles","type":11,"icon":2404,"level":4,"price":22157,"stack":1,"description":"Cuddly Snugs 'N Hugs - A Valentine's Day treat created by  the Elfman Triplets. Give someone a hug today. Lonny, Donny and Gunter Elfman, Inc.","manufacturer":"Play-O","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 4 Device Tech","effects":"Group Hug (Activated)\nIncrease hull damage control by 4% for 960 seconds when activated."},{"id":5152,"name":"Snugs 'n Hugs Extra-Plush Sunny","type":11,"icon":2404,"level":5,"price":65274,"stack":1,"description":"Cuddly Snugs 'N Hugs - A Valentine's Day treat created by  the Elfman Triplets. Give someone a hug today. Lonny, Donny and Gunter Elfman, Inc.","manufacturer":"Play-O","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 5 Device Tech","effects":"Group Hug (Activated)\nIncrease hull damage control by 5% for 1200 seconds when activated."},{"id":5784,"name":"Snugs 'N Hugs Plush Happy","type":11,"icon":2404,"level":2,"price":3957,"stack":1,"description":"Cuddly Snugs 'N Hugs - A Valentine's Day treat created by  the Elfman Triplets. Give someone a hug today. Lonny, Donny and Gunter Elfman, Inc.","manufacturer":"Play-O","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 2 Device Tech","effects":"Group Hug (Activated)\nIncrease hull damage control by 2% for 480 seconds when activated."},{"id":5677,"name":"Soft Dzurai Hide","type":13,"icon":1372,"level":2,"price":574,"stack":60,"description":"A Dzurai hide.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5678,"name":"Soft Dzurai Node","type":13,"icon":1367,"level":2,"price":534,"stack":60,"description":"A Dzurai brain node.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5679,"name":"Soft Dzurai Tentacle","type":13,"icon":1368,"level":2,"price":515,"stack":60,"description":"A Dzurai tentacle.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5680,"name":"Soft Spindle Feelers","type":13,"icon":1368,"level":2,"price":607,"stack":60,"description":"A Spindle feeler.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5131,"name":"Soil","type":13,"icon":2390,"level":2,"price":120,"stack":1,"description":"Large bags of silicon, quartz, humus, moss, pearlite, clay, mica, lime, calcium carbonate, with nutrients and trace elements.  Essential for terraforming and agriculture.\n\nSoil is needed in Kinshasa-Mbali (Aganju, 61 Cygni A System).","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5400,"name":"Soilin' Green","type":13,"icon":741,"level":5,"price":1587,"stack":60,"description":"Because Soilin' Green is really purple.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5109,"name":"Sol Citrus Fruit","type":13,"icon":1289,"level":2,"price":162,"stack":1,"description":"The most delicious and prized fruits in the galaxy are still grown in the orchards of Earth from ancient stocks, shipped fresh, and never frozen or genetically enhanced.\n\nSol Citrus Fruit is needed at EarthCorps Command (Zweihander, Alpha Centauri).","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5321,"name":"Sol Drive Waste","type":13,"icon":145,"level":3,"price":277,"stack":1,"description":"For some reason waste from Terran reactors produces a unique concoction of chemicals than other types. This soup can be  tools refined for purposes that typical waste cannot.\n\nThe labs on Tokai Saikutsu can refine this material best.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5110,"name":"Sol Grain","type":13,"icon":1378,"level":4,"price":890,"stack":1,"description":"Whole grains are still essential for proper nutrition. The highest quality grains are still grown on Earth on the plains of Kansas and Russia.\n\nSol Grain is in high demand at Porvenir Mons (Planet Endriago, Gallina System).","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5322,"name":"Sol News Updates","type":13,"icon":1281,"level":1,"price":35,"stack":1,"description":"News local to the Sol System. It is published by a branch of Net-7 News.\n\nThe team at Net-7 Station will be looking forward to recieveing these updates so the news can be redistributed accurately, fairly and honestly.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5743,"name":"Solar Array","type":11,"icon":925,"level":4,"price":9624,"stack":10,"description":"A strange device used to capture the power of the sun.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 4 Device Tech","effects":""},{"id":1482,"name":"Solar Cell","type":13,"icon":1931,"level":5,"price":157689,"stack":240,"description":"A silicon disc coated with a non-reflective substance and covered with a protective glass sheet.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5431,"name":"Solar Debris","type":13,"icon":729,"level":1,"price":425,"stack":60,"description":"Someone has been gathering up space debris.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3475,"name":"Solar FlexiGlass","type":13,"icon":1481,"level":4,"price":2506,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Solar Sweet Oil","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3923,"name":"Solar Panel","type":13,"icon":1478,"level":4,"price":568678,"stack":20,"description":"An array of solar cells contained within a frame.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":1554,"name":"Solar Panel Array","type":13,"icon":1478,"level":6,"price":1660170,"stack":240,"description":"A pair of solar panels have been aligned and then permanently affixed together using concrete.","manufacturer":"Bogeril","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5271,"name":"Solar Panel Construction Manual","type":11,"icon":1381,"level":1,"price":980,"stack":1,"description":"This data diskette contains information and schematics for building solar panels. The full title is: \"Solar Panel Construction - Tips & Techniques\" by Dr. Zachariah Garrett.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 1 Device Tech","effects":"Integrate Schematic (Activated)\nIntegrates the schematic for the %word% into your build computer."},{"id":2926,"name":"Solar Sweet Oil","type":13,"icon":1485,"level":4,"price":63,"stack":300,"description":"Refines to: Solar FlexiGlass","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3534,"name":"Solaris Solarshield","type":13,"icon":189,"level":6,"price":7753,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Stygian Blackwater","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":862,"name":"Soldier's Clipper","type":14,"icon":765,"level":4,"price":27590,"stack":1,"description":"\"BlackSun Beam Weapon.\nExperimental Weapon.  Use at own risk.\"\n","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Weapon damage: 8\nDamage type: Energy\nEnergy use: 10\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 4 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1200\nReload (sec): 1","effects":"Deflect Explosive (Equip)\n+26 Explosive Deflect when equipped."},{"id":1066,"name":"Soulfire","type":14,"icon":1388,"level":7,"price":1094929,"stack":1,"description":"Brilliant power courses up and down the length of this weapon.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Weapon damage: 66\nDamage type: Energy\nEnergy use: 32\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 7 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1700\nReload (sec): 2","effects":"Increase Shield Capacity (Equip)\n+6300 Shield Capacity when equipped.\n\nTurbo Beam (Equip)\nReduces Beam Delay by 26.0% when equipped."},{"id":1120,"name":"Soulfire Curse","type":14,"icon":1388,"level":8,"price":2517925,"stack":1,"description":"Brilliant power courses up and down the length of this weapon.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Weapon damage: 107\nDamage type: Energy\nEnergy use: 38\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 8 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1800\nReload (sec): 2","effects":"Increase Shield Capacity (Equip)\n+6600 Shield Capacity when equipped.\n\nTurbo Beam (Equip)\nReduces Beam Delay by 29.0% when equipped."},{"id":3339,"name":"Source of Despair","type":7,"icon":882,"level":8,"price":1368194,"stack":1,"description":"A fragment of Ancient technology.\n","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Reactor Tech\nRequirement: Level 8 Reactor Tech\nReactor capacity: 4246\nReactor recharge / sec: 40.5","effects":"See Cloaked (Equip)\nAllows a ships scanners to detect cloaked objects when equipped."},{"id":3244,"name":"Source of Inspiration","type":7,"icon":878,"level":4,"price":33556,"stack":1,"description":"Loremaster Daiki-ya bestows this reactor upon her most favored apprentices. In addition to standard reactor equipment, it has extra circuits to increase reactor energy regenerations,","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Reactor Tech\nRequirement: Level 4 Reactor Tech\nReactor capacity: 834\nReactor recharge / sec: 15.7","effects":"Recharge Reactor (Equip)\n+3.5 Reactor Recharge when equipped.\n\nReduce Ship Signature (Equip)\nGives a ship 33% less radar footprint when equipped.\n\nImproved Cloaking (Equip)\nReduces Cloaking Engage Time by 2.3 seconds (to a minimum of 3 seconds), makes the target harder to detect with See Cloaking, and increases Stealth Strike time when equipped."},{"id":5306,"name":"Souvenirs","type":13,"icon":158,"level":3,"price":355,"stack":1,"description":"Souvenirs. Brickabrack. Knickknacks. All the little parephenalia that makes life bearable, knowing you have the complete collection of the newest crystal, porcelean or percious metal what-have-you. \n\nThese items are consumed in great quantity from Mercury station.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5277,"name":"Soy Ration Bars","type":13,"icon":1378,"level":2,"price":120,"stack":1,"description":"Cheap and delicious rations for the troops. 50% Soy, 100% amazing.\n\nSoy Ration Bars are wanted at Yasuragi (Planet Swooping Eagle, Sirius System).","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":622,"name":"SP21R4F1NG2R","type":10,"icon":681,"level":5,"price":14,"stack":180,"description":"2MP4W2R3NGTH2S2NT3N1L","manufacturer":"Vrix","stats":"Ammunition: SP21R\nWeapon damage: 130\nDamage type: Plasma\nSkill required: Missile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 5 Missile Weapon\nMissile maneuverability: 220\nWeapon range (m): 5100","effects":""},{"id":5956,"name":"Space Parasite","type":13,"icon":1368,"level":6,"price":1741,"stack":60,"description":"These common pests often infest larger space creatures, feeding off their blood.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5120,"name":"Spacebite Cures","type":13,"icon":1379,"level":1,"price":59,"stack":1,"description":"Space Herpes... how disgusting!  Cures bites quickly and mostly painlessly, avoiding the unpleasant aftermath.\n\nFor some strange reason, Chernovog Station (Aragoth Prime, Aragoth System), and Loki Station (High Earth, Sol System, Traders only!) have had a high demand for these recently.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":6094,"name":"Spare Parts","type":13,"icon":740,"level":1,"price":800,"stack":80,"description":"Leftover parts from broken equipment.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5332,"name":"Sparta Impact Archos Threading Machine","type":11,"icon":736,"level":8,"price":957642,"stack":1,"description":"Sparta! When the call comes, be ready.\nInsert Sparta Machine Impact Archos Rounds into the hopper. Output is viable for Sparta Archos launchers only.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 8 Device Tech","effects":"Create Impact Archos (Activated)"},{"id":3914,"name":"Sparta K-Tech Plasma Cartridge","type":13,"icon":1472,"level":2,"price":65,"stack":20,"description":"For use in the assembly of Sparta Machines Archos Rounds. Sparta! When the Call comes, be ready.","manufacturer":"Sparta","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5334,"name":"Sparta Machined Impact Archos Rounds","type":13,"icon":1491,"level":8,"price":15247,"stack":240,"description":"For use in the Sparta Archos Threading Machine. Sparta! When the Call comes be ready.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5145,"name":"Sparta Machined Plasma Archos Rounds","type":13,"icon":1491,"level":8,"price":15247,"stack":240,"description":"For use in the Sparta Archoes Threading Machine. Sparta! When the Call comes, be ready.\n","manufacturer":"Sparta","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5333,"name":"Sparta Plasma Archos Threading Machine","type":11,"icon":736,"level":8,"price":957642,"stack":1,"description":"Sparta! When the call comes, be ready.\nInsert Sparta Machine Plasma Archos Rounds into the hopper. Output is viable for Sparta Archos launchers only.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 8 Device Tech","effects":"Create Plasma Archos (Activated)\nnone"},{"id":3913,"name":"Sparta Prefabricated Casing","type":13,"icon":1472,"level":8,"price":163931,"stack":240,"description":"For use in the assembly of Sparta Machined Archos Rounds. Sparta! When the Call comes, be ready.","manufacturer":"Sparta","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5144,"name":"Sparta Prefabricated Slugs","type":13,"icon":1491,"level":8,"price":154897,"stack":240,"description":"For use in the assembly of Sparta Machined Archos Rounds. Sparta! When the Call comes, be ready.\n","manufacturer":"Sparta","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5981,"name":"Special Medical Equipment","type":13,"icon":1379,"level":2,"price":120,"stack":1,"description":"Special Medical Equipement, which is packed for delivery to Androzari Station in Menorb Sector, Castor System.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5387,"name":"Specialized Build Computer v1.0 R 3","type":11,"icon":678,"level":3,"price":9396,"stack":1,"description":"Created by the Jenquarum to serve as a reward for those valiant souls who aided in the healing of the shear.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 3 Device Tech","effects":"Improved Build Reactors Minor (Equip)\nIncreases Build Reactors Skill by 0.10 levels when equipped."},{"id":5388,"name":"Specialized Build Computer v1.0 R 4","type":11,"icon":678,"level":4,"price":23571,"stack":1,"description":"Created by the Jenquarum to serve as a reward for those valiant souls who aided in the healing of the shear.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 4 Device Tech","effects":"Improved Build Reactors Minor (Equip)\nIncreases Build Reactors Skill by 