ponic farm.\n\nThese hot items are wanted on Prasad station.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":2067,"name":"Spiderweb L5","type":11,"icon":1014,"level":5,"price":55947,"stack":1,"description":"GetCo: Continuing our 500 year tradition of sustainable development.\nWhen activated on a targeted enemy, this item causes a decrease to targets warp speed.\nWhen equipped this item causes a small increase to your warp cost but gives a decrease to your warp recovery time.","manufacturer":"GETco","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 5 Device Tech","effects":"Slow Warp (Activated)\nDecreases warp speed by 950.00 for 120 seconds to enemy when activated.\n\nWarp Charge (Equip)\nDecreases warp engage/cooldown times by 32% when equipped.\n\nIncrease Warp Cost (Equip)\n10% more energy used to engage warp when equipped."},{"id":2153,"name":"Spiderweb L6","type":11,"icon":1014,"level":6,"price":139343,"stack":1,"description":"GETCo:  Continuing our 500 year tradition of sustainable development.\nWhen activated on a targeted enemy this item causes a decrease to the targets warp speed.\nWhen equipped this item causes a small increase to your warp cost, but gives a decrease to your warp recovery time.","manufacturer":"GETco","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 6 Device Tech","effects":"Slow Warp (Activated)\nDecreases warp speed by 1070.00 for 144 seconds to enemy when activated.\n\nWarp Charge (Equip)\nDecreases warp engage/cooldown times by 37% when equipped.\n\nIncrease Warp Cost (Equip)\n10% more energy used to engage warp when equipped."},{"id":2242,"name":"Spiderweb L7","type":11,"icon":1017,"level":7,"price":391547,"stack":1,"description":"GETCo: Continuing our 500 year tradition of sustainable development. \nWhen activated on a targeted enemy this item causes a decrease to the targets warp speed. \nWhen equipped this item gives a decrease to your warp recovery time.","manufacturer":"GETco","stats":"Skill required: Device Tec