72,"name":"Spooky Chemical Bullet","type":10,"icon":717,"level":6,"price":19,"stack":700,"description":"For use with the Tada-O Spooky Breed PL A1 projectile launcher.  Tada-O Corporation Tada-O! Big! Strong! Wow!","manufacturer":"Tada-O","stats":"Ammunition: Spooky Bullet\nWeapon damage: 32\nDamage type: Chemical\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 6 Projectile Weapon","effects":""},{"id":673,"name":"Spooky Plasma Bullet","type":10,"icon":717,"level":6,"price":19,"stack":700,"description":"For use with the Tada-O Spooky Breed PL A1 projectile launcher.  Tada-O Corporation Tada-O! Big! Strong! Wow!\nThe Spooky plasma projectile will drain your target's shields over a period of time.","manufacturer":"Tada-O","stats":"Ammunition: Spooky Bullet\nWeapon damage: 32\nDamage type: Plasma\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 6 Projectile Weapon","effects":""},{"id":944,"name":"Spotted Jackal","type":14,"icon":768,"level":5,"price":66300,"stack":1,"description":"GETCo: Continuing our 500 year tradition of sustainable development. ","manufacturer":"","stats":"Weapon damage: 70\nDamage type: Plasma\nEnergy use: 65\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 5 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1500\nReload (sec): 6","effects":""},{"id":952,"name":"Sprinting Cheetah","type":14,"icon":768,"level":5,"price":93894,"stack":1,"description":"When equipped, the GETCo Cheetah gives increased Hacking Skill but slightly reduces Ship Warp Speed. GETCo: Continuing our 500 year tradition of sustainable development. ","manufacturer":"GETco","stats":"Weapon damage: 78\nDamage type: Plasma\nEnergy use: 85\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 5 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1300\nReload (sec): 7","effects":"Improved Hacking (Equip)\nImproves Hacking Success by 50% when equipped.\n\nSlow Warp (Equip)\nReduces warp speed by 250.00 when equipped."},{"id":1421,"name":"STABLE STRUCTURE","type":13,"icon":1492,"level":4,"price":4220,"stack":240,"descr