26,"name":"Sweetener","type":13,"icon":2326,"level":5,"price":660,"stack":60,"description":"Used to improve the flavour of foods.\nAllergy alert! Contains: eggs, chocolate","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3987,"name":"Symbol of Duty","type":13,"icon":2277,"level":1,"price":267,"stack":1,"description":"A commendation granted to Terrans for acts above and beyond the call of duty.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3988,"name":"Symbol of Honor","type":13,"icon":2278,"level":1,"price":267,"stack":1,"description":"A commendation granted to Jenquai who have acted with valor and honor.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":4007,"name":"Symbol of Loyalty","type":13,"icon":2276,"level":1,"price":267,"stack":1,"description":"A commendation for exceptional loyalty granted to Progen who have performed particularly sensitive tasks for their Primarch. **This is needed for future missions. DO NOT TRASH**","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5181,"name":"Synthesized Crystal","type":11,"icon":185,"level":7,"price":391580,"stack":1,"description":"A crystal manufactured by an unknown process. its structure is reminiscent of mordanite.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 7 Device Tech","effects":"Feed Crystal (Activated)\nAttempts to feed the crystal to an appropriate space-born creature."},{"id":5193,"name":"T2MP4R1L1D1PT4R","type":13,"icon":1498,"level":6,"price":21778,"stack":240,"description":"H5M1NH6BR3DS2C4ND1R6ST1G2","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3922,"name":"T2MP4R1L4D1PT4R","type":13,"icon":1498,"level":6,"price":6011,"stack":20,"description":"T2MP4R1L4D1PT4R","manufacturer":"V'rix","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5194,"name":"T2MP4R1LR23NF4RC3R","type":13,"icon":1498,"level":6,"price":20991,"stack":240,"description":"H5M1NH6BR3DS2C4ND1R6ST1G2","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5195,"name":"T2MP4R1LS4PP4RT","type":13,"icon":1498,"level":6,"price":22008,"stack":240,"description":"H5M1NH6BR3DS2C4ND1R6ST1G2","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":2322,"name":"Tactical Computer Eight","type":11,"icon":998,"level":8,"price":923872,"stack":1,"description":"The Blacksun Tactical Computer's computational power allows pilots much greater awareness of thier surroundings allowing them to spot the enemy faster and employ high speed tactics otherwise impossible.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 8 Device Tech","effects":"Increase Maneuverability (Equip)\nIncreases turn rate by 69% when equipped.\n\nIncrease Speed (Equip)\nIncreases ship top speed by 245 when equipped.\n\nSee Cloaked (Equip)\nAllows a ships scanners to detect cloaked objects when equipped.\n\nScan Boost (Equip)\nAllows ship scanners to see 3660 units farther when equipped."},{"id":6117,"name":"Tada-O Most Delicious Cake Type A","type":11,"icon":2412,"level":2,"price":0,"stack":1,"description":"Exerting considerable flavor. Tada-O","manufacturer":"Tada-O","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 2 Device Tech","effects":"Increase Speed (Activated)\nIncreases ship top speed by 50 for 60 seconds when activated.\n\nIncrease Maneuverability (Activated)\nIncrease turn rate by 50% for 60 seconds when activated."},{"id":2429,"name":"Tail Tucker","type":11,"icon":736,"level":9,"price":589321,"stack":1,"description":"Your Momma is callin' so you best be on your way home before settin' into trouble. This here device will help get you there faster. Run boy!","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 9 Device Tech","effects":"Get on home! (Activated)\nAllows instant transport to Grand Ole Homestead"},{"id":6138,"name":"Tainted Bullybrain","type":13,"icon":1367,"level":9,"price":2892,"stack":60,"description":"The brain of a Tainted Bullywere.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":6140,"name":"Tainted Bullysiphon","type":13,"icon":1375,"level":9,"price":9867,"stack":60,"description":"The siphon of a Tainted Bullywere.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":6139,"name":"Tainted Bullywing","type":13,"icon":1370,"level":9,"price":9827,"stack":60,"description":"The wing of a tainted Bullywere.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5524,"name":"Tainted Remnants","type":13,"icon":1482,"level":1,"price":281,"stack":60,"description":"These chuncks of material appear to be contaminated.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5913,"name":"Takeda Maru Artifact 1","type":13,"icon":733,"level":2,"price":500,"stack":60,"description":"An unexamined artifact from the Takeda Maru.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":2050,"name":"Taniwha's Pride","type":11,"icon":1011,"level":5,"price":59897,"stack":1,"description":"It is rumored that Fan Ao Ning's family fortune came from smuggling slave labor from Earth to the Progen colonies.\n\nWhen equipped this device gives a reduction to your Beam, Projectile, and Missile energy costs. When activated on a targeted enemy, this device causes a reduction to enemy's Impact and Explosive resistances.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 5 Device Tech","effects":"Weaken Impact (Activated)\n-26.0 Impact Deflect for 60 seconds to enemy when activated.\n\nWeaken Explosive (Activated)\n-26.0 Explosive Deflect for 60 seconds to enemy when activated.\n\nBeam Energy Conservation (Equip)\nReduces Beam Energy Cost by 34.0% when equipped.\n\nMissile Energy Conservation (Equip)\nReduces Missile Energy Cost by 34.0% when equipped.\n\nProjectile Energy Conservation (Equip) \nReduces Projectile Energy Cost by 34.0% when equipped."},{"id":3901,"name":"Taniwha's Spit","type":15,"icon":804,"level":5,"price":35647,"stack":1,"description":"Second wife of Jing Leong, Xu Xong Tan's life was spared after swearing loyalty to Shou Tzu.\n\nWhen equipped, this weapon gives a reduction to beam energy costs, and gives an increase to beam weapon ranges and damage.\n\nPlease use Red Dragon's Explosive, Chemical, EMP, or Plasma Spit rockets with this launcher.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Ammunition: New Red Dragon Missiles\nEnergy use: 62\nSkill required: Missile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 5 Missile Weapon\nReload (sec): 9.7\nRounds per shot: 2","effects":"Enhance Beam (Equip)\nIncreases Beam Damage by 33.0% when equipped.\n\nBoost Beam Range (Equip)\nIncreases Beam Range by 37% when equipped.\n\nBeam Energy Conservation (Equip)\nReduces Beam Energy Cost by 40.0% when equipped."},{"id":2589,"name":"Taniwha's Wing","type":6,"icon":957,"level":5,"price":46890,"stack":1,"description":"It is rumored that Fan Ao Ning's family fortune came from smuggling slave labor from Earth to the Progen colonies.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Engine Tech\nRequirement: Level 5 Engine Tech\nEngine signature: 2700\nImpulse speed: 126\nWarp speed: 3250\nFree-warp energy / sec: 17.5","effects":""},{"id":3562,"name":"Tantalum","type":13,"icon":187,"level":7,"price":31592,"stack":60,"description":"Refines from: Tantalum Ore","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3563,"name":"Tantalum Alloy","type":13,"icon":1486,"level":7,"price":5000,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Tantalum Ore (3) and \nDementers Tears (2).","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":2985,"name":"Tantalum Ore","type":13,"icon":1483,"level":7,"price":790,"stack":300,"description":"Refines to: Tantalum","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":1970,"name":"Tape Deck Playing Linnart Skinnert","type":11,"icon":1013,"level":4,"price":23837,"stack":1,"description":"Turn it up!","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 4 Device Tech","effects":"Improved Rally (Equip)\nImproves Rally effectiveness by 1.27 Skill Level(s) when equipped."},{"id":2864,"name":"Tar","type":13,"icon":1485,"level":1,"price":2,"stack":300,"description":"Refines to: Simple Plastic","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":914,"name":"Tatsu's Breath","type":14,"icon":765,"level":4,"price":34522,"stack":1,"description":"Blacksun weapon. Use at own risk. Highly Dangerous.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Weapon damage: 16\nDamage type: Plasma\nEnergy use: 18\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 4 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1400\nReload (sec): 2","effects":"Improved Beam Handling (Equip)\nImproves Beam Accuracy by 1.90 Skill Level(s) when equipped."},{"id":3101,"name":"Tatsu's Curse","type":16,"icon":644,"level":5,"price":41255,"stack":1,"description":"A fanatical warrior, the beautiful Xian Xiang Tai has never shown any interest in starting a family.\n\nWhen equipped this launcher gives a reduction to missile energy costs and increases missile ranges and damage.\n\nPlease use Red Dragon's Impact, Chemical, or Plasma Curse Projectiles with this launcher.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Ammunition: New Red Dragon Ammo\nEnergy use: 19\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 5 Projectile Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 3300\nReload (sec): 2.4\nRounds per shot: 3","effects":"Missile Energy Conservation (Equip)\nReduces Missile Energy Cost by 35.0% when equipped.\n\nBoost Missile Range (Equip)\nIncreases Missile Range by 27% when equipped.\n\nEnhance Missiles (Equip)\nIncreases Missile Damage by 26.0% when equipped."},{"id":1965,"name":"Tatsu's Pride","type":11,"icon":1014,"level":4,"price":23421,"stack":1,"description":"While current politics prevented Shou Tzu from ever officially taking Lu Mu Kai as a concubine, their special bond is no secret.\n\nWhen equipped this device gives a reduction to your Beam, Projectile, and missile energy costs. When activated on a targeted enemy, this device causes a reduction to enemy's Plasma and Energy resistances.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 4 Device Tech","effects":"Weaken Energy (Activated)\n-20.0 Energy Deflect for 60 seconds to enemy when activated.\n\nWeaken Plasma (Activated)\n-20.0 Plasma Deflect for 60 seconds to enemy when activated.\n\nBeam Energy Conservation (Equip)\nReduces Beam Energy Cost by 28.5% when equipped.\n\nMissile Energy Conservation (Equip)\nReduces Missile Energy Cost by 28.5% when equipped.\n\nProjectile Energy Conservation (Equip) \nReduces Projectile Energy Cost by 28.5% when equipped."},{"id":2697,"name":"Tatsu's Spit ","type":15,"icon":804,"level":3,"price":18902,"stack":1,"description":"Wealthy and obsessive, Li Mao Kang contracted BlackSun to build this missle launcher to his demanding criteria.\nWhen equipped this weapon gives a reduction to beam weapon energy cost.\nPlease use Red Dragon's Explosive, Chemical, EMP, or Plasma Spit rockets with this launcher.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Ammunition: New Red Dragon Missiles\nEnergy use: 60\nSkill required: Missile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 3 Missile Weapon\nReload (sec): 12.4\nRounds per shot: 1","effects":"Beam Energy Conservation (Equip)\nReduces Beam Energy Cost by 23.3% when equipped."},{"id":2557,"name":"Tatsu's Wing","type":6,"icon":2177,"level":4,"price":27068,"stack":1,"description":"Wealthy and obsessive, Li Mao Kang contracted BlackSun to build this engine to his demanding criteria. When equipped this engine gives a reduction to the amount of energy it costs to warp. ","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Engine Tech\nRequirement: Level 4 Engine Tech\nEngine signature: 2400\nImpulse speed: 112\nWarp speed: 3000\nFree-warp energy / sec: 12","effects":"Reduce Warp Cost (Equip)\n40% less energy used to engage warp when equipped."},{"id":3645,"name":"Tattered Kimono Shield M2","type":2,"icon":899,"level":2,"price":6084,"stack":1,"description":"Nishido!  Designed to perfection by the greatest of the Shoda-kan Masters.\nWhen activated on a targeted group member, this item gives target added explosive resistance.\nWhen equipped this item gives an increase to your explosive resistance.\nNen ni wa nen o ire yo.","manufacturer":"Nishido","stats":"Skill required: Shield Tech\nRequirement: Level 2 Shield Tech\nShield capacity: 86\nShield recharge / sec: 3","effects":"Deflect Explosive (Activated)\n+20 Explosive Deflect for 96 seconds when activated.\n\nDeflect Explosive (Equip)\n+19 Explosive Deflect when equipped."},{"id":3666,"name":"Tattered Kimono Shield M3","type":2,"icon":899,"level":3,"price":14958,"stack":1,"description":"Nishido!  Designed to perfection by the greatest of the Shoda-kan Masters.\nWhen activated on a targeted group member, this item gives target added explosive resistance.\nWhen equipped this item gives an increase to your explosive resistance.\nNen ni wa nen o ire yo.","manufacturer":"Nishido","stats":"Skill required: Shield Tech\nRequirement: Level 3 Shield Tech\nShield capacity: 216\nShield recharge / sec: 5.5","effects":"Deflect Explosive (Activated)\n+20 Explosive Deflect for 120 seconds when activated.\n\nDeflect Explosive (Equip)\n+23 Explosive Deflect when equipped."},{"id":3694,"name":"Tattered Kimono Shield M4","type":2,"icon":899,"level":4,"price":35121,"stack":1,"description":"Nishido!  Designed to perfection by the greatest of the Shoda-kan Masters.\nWhen activated on a targeted group member, this item gives target added explosive resistance.\nWhen equipped this item gives an increase to your explosive resistance.\nNen ni wa nen o ire yo.","manufacturer":"Nishido","stats":"Skill required: Shield Tech\nRequirement: Level 4 Shield Tech\nShield capacity: 539\nShield recharge / sec: 10.9","effects":"Deflect Explosive (Activated)\n+20 Explosive Deflect for 144 seconds when activated.\n\nDeflect Explosive (Equip)\n+26 Explosive Deflect when equipped."},{"id":5114,"name":"Tau Ceti Fruit","type":13,"icon":1289,"level":2,"price":99,"stack":1,"description":"Tau Ceti Fruits are developed by Infiniticorp scientists and grown in the lush gardens and orchards of Somerled Station. For unknown reasons, they never spoil, making shipping easy and cheap.\n\nEarth Station (Earth, Sol System) trades in fruit varieties.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5294,"name":"Tau Ceti News Updates","type":13,"icon":1281,"level":2,"price":120,"stack":1,"description":"News local to the Tau Ceti System. It is published by a branch of Net-7 News.\n\nThe team at Net-7 Station will be looking forward to receiving these updates so the news can be redistributed accurately, fairly and honestly.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5141,"name":"Tazheranite","type":13,"icon":1481,"level":4,"price":271,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Zirconium Dioxide, Calcium, Titanium.\nA scintillating crystalline \"sand\" with monoclinic, tetragonal, and cubic structures that are temperature dependent.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":1089,"name":"Tearing Fang","type":14,"icon":771,"level":7,"price":516820,"stack":1,"description":"Fang-class beam weapons are extremely rare, as they are crafted only for the most powerful leaders of red Dragon Tongs. Employing ancient technologies only known to the inner most circles, they are highly sought after for their incredible range and accuracy.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Weapon damage: 58\nDamage type: Energy\nEnergy use: 29\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 7 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1800\nReload (sec): 2","effects":"Improved Beam Handling (Equip)\nImproves Beam Accuracy by 2.40 Skill Level(s) when equipped."},{"id":1952,"name":"Telescopium II BISR 3","type":11,"icon":651,"level":3,"price":13523,"stack":1,"description":"Discover the future!  Sundari.\nWhen activated on a targeted friendly this item gives a short term BOOST to target's scan range.","manufacturer":"Sundari","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 3 Device Tech","effects":"ScanRange - BOOST! (Activated)\nGives a ship 8600 more radar range for 10 seconds to target when activated."},{"id":2034,"name":"Telescopium II BISR 4","type":11,"icon":651,"level":4,"price":32577,"stack":1,"description":"Discover the future!  Sundari.\nWhen activated on a targeted friendly this item gives a short term BOOST to target's scan range.","manufacturer":"Sundari","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 4 Device Tech","effects":"ScanRange - BOOST! (Activated)\nGives a ship 9800 more radar range for 10 seconds to target when activated."},{"id":2307,"name":"Telescopium Major BISR 7","type":11,"icon":707,"level":7,"price":603902,"stack":1,"description":"Discover the future! Sundari.\nWhen activated on a targeted friendly this item gives a short term BOOST to target's scan range.\nWhen equipped this item gives a decrease to the amount of damage your devices will take.","manufacturer":"Sundari","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 7 Device Tech","effects":"ScanRange - BOOST! (Activated)\nGives a ship 13400 more radar range for 10 seconds to target when activated.\n\nEquipment Damage Control - Devices (Equip)\nIncreases your devices' effectiveness at sustaining damage by 72% when equipped."},{"id":2410,"name":"Telescopium Major BISR 8","type":11,"icon":707,"level":8,"price":1385139,"stack":1,"description":"Discover the future! Sundari. When activated on a targeted friendly this item gives a short term BOOST to target's scan range. When equipped this item gives a decrease to the amount of damage your devices will take.","manufacturer":"Sundari","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 8 Device Tech","effects":"ScanRange - BOOST! (Activated)\nGives a ship 14600 more radar range for 10 seconds to target when activated.\n\nEquipment Damage Control - Devices (Equip)\nIncreases your devices' effectiveness at sustaining damage by 79% when equipped."},{"id":2126,"name":"Telescopium Minor BISR 5","type":11,"icon":679,"level":5,"price":72891,"stack":1,"description":"Discover the future! Sundari.\nWhen activated on a targeted friendly this item gives a short term BOOST to target's scan range.\nWhen equipped this item causes a small decrease to your scan range, but gives a decrease to the amount of damage your devices will take.","manufacturer":"Sundari","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 5 Device Tech","effects":"ScanRange - BOOST! (Activated)\nGives a ship 11000 more radar range for 10 seconds to target when activated.\n\nEquipment Damage Control - Devices (Equip)\nIncreases your devices' effectiveness at sustaining damage by 58% when equipped.\n\nScan Blind (Equip)\nReduces scan distance by 30.0% when equipped."},{"id":2216,"name":"Telescopium Minor BISR 6","type":11,"icon":679,"level":6,"price":169905,"stack":1,"description":"Discover the future! Sundari.\nWhen activated on a targeted friendly this item gives a short term BOOST to target's scan range.\nWhen equipped this item causes a small decrease to your scan range, but gives a decrease to the amount of damage your devices will take.","manufacturer":"Sundari","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 6 Device Tech","effects":"ScanRange - BOOST! (Activated)\nGives a ship 12200 more radar range for 10 seconds to target when activated.\n\nEquipment Damage Control - Devices (Equip)\nIncreases your devices' effectiveness at sustaining damage by 65% when equipped.\n\nScan Blind (Equip)\nReduces scan distance by 30.0% when equipped."},{"id":2501,"name":"Telescopium Prime BISR 9","type":11,"icon":707,"level":9,"price":3403756,"stack":1,"description":"Discover the future! Sundari.\nWhen activated on a targeted friendly this item gives a short term BOOST to target's scan range.\nWhen equipped this item causes a small decrease to your scan range, but gives a decrease to yor ship's signsture and the amount of damage your devices will take.","manufacturer":"Sundari","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 9 Device Tech","effects":"ScanRange - BOOST! (Activated)\nGives a ship 15800 more radar range for 10 seconds to target when activated.\n\nEquipment Damage Control - Devices (Equip)\nIncreases your devices' effectiveness at sustaining damage by 86% when equipped.\n\nReduce Ship Signature (Equip)\nGives a ship 48% less radar footprint when equipped.\n\nScan Blind (Equip)\nReduces scan distance by 30.0% when equipped."},{"id":3198,"name":"Tempest Heart Reactor","type":7,"icon":873,"level":2,"price":4258,"stack":1,"description":"A reactor of unknown Jenquai technology.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Reactor Tech\nRequirement: Level 2 Reactor Tech\nReactor capacity: 316\nReactor recharge / sec: 8.1","effects":"Beam Energy Conservation (Equip)\nReduces Beam Energy Cost by 20.0% when equipped."},{"id":1022,"name":"Tempting Laser Class K","type":14,"icon":772,"level":6,"price":132820,"stack":1,"description":"When equipped, the Tada-O Tempting Laser Class K gives increased Hacking Skill, increased Rally Skill and increased Repair Equipment Skill.\nTada-O Corporation No1 Most Tempting Laser Class K. You want very much! No 1 Most Tempting Laser Class K special item order only. Evil foreigner will not apply.\nTada-O! Big! Strong! Wow! ","manufacturer":"Tada-O","stats":"Weapon damage: 37\nDamage type: Energy\nEnergy use: 26\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 6 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1600\nReload (sec): 2","effects":"Improved Hacking (Equip)\nImproves Hacking Success by 58% when equipped.\n\nImproved Rally (Equip)\nImproves Rally effectiveness by 1.93 Skill Level(s) when equipped.\n\nImproved Repair Equipment (Equip)\nDecrease repair time by 12.00% when equipped."},{"id":3166,"name":"Ten-Gu Bile Cannon","type":16,"icon":2225,"level":9,"price":2385578,"stack":1,"description":"A semi-organic weapon made using Ten-Gu technology.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Ammunition: Bile Infused\nEnergy use: 40\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 9 Projectile Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 3600\nReload (sec): 2.1\nRounds per shot: 1","effects":""},{"id":2822,"name":"Ten-Gu Bile Launcher","type":15,"icon":2227,"level":9,"price":2402523,"stack":1,"description":"A semi-organic weapon built with Ten-Gu technology.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Ammunition: Bile Drenched\nEnergy use: 151\nSkill required: Missile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 9 Missile Weapon\nReload (sec): 12.6\nRounds per shot: 1","effects":""},{"id":1734,"name":"Ten-Gu Carapace","type":13,"icon":1372,"level":9,"price":686795,"stack":240,"description":"The dense carapace of a Ten-Gu.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":1735,"name":"Ten-Gu Cerebral Cortex","type":13,"icon":1367,"level":9,"price":402892,"stack":240,"description":"The cerebral cortex of a Ten-Gu.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":734,"name":"Ten-Gu Chemical Shards","type":10,"icon":722,"level":9,"price":38,"stack":1200,"description":"Ammunition for the Fury of Ten-Gu","manufacturer":"","stats":"Ammunition: Ten-Gu Shards\nWeapon damage: 172\nDamage type: Chemical\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 9 Projectile Weapon","effects":""},{"id":1736,"name":"Ten-Gu Cranium","type":13,"icon":1376,"level":9,"price":420402,"stack":240,"description":"The skull of a Ten-Gu.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":735,"name":"Ten-Gu Energy Shards","type":10,"icon":722,"level":9,"price":38,"stack":1200,"description":"Ammunition for the Fury of Ten-Gu","manufacturer":"","stats":"Ammunition: Ten-Gu Shards\nWeapon damage: 172\nDamage type: Energy\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 9 Projectile Weapon","effects":""},{"id":736,"name":"Ten-Gu Impact Shards","type":10,"icon":722,"level":9,"price":38,"stack":1200,"description":"Ammunition for the Fury of Ten-Gu","manufacturer":"","stats":"Ammunition: Ten-Gu Shards\nWeapon damage: 172\nDamage type: Impact\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 9 Projectile Weapon","effects":""},{"id":1737,"name":"Ten-Gu Nerve Bundle","type":13,"icon":1368,"level":9,"price":411999,"stack":240,"description":"A bundle of nerves from a Ten-Gu.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":1738,"name":"Ten-Gu Ocular Nerve","type":13,"icon":2165,"level":9,"price":413248,"stack":240,"description":"The ocular nerve of a Ten-Gu.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":1739,"name":"Ten-Gu Ossien Matter","type":13,"icon":1373,"level":9,"price":409546,"stack":240,"description":"A very dense bone found on a Ten-Gu.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":737,"name":"Ten-Gu Plasma Shards","type":10,"icon":722,"level":9,"price":38,"stack":1200,"description":"Ammunition for the Fury of Ten-Gu","manufacturer":"","stats":"Ammunition: Ten-Gu Shards\nWeapon damage: 172\nDamage type: Plasma\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 9 Projectile Weapon","effects":""},{"id":3176,"name":"Ten-Gu Reaver","type":16,"icon":1402,"level":9,"price":2102394,"stack":1,"description":"A weapon that harnesses the raw power of the Ten-Gu.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Ammunition: Ten-Gu Spines\nEnergy use: 34\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 9 Projectile Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 3600\nReload (sec): 2\nRounds per shot: 1","effects":"Enhance Projectiles (Equip)\nIncreases Projectile Damage by 30.0% when equipped.\n\nProjectile Energy Conservation (Equip) \nReduces Projectile Energy Cost by 36.5% when equipped.\n\nScan Boost (Equip)\nAllows ship scanners to see 2880 units farther when equipped."},{"id":1740,"name":"Ten-Gu Rib","type":13,"icon":1369,"level":9,"price":6255,"stack":240,"description":"The rib bone of a Ten-Gu.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":738,"name":"Ten-Gu Spines - Chemical","type":10,"icon":1369,"level":9,"price":38,"stack":800,"description":"Ammo for the Ten-Gu Reaver","manufacturer":"","stats":"Ammunition: Ten-Gu Spines\nWeapon damage: 172\nDamage type: Chemical\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 9 Projectile Weapon","effects":""},{"id":739,"name":"Ten-Gu Spines - Impact","type":10,"icon":1369,"level":9,"p