. VIII","type":11,"icon":988,"level":8,"price":1521260,"stack":1,"description":"Shrug off even the most powerful weapon damage with the new Tolerance Mk. VIII.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 8 Device Tech","effects":"Resist Psionic (Equip)\n+30.0 Psionic Resist when equipped.\n\nDeflect Explosive (Equip)\n+30 Explosive Deflect when equipped.\n\nDeflect Energy (Equip)\n+30 Energy Deflect when equipped.\n\nDeflect Impact (Equip)\n+30 Impact Deflect when equipped."},{"id":3394,"name":"Topaz","type":13,"icon":2360,"level":1,"price":84,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Raw Topaz.\nA transparent gemstone that occurs in a wide variety of colors.  ","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":1360,"name":"Torch Head","type":13,"icon":1495,"level":3,"price":1345,"stack":240,"description":"Hitch this up to a tank of gas for a quick burst of flame.","manufacturer":"Bogeril","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":891,"name":"Torrid Laser Line B2","type":14,"icon":766,"level":4,"price":27242,"stack":1,"description":"When equipped, the Tada-O Torrid Laser Line B2 gives increased Rally Skill.\nTada-O Corporation Tada-O! Big! Strong! Wow!","manufacturer":"Tada-O","stats":"Weapon damage: 33\nDamage type: Energy\nEnergy use: 50\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 4 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1200\nReload (sec): 5","effects":"Improved Rally (Equip)\nImproves Rally effectiveness by 1.40 Skill Level(s) when equipped."},{"id":3426,"name":"Tourmaline","type":13,"icon":1468,"level":2,"price":39,"stack":60,"description":"TRADE GEM\nRefined from: Raw Tourmaline\nAn opaque, multi-colored gemstone.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5295,"name":"Toys","type":13,"icon":2394,"level":2,"price":120,"stack":1,"description":"There was a time when toys were simple wood representations of a vehicle or practically anything. Nowadays a child's toy can clean his room, do his homework or any other amazing feat that would make their life easier. Fragile! Handle with care.\n\nToys are distributed from Mercury Station.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":6014,"name":"Tractor Beam Emitter","type":13,"icon":1495,"level":3,"price":986,"stack":60,"description":"A delicate tractor beam emitter, sans housing.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":1179,"name":"Tractor-Repulser","type":14,"icon":1385,"level":9,"price":2232189,"stack":1,"description":"When Tzu left the Shinwa to join the Red Dragons, he brought with him Jenquai technology that made the Tractor-Repulser possable. The shearing force created by the alternating beam damages shields and reduces hull stability.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Weapon damage: 483\nDamage type: Energy\nEnergy use: 200\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 9 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1800\nReload (sec): 9","effects":"Equipment Damage Magnification - Hull (Activated)\nDecreases a hulls effectiveness at sustaining damage by 40% for 270 seconds to enemy when activated.\n\nShield Drain (Activated)\n-900.0% Shield Recharge for 5 seconds to enemy when activated."},{"id":3296,"name":"Tradesman's Source","type":7,"icon":703,"level":7,"price":596667,"stack":1,"description":"BlackSun Reactor\nExperimental System. Use at own risk.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Reactor Tech\nRequirement: Level 7 Reactor Tech\nReactor capacity: 2733\nReactor recharge / sec: 31.7","effects":""},{"id":1091,"name":"Tranquil Xango","type":14,"icon":776,"level":7,"price":498510,"stack":1,"description":"BlackSun Beam Weapon\nExperimental Weapon. Use at own risk.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Weapon damage: 29\nDamage type: EMP\nEnergy use: 13\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 7 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1500\nReload (sec): 1","effects":"Recharge Reactor (Equip)\n+5.2 Reactor Recharge when equipped.\n\nDeflect Impact (Equip)\n+30 Impact Deflect when equipped."},{"id":912,"name":"Tranquility of the Thous