a! When the Call comes, be ready.\nWhen equipped, it gives an increase to the powerdown skill. ","manufacturer":"Sparta","stats":"Ammunition: Trebuchet\nEnergy use: 59\nSkill required: Missile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 6 Missile Weapon\nReload (sec): 7.3\nRounds per shot: 1","effects":"Improved Powerdown (Equip)\nIncreases Powerdown success by 58.00% when equipped."},{"id":612,"name":"Trebuchet Explosive Missile","type":10,"icon":681,"level":5,"price":107,"stack":150,"description":"For use with the Sparta Trebuchet Missile Launcher.  Sparta!  When the Call comes, be ready.","manufacturer":"Sparta","stats":"Ammunition: Trebuchet\nWeapon damage: 120\nDamage type: Explosive\nSkill required: Missile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 5 Missile Weapon\nMissile maneuverability: 225\nWeapon range (m): 5100","effects":""},{"id":2815,"name":"Trebuchet Max","type":15,"icon":808,"level":8,"price":1010901,"stack":1,"description":"The Sparta Trebuchet Missle Launcher requires the use of the Sparta Trebuchet Missiles. Sparta! When the Call comes, be ready. When equipped, it gives an increase to the powerdown skill. ","manufacturer":"Sparta","stats":"Ammunition: Trebuchet\nEnergy use: 93\nSkill required: Missile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 8 Missile Weapon\nReload (sec): 8.6\nRounds per shot: 3","effects":"Improved Powerdown (Equip)\nIncreases Powerdown success by 74.00% when equipped."},{"id":2741,"name":"Trebuchet Prime","type":15,"icon":808,"level":5,"price":74847,"stack":1,"description":"The Sparta Trebuchet Missle Launcher requires the use of the Sparta Trebuchet Missiles. Sparta! When the Call comes, be ready. When equipped, it gives an increase to the powerdown skill. ","manufacturer":"Sparta","stats":"Ammunition: Trebuchet\nEnergy use: 81\nSkill required: Missile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 5 Missile Weapon\nReload (sec): 11.8\nRounds per shot: 1","effects":"Improved Powerdown (Equip)\nIncreases Powerdown success by 50.00% when equipped."},{"id":2794,"name":"Trebuchet Tria","type":