g gift to Lonny, Donny or Gunter Elfman to open","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":1152,"name":"Wrath of the Forlorn","type":14,"icon":2320,"level":8,"price":1070023,"stack":1,"description":"A fragment of ancient technology.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Weapon damage: 200\nDamage type: Energy\nEnergy use: 68\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 8 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1600\nReload (sec): 4","effects":"Deflect Energy (Equip)\n+30 Energy Deflect when equipped.\n\nDeflect EMP (Equip)\n+30 EMP Deflect when equipped."},{"id":1000,"name":"Wrath of the Kokura","type":14,"icon":1387,"level":6,"price":224502,"stack":1,"description":"A high powered beam weapon used by the Kokura Warriors.","manufacturer":"Kokura","stats":"Weapon damage: 126\nDamage type: Plasma\nEnergy use: 88\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 6 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1600\nReload (sec): 6","effects":"Resist Psionic (Equip)\n+27.0 Psionic Resist when equipped.\n\nReduce Ship Signature (Equip)\nGives a ship 49% less radar footprint when equipped.\n\nBeam Energy Conservation (Equip)\nReduces Beam Energy Cost by 40.0% when equipped."},{"id":3978,"name":"Wreckage Slag","type":13,"icon":729,"level":2,"price":650,"stack":100,"description":"Slag from a wrecked ship that can be sold for a small profit.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3249,"name":"Wyvern's Blood","type":7,"icon":675,"level":4,"price":32401,"stack":1,"description":"The famed Red Dragon Mai Dian Rui was presented with Wyvern's Blood after the Red Dragon Insurrection of 2346.\n\nWhen equipped this reactor gives an increase to your Repair Equipment skill and gives an increase to missile ranges.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Reactor Tech\nRequirement: Level 4 Reactor Tech\nReactor capacity: 943\nReactor recharge / sec: 14.9","effects":"Improved Repair Equipment (Equip)\nDecrease repair time by 12.00% when equipped.\n\nBoost Missile Range (Equip)\nIncreases Missile Range by 24% when equipped."},{"id":839,"name":"Wyvern's Breath","type":14,"icon":765,"level":3,"price":11100,"stack":1,"description":"Malicious and cruel, the infamous Red Dragon Shi Zhi Heng is feared by friend and foe alike.\n\nWhen equipped this beam gives a increase to your beam accuracy and damage.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Weapon damage: 10\nDamage type: Plasma\nEnergy use: 15\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 3 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1300\nReload (sec): 2","effects":"Improved Beam Handling (Equip)\nImproves Beam Accuracy by 1.13 Skill Level(s) when equipped."},{"id":1880,"name":"Wyvern's Claw","type":11,"icon":1011,"level":3,"price":11296,"stack":1,"description":"BlackSun Device\nExperimental Device. Use at own risk.\nWhen activated on a targeted enemy this item causes a decrease to target's EMP resistance.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 3 Device Tech","effects":"Weaken EMP (Activated)\n-22.0 EMP Deflect for 72 seconds to enemy when activated."},{"id":3082,"name":"Wyvern's Curse","type":16,"icon":644,"level":4,"price":33521,"stack":1,"description":"Malicious and cruel, the infamous Red Dragon Shi Zhi Heng is feared by friend and foe alike.\n\nWhen equipped this launcher gives a reduction to missile energy costs and increases missile ranges.\n\nPlease use Red Dragon's Impact, Chemical or Plasma Curse projectiles with this launcher.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Ammunition: New Red Dragon Ammo\nEnergy use: 9\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 4 Projectile Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 3200\nReload (sec): 1.2\nRounds per shot: 1","effects":"Missile Energy Conservation (Equip)\nReduces Missile Energy Cost by 28.5% when equipped.\n\nBoost Missile Range (Equip)\nIncreases Missile Range by 23% when equipped."},{"id":2231,"name":"Wyvern's Dire Assault","type":11,"icon":1017,"level":7,"price":516899,"stack":1,"description":"BlackSun Device.\nExperimental Device. Use at own risk.\nWhen activated on a targeted enemy this item causes a decrease to target's EMP resistance.\nWhen equipped this item gives an increase to your Critical Targetting skill.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 7 Device Tech","effects":"Weaken EMP (Activated)\n-38.0 EMP Deflect for 168 seconds to enemy when activated.\n\nImproved Critical Targeting (Equip)\nIncreases Critical Hits Chance by 13.30% when equipped."},{"id":2330,"name":"Wyvern's Dire Rend","type":11,"icon":1017,"level":8,"price":1204905,"stack":1,"description":"BlackSun Device.\nExperimental Device. Use at own risk.\nWhen activated on a targeted enemy this item causes a decrease to target's EMP resistance.\nWhen equipped this item gives an increase to your Critical Targetting skill.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 8 Device Tech","effects":"Weaken EMP (Activated)\n-42.0 EMP Deflect for 192 seconds to enemy when activated.\n\nImproved Critical Targeting (Equip)\nIncreases Critical Hits Chance by 15.00% when equipped."},{"id":2428,"name":"Wyvern's Dread Gore","type":11,"icon":1017,"level":9,"price":2926170,"stack":1,"description":"BlackSun Device\nExperimental Device. Use at own risk.\nWhen activated on a targeted enemy this item causes a decrease to target's EMP resistance.\nWhen equipped this item causea a small decrease to our scan range, but gives an increase to your Critical Targeting and an increase to your combat speed.\n\n","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 9 Device Tech","effects":"Weaken EMP (Activated)\n-46.0 EMP Deflect for 216 seconds to enemy when activated.\n\nImproved Critical Targeting (Equip)\nIncreases Critical Hits Chance by 16.60% when equipped.\n\nIncrease Speed (Equip)\nIncreases ship top speed by 180 when equipped.\n\nScan Blind (Equip)\nReduces scan distance by 30.0% when equipped."},{"id":2140,"name":"Wyvern's Fell Strike","type":11,"icon":1014,"level":6,"price":107693,"stack":1,"description":"BlackSun Device\nExperimental Device. Use at own risk.\nWhen activated on a targeted enemy this item causes a decrease to target's EMP resistance.\nWhen equipped this item causes a small decrease to your scan range, but gives an increase to your Critical Targeting skill.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 6 Device Tech","effects":"Weaken EMP (Activated)\n-34.0 EMP Deflect for 144 seconds to enemy when activated.\n\nImproved Critical Targeting (Equip)\nIncreases Critical Hits Chance by 11.70% when equipped.\n\nScan Blind (Equip)\nReduces scan distance by 30.0% when equipped."},{"id":2054,"name":"Wyvern's Fell Thrust","type":11,"icon":1014,"level":5,"price":49668,"stack":1,"description":"BlackSun Device.\nExperimental Device. Use at own risk.\nWhen activated on a targeted enemy this item causes a decrease to target's EMP resistance.\nWhen equipped this item causes a small decrease to your scan range, but gives an increase to your Critical Targetting skill.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 5 Device Tech","effects":"Weaken EMP (Activated)\n-30.0 EMP Deflect for 120 seconds to enemy when activated.\n\nImproved Critical Targeting (Equip)\nIncreases Critical Hits Chance by 10.00% when equipped.\n\nScan Blind (Equip)\nReduces scan distance by 30.0% when equipped."},{"id":1964,"name":"Wyvern's Pride","type":11,"icon":651,"level":4,"price":27851,"stack":1,"description":"The legendary device Wyvern's Pride was presented to Fang Ang Nu on her wedding day by a gateful Shou Tzu.\n\nWhen equipped this device gives added protection against Energy, EMP,and Plasma attacks. When activated on a targeted friendly, this device gives friendly extra EMP and Energy resistance.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 4 Device Tech","effects":"Deflect EMP (Activated)\n+20 