imum of 3 seconds), makes the target harder to detect with See Cloaking, and increases Stealth Strike time when equipped.\n\nDevice Energy Friction (Equip)\nIncreases Device Energy Cost by 10.00% when equipped."},{"id":564,"name":"Yellow Dragonfly Explosive Missile","type":10,"icon":682,"level":3,"price":66,"stack":120,"description":"For use with the Nishido Yellow Dragonfly Missile Launcher.\nYoshi no zui kara ten no zoku.\nNishido! Designed to perfection by the greatest of the Shoda-kan Masters.","manufacturer":"Nishido","stats":"Ammunition: Yellow Dragonfly Missile\nWeapon damage: 40\nDamage type: Explosive\nSkill required: Missile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 3 Missile Weapon\nMissile maneuverability: 175\nWeapon range (m): 4700","effects":""},{"id":2695,"name":"Yellow Dragonfly M3","type":15,"icon":810,"level":3,"price":15723,"stack":1,"description":"The Nishido Yellow Dragonfly Missile Launcher requires the use of the Nishido Yellow Dragonfly Missiles.\nYoshi no zui kara ten no zoku.\nNishido! Designed to perfection by the greatest of the Shoda-kan Masters. When equipped, it gives an increase resistance to explosive and impact attacks.","manufacturer":"Nishido","stats":"Ammunition: Yellow Dragonfly Missile\nEnergy use: 58\nSkill required: Missile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 3 Missile Weapon\nReload (sec): 11.3\nRounds per shot: 1","effects":"Deflect EMP (Equip)\n+22 EMP Deflect when equipped.\n\nDeflect Energy (Equip)\n+22 Energy Deflect when equipped."},{"id":2717,"name":"Yellow Dragonfly M4","type":15,"icon":810,"level":4,"price":32354,"stack":1,"description":"Requires the use of the Nishido Yellow Dragonfly Missiles.\nYoshi no zui kara ten no zoku.\nNishido! Designed to perfection by the greatest of the Shoda-kan Masters.\nWhen equipped, it gives an increase resistance to emp and energy attacks.","manufacturer":"Nishido","stats":"Ammunition: Yellow Dragonfly Missile\nEnergy use: 42\nSkill required: Missile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 4 Missile Weapon\nReload (sec): 7.3\nRounds per shot: 1","effects":"Deflect EMP (Equip)\n+24 EMP Deflect when equipped.\n\nDeflect Energy (Equip)\n+24 Energy Deflect when equipped."},{"id":2744,"name":"Yellow Dragonfly M5","type":15,"icon":810,"level":5,"price":82254,"stack":1,"description":"The Nishido Yellow Dragonfly Missle Launcher requires the use of the Nishido Yellow Dragonfly Missiles.\nYoshi no zui kara ten no zoku. Nishido! Desighned to perfection by the greatest of the Shoda-kan Masters.\nWhen equipped, it gives an increase resistance to explosive and impact attacks.","manufacturer":"Nishido","stats":"Ammunition: Yellow Dragonfly Missile\nEnergy use: 60\nSkill required: Missile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 5 Missile Weapon\nReload (sec): 9.2\nRounds per shot: 2","effects":"Deflect EMP (Equip)\n+27 EMP Deflect when equipped.\n\nDeflect Energy (Equip)\n+27 Energy Deflect when equipped."},{"id":6107,"name":"Yellow Glowing Sphere","type":13,"icon":1935,"level":3,"price":180,"stack":1,"description":"A smooth mathematically perfect sphere, strangely reminiscent of how oysters shape irritants into pearls. This has a soft almost hypnotic yellow glow.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":931,"name":"Yellow Kirin EMP Laser M5","type":14,"icon":769,"level":5,"price":61530,"stack":1,"description":"The Nishido Yellow Kirin EMP Laser will drain your target's energy as well as its shields. When equipped this laser gives increased Beam Weapon Skill but slightly magnifies direct damage to the Ship's Reactor.\nEn no shita no chikaramochi.\nNishido! Designed to perfection by the greatest of the Shoda-kan Masters.","manufacturer":"Nishido","stats":"Weapon damage: 50\nDamage type: EMP\nEnergy use: 45\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 5 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1400\nReload (sec): 4","effects":"Equipment Damage Magnification - Reactor (Equip)\nDecreases a reactor's effectiveness at sustaining damage by 20% when equipped.\n\nImproved Beam Handling (Equip)\nImproves Beam Accuracy by 1.67 Skill Level(s) when equipped."},{"id":1004,"name":"Yellow Kirin EMP Laser M6","type":14,"icon":769,"level":6,"price":138813,"stack":1,"description":"The Nishido Yellow Kirin EMP Laser will drain your target's energy as well as its shields. When equipped this laser gives increased Beam Weapon Skill but slightly magnifies direct damage to the Ship's Reactor.\nEn no shita no chikaramochi.\nNishido! Designed to perfection by the greatest of the Shoda-kan Masters.","manufacturer":"Nishido","stats":"Weapon damage: 81\nDamage type: EMP\nEnergy use: 52\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 6 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1500\nReload (sec): 4","effects":"Equipment Damage Magnification - Reactor (Equip)\nDecreases a reactor's effectiveness at sustaining damage by 20% when equipped.\n\nImproved Beam Handling (Equip)\nImproves Beam Accuracy by 1.93 Skill Level(s) when equipped."},{"id":1074,"name":"Yellow Kirin EMP Laser M7","type":14,"icon":769,"level":7,"price":389648,"stack":1,"description":"The Nishido Yellow Kirin EMP Laser will drain your target's energy as well as its shields. When equipped this laser gives increased Beam Weapon Skill but slightly magnifies direct damage to the ship's reactor.\nEn no shita no chikaramochi.\nNishido! Desiged to perfection by the greatest of the Shoda'kan masters.","manufacturer":"Nishido","stats":"Weapon damage: 129\nDamage type: EMP\nEnergy use: 60\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 7 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1600\nReload (sec): 4","effects":"Equipment Damage Magnification - Reactor (Equip)\nDecreases a reactor's effectiveness at sustaining damage by 20% when equipped.\n\nImproved Beam Handling (Equip)\nImproves Beam Accuracy by 2.20 Skill Level(s) when equipped."},{"id":3399,"name":"Yellow Tazeron","type":13,"icon":1935,"level":1,"price":15,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Raw Yellow Tazeron\nRefines to: Yellow Tazeron Circle","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3400,"name":"Yellow Tazeron Circle","type":13,"icon":1935,"level":1,"price":20,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Yellow Tazeron\nRefines to: Yellow Tazeron Hexagon","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3401,"name":"Yellow Tazeron Hexagon","type":13,"icon":1941,"level":1,"price":30,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Yellow Tazeron Circle.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3222,"name":"Ying-Lung's Blood","type":7,"icon":647,"level":3,"price":15248,"stack":1,"description":"The notorious Red Dragon Deng Kun Huan received this reactor from Jing Leong shortly before Jing's overthrow by Tzu.\n\nWhen equipped this reacror gives an increase to your Befriend skill and gives a reducrion to missile energy costs.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Reactor Tech\nRequirement: Level 3 Reactor Tech\nReactor capacity: 581\nReactor recharge / sec: 11","effects":"Improved Befriend (Equip)\nImproves Befriend Effectiveness by 1.50 Skill Level(s) when equipped.\n\nMissile Energy Conservation (Equip)\nReduces Missile Energy Cost by 23.0% when equipped."},{"id":3064,"name":"Ying-Lung's Curse","type":16,"icon":644,"level":3,"price":11569,"stack":1,"description":"Repugnant Red Dragon He Tou Nu has a well earned reputations as a kill stealer.\n\nWhen equipped this launcher gives a reduction to missile energy costs.\n\nPlease use Red Dragon's Impact, Chemical, or Plasma Curse projectiles with this launcher.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Ammunition: New Red Dragon Ammo\nEnergy use: 12\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 3 Projectile Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 3100\nReload (sec): 2\nRounds per shot: 1","effects":"Missile Energy Conservation (Equip)\nReduces Missile Energy Cost by 29.0% when equipped."},{"id":1876,"name":"Ying-Lung's Pride","type":11,"icon":1014,"level":3,"price":8691,"stack":1,"description":"When equipped this device will conserve the energy used with Beam, Missile and Projectile weapons.\nUpon Activation it will weaken chemical and EMP resists by your enemy!","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 3 Device Tech","effects":"Weaken Chemical (Activated)\n-20.0 Chemical Deflect for 62 seconds to enemy when activated.\n\nWeaken EMP (Activated)\n-20.0 EMP Deflect for 62 seconds to enemy when activated.\n\nBeam Energy Conservation (Equip)\nReduces Beam Energy Cost by 24.0% when equipped.\n\nMissile Energy Conservation (Equip)\nReduces Missile Energy Cost by 24.0% when equipped.\n\nProjectile Energy Conservation (Equip) \nReduces Projectile Energy Cost by 24.0% when equipped."},{"id":913,"name":"Ying-Lung's Venom","type":14,"icon":782,"level":4,"price":29311,"stack":1,"description":"Right-hand-man to the infamous Tong Tai Fu, Rong Dian Wo enjoys special privileges, as shown by his possession of this fantastic weapon.\n\nWhen equipped this weapon gives a reduction to Projectile weapon energy costs and gives an increase to Projectile ranges.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Weapon damage: 16\nDamage type: Energy\nEnergy use: 18\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 4 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1400\nReload (sec): 2","effects":"Projectile Energy Conservation (Equip) \nReduces Projectile Energy Cost by 27.5% when equipped.\n\nBoost Projectile Range (Equip)\nIncreases Projectile Range by 30% when equipped."},{"id":2537,"name":"Ying-Lung's Wing","type":6,"icon":958,"level":3,"price":10625,"stack":1,"description":"","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Engine Tech\nRequirement: Level 3 Engine Tech\nEngine signature: 2400\nImpulse speed: 97\nWarp speed: 2750\nFree-warp energy / sec: 8.3","effects":""},{"id":3758,"name":"Yokozuna Sumo Shield M7","type":2,"icon":913,"level":7,"price":575432,"stack":1,"description":"Nishido!  Designed to perfection by the greatest of the Shoda-kan Masters.\nWhen activated on a targeted group member, this item gives target added impact resistance.\nWhen equipped this item gives an increase to your impact, EMP, and energy resistances.\nSaru mo ki kara ochiru.","manufacturer":"Nishido","stats":"Skill required: Shield Tech\nRequirement: Level 7 Shield Tech\nShield capacity: 8422\nShield recharge / sec: 106.6","effects":"Deflect Impact (Activated)\n+20 Impact Deflect for 1400 seconds when activated.\n\nDeflect Impact (Equip)\n+30 Impact Deflect when equipped.\n\nDeflect EMP (Equip)\n+30 EMP Deflect when equipped.\n\nDeflect Energy (Equip)\n+30 Energy Deflect when equipped."},{"id":3789,"name":"Yokozuna Sumo Shield M8","type":2,"icon":913,"level":8,"price":1292705,"stack":1,"description":"Nishido!  Designed to perfection by the greatest of the Shoda-kan Masters.\nWhen activated on a targeted group member, this item gives target added impact resistance.\nWhen equipped this item gives an increase to your impact, EMP, and energy resistances.\nSaru mo ki kara ochiru.","manufacturer":"Nishido","stats":"Skill required: Shield Tech\nRequirement: Level 8 Shield Tech\nShield capacity: 21057\nShield recharge / sec: 236.8","effects":"Deflect Impact (Activated)\n+20 Impact Deflect for 1600 seconds when activated.\n\nDeflect Impact (Equip)\n+32 Impact Deflect when equipped.\n\nDeflect EMP (Equip)\n+32 EMP Deflect when equipped.\n\nDeflect Energy (Equip)\n+32 Energy Deflect when equipped."},{"id":3810,"name":"Yokozuna Sumo Shield M9","type":2,"icon":913,"level":9,"price":2867132,"stack":1,"description":"Nishido!  Designed to perfection by the greatest of the Shoda-kan Masters.\nWhen activated on a targeted group member, this item gives target added impact resistance.\nWhen equipped this item gives an increase to your impact, EMP, and energy resistances.\nSaru mo ki kara ochiru.","manufacturer":"Nishido","stats":"Skill required: Shield Tech\nRequirement: Level 9 Shield Tech\nShield capacity: 52639\nShield recharge / sec: 532.7","effects":"Deflect Impact (Activated)\n+20 Impact Deflect for 1800 seconds when activated.\n\nDeflect Impact (Equip)\n+34 Impact Deflect when equipped.\n\nDeflect EMP (Equip)\n+34 EMP Deflect when equipped.\n\nDeflect Energy (Equip)\n+34 Energy Deflect when equipped."},{"id":5903,"name":"Your Call Forward","type":11,"icon":2082,"level":1,"price":1428,"stack":1,"description":"Your genetic material has been incorperaated into this biostruct. With this device equipped you may attempt to reiterate yourself.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 1 Device Tech","effects":"Call Yourself Forward (Activated)\nnone"},{"id":3825,"name":"Yttrium","type":13,"icon":1935,"level":1,"price":125,"stack":60,"description":"This may be a simple crystal, you are uncertain.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5781,"name":"Yum-O-Rum","type":13,"icon":741,"level":5,"price":324,"stack":1,"description":"\"Yo Ho Ho and a Bottle of Rum.\"","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5000,"name":"Yumm-O Beer","type":12,"icon":741,"level":1,"price":58,"stack":1,"description":"Yumm-O Beer is Tada-O-Yumm-O-Liscious! \n\n**Caution, drinking Yumm-O Beer and operating a space craft is not just a crime... it's also fun!**","manufacturer":"Tada-O","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5001,"name":"Yumm-O Vodka","type":12,"icon":741,"level":2,"price":162,"stack":1,"description":"Yumm-O Vodka is Tada-O-Yumm-O-Liscious! \n\n**Caution, drinking Yumm-O Vodka and operating a space craft is not just a crime... it's also fun!**","manufacturer":"Tada-O","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":5173,"name":"Yunieon Gas","type":13,"icon":193,"level":8,"price":980,"stack":300,"description":"Refines to: Liquid Yunieon\n\nA terribly foul-smelling yellow gas that is fortunately very rare.","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":3510,"name":"Zalmoxium","type":13,"icon":1486,"level":5,"price":1135,"stack":60,"description":"Refined from: Zalmoxium Ore","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":2947,"name":"Zalmoxium Ore","type":13,"icon":1483,"level":5,"price":28,"stack":300,"description":"Refines to: Zalmoxium","manufacturer":"","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":1875,"name":"Zalty's Pride","type":11,"icon":651,"level":3,"price":8561,"stack":1,"description":"Daughter of the infamous Red Dragon Fang Ang Nu. Fang Ang Nai enjoys Shou Tzu's favor as shown by her possession of this famous device.\n\nWhen equipped this device grants its user increased resistances to Energy, Chem, and Plasma. When activated on a targeted friendly, this device gives friendly increased Chem and Plasma resistance.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 3 Device Tech","effects":"Deflect Chemical (Activated)\n+20 Chemical Deflect for 600 seconds when activated.\n\nDeflect Plasma (Activated)\n+20 Plasma Deflect for 600 seconds when activated.\n\nDeflect Chemical (Equip)\n+23 Chemical Deflect when equipped.\n\nDeflect Energy (Equip)\n+23 Energy Deflect when equipped.\n\nDeflect Plasma (Equip)\n+23 Plasma Deflect when equipped."},{"id":838,"name":"Zalty's Venom","type":14,"icon":765,"level":3,"price":12348,"stack":1,"description":"Blacksun weapon. Use at own risk. Highly Dangerous.","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Weapon damage: 10\nDamage type: Energy\nEnergy use: 15\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 3 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1300\nReload (sec): 2","effects":"Projectile Energy Conservation (Equip) \nReduces Projectile Energy Cost by 22.5% when equipped."},{"id":2548,"name":"Zalty's Wing","type":6,"icon":961,"level":3,"price":9986,"stack":1,"description":"","manufacturer":"Blacksun","stats":"Skill required: Engine Tech\nRequirement: Level 3 Engine Tech\nEngine signature: 3300\nImpulse speed: 99\nWarp speed: 2500\nFree-warp energy / sec: 10","effects":""},{"id":865,"name":"Zapping EMP Beam AB","type":14,"icon":670,"level":4,"price":27242,"stack":1,"description":"The Tada-O Zapping EMP Beam AB will drain your target's energy as well as its shields. When equipped, the Tada-O Zapping EMP Beam AB gives the Ship increased Warp Recovery and Reduced Warp Cost\nTada-O! Big! Strong! Wow!","manufacturer":"Tada-O","stats":"Weapon damage: 15\nDamage type: EMP\nEnergy use: 20\nSkill required: Beam Weapon\nRequirement: Level 4 Beam Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 1300\nReload (sec): 2","effects":"Warp Charge (Equip)\nDecreases warp engage/cooldown times by 23% when equipped.\n\nReduce Warp Cost (Equip)\n36% less energy used to engage warp when equipped."},{"id":1763,"name":"Zeke's Contraption","type":11,"icon":2164,"level":1,"price":708,"stack":1,"description":"Created by Zeke Garrett, this first attempt at building the \"dee-vise of retrybushan\" has gone astray.  It blinks and shimmers and might be useful for something else.  Maw always said waste not want not.","manufacturer":"Zeke","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 1 Device Tech","effects":"Equipment Damage Magnification - Weapons (Equip)\nDecreases a weapon's effectiveness at sustaining damage by 20% when equipped.\n\nSee Cloaked (Equip)\nAllows a ships scanners to detect cloaked objects when equipped."},{"id":1270,"name":"Zeke's Experimantal Solar Apparatus","type":13,"icon":726,"level":1,"price":125963,"stack":240,"description":"Under all the duct tape the glow of multi-colored LEDs can be spotted.","manufacturer":"Zeke","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":1271,"name":"Zeke's Folly","type":13,"icon":193,"level":1,"price":1739,"stack":240,"description":"Created by Zeke Garrett, this prototype component of his new and complete dee-vise of retrybushen is particularly shiny. Cannibalizing it for parts might be the best use for it.","manufacturer":"Zeke","stats":"","effects":""},{"id":2617,"name":"Zeke's Solar Sail","type":6,"icon":990,"level":7,"price":625428,"stack":1,"description":"Battered and looking a bit worse for wear this solar sail has been modified by Ezekial Garrett, a Bogeril inventor.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Engine Tech\nRequirement: Level 7 Engine Tech\nImpulse speed: 153\nWarp speed: 3500\nFree-warp energy / sec: 15.9","effects":"Recharge Reactor (Equip)\n+7.1 Reactor Recharge when equipped."},{"id":3177,"name":"Zenrei Cannon","type":16,"icon":848,"level":9,"price":2658743,"stack":1,"description":"This cannon was recovered from parts of the Zenrei Tempest Guardian. Delivers incredible punch per shot.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Ammunition: Zenrei\nEnergy use: 30\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 9 Projectile Weapon\nWeapon range (m): 3800\nReload (sec): 2.2\nRounds per shot: 1","effects":"Turbo Projectile (Equip)\nReduce Projectile Delay by 27.50% when equipped\n\nIncrease Speed (Equip)\nIncreases ship top speed by 234 when equipped."},{"id":2368,"name":"Zenrei Ego Matrix","type":11,"icon":977,"level":8,"price":1146744,"stack":1,"description":"The center of self and aggression. This matrix, when used properly, will enhance your ability to create destructive items.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 8 Device Tech","effects":"Improved Build Weapons (Equip)\nIncreases Build Weapons Skill by 0.51 levels when equipped."},{"id":741,"name":"Zenrei Energy Bolt","type":10,"icon":715,"level":9,"price":40,"stack":700,"description":"Very hard-hitting bolts for the Zenrei Cannon.","manufacturer":"Zenrei","stats":"Ammunition: Zenrei\nWeapon damage: 172\nDamage type: Energy\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 9 Projectile Weapon","effects":""},{"id":3767,"name":"Zenrei Force Matrix","type":2,"icon":916,"level":8,"price":1023591,"stack":1,"description":"This matrix was recovered from the Zenrei Tempest Guardian. It does a fine job of protecting the user from the slings and arrows of everyday life.","manufacturer":"Zenrei","stats":"Skill required: Shield Tech\nRequirement: Level 8 Shield Tech\nShield capacity: 45776\nShield recharge / sec: 327","effects":"Weaken Explosive (Activated)\n-30.0 Explosive Deflect for 1260 seconds to enemy when activated.\n\nDeflect EMP (Equip)\n+30 EMP Deflect when equipped.\n\nEnhance Missiles (Equip)\nIncreases Missile Damage by 24.7% when equipped."},{"id":2367,"name":"Zenrei Force Projector","type":11,"icon":649,"level":8,"price":958249,"stack":1,"description":"The complex crystalline matrix used by the Zenrei Tempest to focus its shielding around itself can now by used by you to accomplish a similar goal.","manufacturer":"Zenrei","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 8 Device Tech","effects":"Increase Shield Capacity (Equip)\n+9630 Shield Capacity when equipped."},{"id":2369,"name":"Zenrei ID Matrix","type":11,"icon":977,"level":8,"price":1025456,"stack":1,"description":"The center of creativity and desire. Your desire and ability to create devices will be greatly enhanced by equipping this item.","manufacturer":"","stats":"Skill required: Device Tech\nRequirement: Level 8 Device Tech","effects":"Improved Build Devices (Equip)\nIncreases Build Devices Skill by 0.51 levels when equipped."},{"id":742,"name":"Zenrei Impact Bolt","type":10,"icon":715,"level":9,"price":40,"stack":700,"description":"Very hard-hitting bolts for the Zenrei Cannon. These bolts will punch through shields and shatter armor.","manufacturer":"Zenrei","stats":"Ammunition: Zenrei\nWeapon damage: 172\nDamage type: Impact\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 9 Projectile Weapon","effects":""},{"id":743,"name":"Zenrei Plasma Bolt","type":10,"icon":715,"level":9,"price":40,"stack":700,"description":"Very hard-hitting bolts for the Zenrei Cannon.","manufacturer":"Zenrei","stats":"Ammunition: Zenrei\nWeapon damage: 242\nDamage type: Plasma\nSkill required: Projectile Weapon\nRequirement: Level 9 Projectile Weapon","effects":""},{"id":3355,"name":"Zenrei Power Source","type":7,"icon":703,"level":9,"price":3000211,"stack":1,"description":"This organic device was recovered from the remains of the Zenrei Tempest Guardian. It's power generation scheme is, thus far, impossible for human scientists to understand.","manufacturer":"",